&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Anticipated Application Close Date: xx/xx/xx&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:14915,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16316664},&amp;quot;9&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:1907741},&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11}&quot;&gt;For us, equal opportunity means fostering a truly inclusive culture where everyone has the chance to grow and succeed. We don’t just open doors; we invite you to step through and be part of something bigger. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or status as a protected veteran.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-GC1 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to ensure an accessible and inclusive experience for every candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need a reasonable accommodation during the application or interview process under applicable local law, please submit a request via this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScvuS3dAsg2JaXD-BU6OqwFGQAWKy2So9oi27FriN9NzuAUxA/viewform?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Accommodation Request Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.logicmonitor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal. &lt;/a&gt;Please &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.logicmonitor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Pay-Transparency-Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to review LogicMonitor’s U.S. Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to make a real impact and play a meaningful role in the growth of our company?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect at Elastic you will serve as a technical authority and trusted advisor to our sales team, customers, partners and community. You will understand and solve our customer’s business issues with the Elastic Stack, engage the regional Elastic community through events and programs, and enable sales through our Partners. A successful SA at Elastic will be focused on excellence; taking the initiative to improve both themselves and the team through continuous learning and questioning the status quo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Elastic and this Team? “Once I started, I was blown away to realize, what was always so obvious, everything is search. Anything you do with data involves search, every app needs search, even analytics are about search. Daily I am blown away with the types of things our users and customers are doing with search.” &lt;em&gt;Director of Product, Elastic. &lt;/em&gt;“We question the status quo, debate the best ways to accomplish our goals and hold ourselves and our teams to the highest standards of performance. We take pride in our ability to understand our customers needs and make recommendations that are based on extensive global experience across multiple use cases. We learn from our mistakes and losses and celebrate our successes with an eye towards constant improvement. Join this team if you are up for a compassionate, understanding and fair environment where you can really grow into the next phase of your career.” &lt;em&gt;VP WW Solution Architecture, Elastic&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as the technical point of contact for your accounts and account managers in your assigned territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing a deep understanding of customers’ goals and objectives, and articulating how our offerings address their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating and owning value based relationships at all levels in customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participating in all phases of planning and execution for your territory, from initial discovery to the technical win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining a deep understanding of the Elastic products and solutions to demonstrate the value of our offerings in sales meetings, and at events such as meetups and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising the sales team on effective ways of positioning Elastic products, solutions and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarding, educating and enabling our partners, and supporting them in sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating collateral, contributing to programs and collaborating with other Elasticians to meet individual client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being the voice of the customer and community to communicate needs, gaps, and enhancements to our engineering and leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deepening both your sales and technical skills through self driven education while taking advantage of all the professional development opportunities provided by Elastic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of success in a technical presales role within enterprise accounts -- enough experience selling and implementing technology to earn your customer’s trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable ability to articulate and sell the benefits of modern platforms, software and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real passion for being curious and a continuous learner. You are someone that invests in yourself as much as you invest in your professional relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of successful customer relations where you developed an understanding of what made a difference, and devised architectures that helped meet a goal, tackle a problem, or outpace competitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to influence. Have you more than once convinced a team you worked for, of an idea, technology, or architectural pattern?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to inspire groups, both large and small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German is essential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to travel 30% within region, as well as occasionally internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-PF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic Security is one of the fastest-growing parts of our business, and our customers (including government and public sector organisations) rely on our Security Solution to modernise their SOC, threat detection, and response capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the hands-on delivery of Elastic Security projects (new implementations, migrations, and use-case expansions) from discovery through architecture design and build. Along the way, you&#39;ll develop trusted relationships with senior stakeholders and work closely with our Services, Engineering and Sales teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is a remote-first company, but many of the projects you&#39;ll deliver might require onsite availability, making the role hybrid in practice, varying by project, with travel of up to 60%.&lt;br&gt;Some of these engagements, given the organisations involved, also require national security screening or clearance; eligibility to obtain one in your country of employment is a strong advantage, and Elastic will sponsor the process where required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess and Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer goals, pain points, existing architecture, and threat landscape, translating them into technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design Elastic Security solution architectures (SIEM, endpoint, cloud security) that integrate with the customer&#39;s wider security ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the customer&#39;s security strategy and own the Elastic side of it, aligning recommendations through regular sessions with senior and key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement and Deliver&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hands-on delivery of Elastic Security projects end-to-end, including greenfield deployments and migrations from legacy SIEM/EDR platforms in mission-critical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and secure the Elastic platform: cluster architecture, RBAC and role mapping, single sign-on, private connectivity (private links, VPC peering), and hardening for enterprise and government environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and build large-scale data ingestion with Elastic Agent, Beats, and Logstash, normalising data to ECS and integrating sources such as Kafka, Azure Event Hub, and AWS S3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop security content aligned to the customer&#39;s threat landscape: detection rules, dashboards, and alerting workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive security migrations from competing platforms, applying deep knowledge of Elastic&#39;s capabilities to translate each use case into its best form, whether through feature parity mapping or full redesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish detection-as-code practices for customers managing detections programmatically: developing, testing, versioning, and deploying detection content with Python, Git, and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and enable Elastic&#39;s Agentic AI capabilities (AI Assistant, Attack Discovery, agent-driven workflows) to accelerate customers&#39; detection and response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow and Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and deliver new security use cases as customers mature their cyber defence journey with Elastic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver engagements on time and within the agreed Statement of Work (SOW) scope, surfacing opportunities for follow-on work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate confidently with stakeholders from SOC engineers up to CISO / C-suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Elastic Sales and pre-sales to assess technical risks and shape opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed field insight back to Elastic Engineering, Product Management, and Support to drive feature enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and share knowledge with fellow Elastic consultants across a highly distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or assist with demos and proof-of-concepts that showcase the value of the Elastic Stack, and deliver enablement sessions and hands-on workshops that make customer teams self-sufficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring Along&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years&#39; experience as a Consulting Architect, Senior Consultant, or in a senior IT technical leadership role, delivering and executing professional services engagements, ideally in the security domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience deploying Elastic Security or comparable SIEM platforms (e.g., Splunk, MS Sentinel, QRadar, ArcSight) and/or EDR platforms (e.g., CrowdStrike, MS Defender), or at least 2 years as a Security Analyst / Detection Engineer in a threat detection and response role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An architect&#39;s view of the security ecosystem across varied customer environments: SOAR, vulnerability management, penetration testing, ticketing, and security policies, and how they connect in a SOC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills, ideally in Python, and exposure to modern delivery practices such as Infrastructure-as-Code and CI/CD are strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Linux and Windows operating systems, and on-prem and/or public cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer advocacy, relationship-building, and communication skills, with the ability to pivot easily between delivery and strategic engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to obtain national security clearance in your country of employment (screening sponsored by Elastic where required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel and work onsite with customers (up to 60% of the time), combined with comfort working remotely in a highly distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in both English (our company-wide operating language) and the local market language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advanced Elasticsearch operations: cluster architecture, shard management, data ingestion, and data tiering at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with detection-as-code: authoring, testing, and versioning detection content managed in Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating deployments and lifecycle management with Python, Terraform, and CI/CD tooling (e.g., GitLab pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and operating containerised workloads on Kubernetes, cloud-managed or self-hosted (EKS, AKS, GKE, OpenShift)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Agentic AI and LLM-based security workflows: AI assistants, automated triage, and agent-driven investigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Tier-2/Tier-3 SOC Analyst, Threat Hunter, or DevSecOps Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in large distributed environments or MSSPs, from architecture through deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering enablement sessions, technical workshops, or product training to technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elastic Certified Engineer certification, or security certifications such as GIAC or CISSP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-PF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JetBrains &lt;/strong&gt;creates professional tools that make developers more productive and help them focus on what matters. Our websites and web services are a core part of the JetBrains ecosystem. They connect us with users worldwide, power product distribution, support learning, and enable feedback loops at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Developer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our&lt;strong&gt; Web Development team&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will be someone who can take ownership of services end-to-end, from architecture and implementation to deployment and long-term support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop internal company-wide web applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the creation of solution architecture, from selecting approaches to decomposing services and defining their interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain services running in AWS and Kubernetes-based environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tools and platforms for localization workflows and integrate them with third-party systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, and observability of our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other teams to evolve shared infrastructure and internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’ll be happy to have you on our team if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp; 3- 5 years experience in backend web development using Kotlin or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Node.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of modern backend frameworks (e.g. Ktor and Spring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building production-grade systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of distributed-system fundamentals (e.g. networking, fault tolerance, and scalability).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud environments (AWS or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerization and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write clean, maintainable, and well-structured code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to take ownership of systems in production (including by offering support and assisting with continuous improvement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would be especially thrilled if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code (e.g. Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools (e.g. metrics, logging, and tracing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI tools or agents in development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director for Lifecycle, CC Outbound, owns the outbound call center channel strategy and performance for millions of former customers across all 17 of our international markets and all our brands. We are looking for a CRM expert, who is interested in running strategy for Call Center, with a high level of autonomy and agility. You will own the strategic development, performance and strategic innovations for this channel, working closely with the Call Center Operations team. Your scope includes steering performance and managing budgets, implementing strategies that will unlock a better customer experience, under consideration of country-specific idiosyncrasies. It also means developing this channel into one of our prime sources of insight to customer sentiment and inspiration for product improvements at scale (e.g., through the use of AI tools). Moreover, you will own the performance of this channel, which includes setting targets together with our local market CMOs and day-to-day steering of conversions, cost and ROI together with our VP of customer care and his operations managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to own a critical channel for one of our most valuable customer groups and develop a strong muscle in driving CRM strategy and execution, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM Strategy Development:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement annual strategic plans for Call Centre Outbound initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the CC Outbound for the full customer lifecycle, from leads to reactivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with CC Operations, cross-functional teams, local markets and international marketing leadership to align strategies with overall business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalization of Customer Interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with L&amp;amp;D, Brand and local teams to enrich the training for agents, adding the local context, address the customer needs and have the best pitch for the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test personalized offers for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI tools to improve customer interactions and call content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call Centre Outbound Campaign Management:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute outbound communication campaigns. Provide guidance on campaign targeting, messaging, incentives and timing to maximize conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and steer campaign performance, maximizing ROI and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all outbound communication activities comply with relevant regulations and internal expectations (e.g., via quality assurance measures)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis and Tech Tooling:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analysis to identify, test and evaluate impactful reactivation strategies and improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and implement CRM tools to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of outbound initiatives, coordinating with Call Center Operations and CommsTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in and a passion for delivering excellent and effective customer experiences (e.g., working in CRM/Lifecycle Marketing, campaign management, Product, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with an ability to influence and motivate people at all levels within international environments and across a broad variety of job functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mentality and drive to deliver results, including experience with prioritizing for highest impact and managing trade-off decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to derive actionable insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally hands-on experience working with or in Call Centres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally experience in Experimentation/Testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Global Customer Experience (GCX), our mission is to advance the HelloFresh customer relationship from reactive resolution to proactive, trust-building service. The compensation function sits at the heart of that mission: it is the mechanism through which the business acknowledges failures, restores customer confidence, and, when done well, turns a bad experience into a reason to stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director, Customer Compensation &amp;amp; Policy is responsible for the global strategy, architecture, and governance of how HelloFresh compensates customers across all markets and brands. This is not a policy maintenance role. It is a strategic function that sits at the intersection of customer economics, operational data, behavioral experimentation, and cross-functional influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own one of the most financially material and customer-sensitive levers in the business. You will shape a multi-year roadmap and hold peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market Leadership accountable for the quality of inputs that determine how well and how efficiently we recover customer trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate brings a rare combination: analytical rigor sharp enough to architect a global compensation engine from first principles, and the executive presence to drive adoption across a complex, multi-market organization without formal authority over most of the people they need to move.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Global Compensation Strategy &amp;amp; Engine Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategic vision for how HelloFresh categorizes customer errors and determines compensation across all markets, brands, and contact channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and continuous evolution of the compensation engine: along with Tech, you’ll define the the rules, thresholds, segmentation logic, and automation frameworks that govern recovery decisions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the principles that govern trade-offs between customer generosity and cost discipline and translate those principles into operational rules that hold across market complexity and brand variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology to ensure the compensation engine is scalable, auditable, and capable of supporting dynamic, AI-assisted decisioning as the product evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Behavioral Economics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the global roadmap for compensation experimentation: A/B testing across offer types, value levels, channel timing, and segmentation variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply behavioral economics frameworks to compensation design understanding how recovery offers shape long-term retention, repurchase behavior, and brand perception, not just immediate satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement framework for experimentation: what constitutes a successful test, what confidence warrants global rollout, and how results are synthesized into durable policy change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics &amp;amp; Insights to ensure test design, sample integrity, and rollout analysis meet a rigorous standard of evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Stewardship &amp;amp; Cost Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global compensation P&amp;amp;L line: tracking spend by market, error category, customer segment, and channel — and holding yourself accountable to defined cost-per-incident and avoidable-contact targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close financial leakage: cases where compensation is being issued without policy justification, at incorrect values, or at the wrong frequency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting infrastructure that makes compensation economics visible to GCX leadership, market GMs, and Finance — with the granularity and context needed to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the right balance between cost optimization and customer lifetime value investment: not just &#39;spend less&#39; but &#39;spend where it earns back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Policy &amp;amp; Global Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global fraud and abuse prevention framework: the policies, detection logic, thresholds, and escalation paths that protect the business without creating friction for genuine customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the governance rhythm for policy: quarterly reviews, market exception management, escalation adjudication, and framework versioning across a multi-brand, multi-market environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final authority on complex, cross-market policy gaps — resolving ambiguity with speed, consistency, and strategic clarity rather than routing decisions upward by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain global standards while creating principled space for market-level adaptation where local context genuinely requires it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the compensation function in senior forums translating customer economics into requirements that peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market GMs must respond to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold cross-functional partners accountable for the upstream data quality, operational accuracy, and system reliability that the compensation engine depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of policy changes across markets and brands, building communication and change management plans that make new frameworks land — not just launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence at VP and Director level across multiple functions; escalate only strategic blockers, not routine alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or equivalent postgraduate qualification required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Economics, Business, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12 years of progressive experience in customer strategy, pricing, operations, or a directly adjacent domain with meaningful exposure to global, multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of owning a financially significant operational lever and managing it with both analytical precision and strategic judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading and developing teams; comfort operating as a senior individual contributor and a people leader simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in subscription commerce, logistics, or consumer-facing operations strongly preferred. Familiarity with the economics of customer recovery in high-volume, low-margin environments is a distinct advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data analysis; able to build and pressure-test the analytical models that underpin policy decisions without delegating the logic to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with experimentation methodology: test design, statistical significance, holdout analysis, and the translation of results into policy not just reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or alongside engineering teams to define product and system requirements for rules-based or AI-assisted decisioning tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with financial modeling: building the business case for compensation investment, forecasting spend impact, and tracking actuals against plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior executive presence: able to walk into a GM, COO, or CFO conversation with a clear point of view, defend it under pressure, and leave with alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible voice with peers and upward stakeholders not because of title, but because of the quality of analysis and clarity of communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and decisive under ambiguity: able to make a defensible call with incomplete information and adjust as evidence develops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely collaborative across markets and functions able to hold people to standards without damaging the relationships needed to sustain them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minerva is STARK&#39;s command and control software — the brain that connects operators to autonomous systems across multiple domains in real time. The Minerva team is a small, senior software group based in Berlin and Munich, working directly with our systems and hardware teams to build mission-critical C2 capabilities deployed in active operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We move fast, ship real software, and operate under constraints most engineers never encounter — low-bandwidth networks, air-gapped devices, high-stakes decision loops. There is no room for abstraction for its own sake. Everything we build ends up in the hands of real operators in the field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support the development, integration, testing, and operational use of tactical data link capabilities for STARK’s unmanned systems, Ground Control Stations, and wider command-and-control environments. You will help ensure that our systems can communicate reliably and securely with military networks, command posts, allied platforms, and mission systems. A key part of the role is to evaluate, understand, and integrate tactical communication standards and technologies such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, and other military data link solutions. You will translate operational communication requirements into practical integration concepts, test setups, and deployable system configurations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tactical Data Link Integration:&amp;nbsp;Support the integration of tactical data link capabilities such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, and other military communication systems into STARK platforms and Ground Control Station environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Interoperability Concepts:&amp;nbsp;Define and support communication concepts that enable reliable data exchange between unmanned systems, GCS setups, command centers, allied platforms, and external mission systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Requirements Translation:&amp;nbsp;Translate operational and military communication requirements into technical integration requirements, interface definitions, test needs, and subsystem-level implementation concepts.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;System Interface Support:&amp;nbsp;Work with engineering, software, network, RF, modem, antenna, and GCS teams to align interfaces, protocols, data flows, configuration requirements, and integration constraints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;SATCOM &amp;amp; Beyond-Line-of-Sight Support:&amp;nbsp;Support concepts and integration activities for SATCOM, long-range communication paths, and other beyond-line-of-sight connectivity options.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Validation:&amp;nbsp;Plan and support lab tests, field tests, interoperability checks, and validation activities for tactical data link and communication setups.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Security &amp;amp; Reliability:&amp;nbsp;Contribute to secure, robust, and mission-ready communication architectures, considering availability, latency, data integrity, authentication, and operational constraints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Partner Coordination:&amp;nbsp;Work with external suppliers, partners, military stakeholders, and internal teams to assess data link options, integration dependencies, and technical feasibility.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Documentation:&amp;nbsp;Document data link concepts, interface assumptions, configuration settings, integration dependencies, test results, and recommended operational setups in a clear and maintainable way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;Around 5 years of professional experience in tactical communications, military data links, SATCOM, RF systems, communication engineering, systems engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tactical Data Link Knowledge:&amp;nbsp;Practical understanding of military data link technologies such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, or comparable tactical communication systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems Understanding:&amp;nbsp;Ability to understand complex communication architectures involving platforms, radios, antennas, modems, networks, command systems, software interfaces, and operational workflows.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Interoperability Mindset:&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of how different systems exchange data, how interfaces are defined, and how interoperability is tested and validated.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Communication:&amp;nbsp;Ability to translate between operational users, engineering teams, software developers, RF specialists, suppliers, and program stakeholders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Documentation:&amp;nbsp;Experience supporting technical tests, integration trials, validation activities, or operational demonstrations, including structured documentation of results and findings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Problem-Solving Ability:&amp;nbsp;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to identify communication issues, integration gaps, configuration problems, and practical solutions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication:&amp;nbsp;Solid English skills are required. German skills for technical communication, stakeholder alignment, and documentation are a plus.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team Fit:&amp;nbsp;Ability to work collaboratively in a small, cross-functional team and communicate clearly and reliably in fast-moving engineering environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Clearance:&amp;nbsp;Ability to obtain appropriate security clearance required for the position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience in defence, military communications, command-and-control systems, aerospace, naval systems, UAVs, or other mission-critical operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Prior exposure to NATO communication standards, tactical networks, joint fires, air defence, command posts, or battlefield management systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Experience with SATCOM terminals, tactical radios, MANET, IP-based tactical networks, or professional communication equipment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Experience integrating unmanned systems into wider military communication architectures.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Understanding of network security, encryption concepts, authentication, routing, IP networking, and secure data exchange.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a versatile Software Engineer specializing in embedded systems and low-level communication services. In this role, you will drive the development of a mission-critical deployment tool and hardware communication services for specialized operating systems. While being familiar with CI/CD pipelines, your primary focus will be on software development for mission-critical procedures, utilization of agentic AI and Typescript environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Developer for our mission-critical preparation tool: Maintain and evolve the tool built in Typescript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main technical point of contact and support lead for internal teams and customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Agentic AI: As an AI focused company we encourage our employees to leverage our state-of-art AI development infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD Pipeline Management: Work with our automated GitLab CI/CD pipelines for building, testing, packaging, and deploying GCS software components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deploy, and troubleshoot software solutions running on Linux-based systems, particularly Ubuntu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API &amp;amp; Interface Integration: Develop and maintain APIs and software interfaces to integrate radios, networking equipment, hardware components, and external systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Work closely with hardware, network, systems engineering, and GCS integration teams to translate technical requirements into practical software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in software development, software integration, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Languages: Proficiency in Typescript or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Support: Proven track record in maintaining production-critical tools and providing tier-2/3 technical support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD Expertise: Practical experience with GitLab CI/CD, Git-based workflows, automated builds, testing pipelines, and software deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API Development: Experience developing and integrating REST APIs, HTTP/HTTPS interfaces, and network-based software services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking Fundamentals: Good understanding of TCP/IP, UDP, network protocols, authentication, and communication interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering: Solid understanding of software architecture, version control, dependency management, automated testing, and release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to obtain a German / NATO security clearance (EU / NATO citizenship required by national security regulations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NVIDIA Jetson, Raspberry Pi, or similar ARM64 SBCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of ROS 2 (colcon, ament, uXRCE-DDS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP (Artifact Registry, Cloud Build, GCE instances).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base knowledge of C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minerva is STARK&#39;s command and control software — the brain that connects operators to autonomous systems across multiple domains in real time. The Minerva team is a small, senior software group based in Berlin and Munich, working directly with our systems and hardware teams to build mission-critical C2 capabilities deployed in active operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We move fast, ship real software, and operate under constraints most engineers never encounter — low-bandwidth networks, air-gapped devices, high-stakes decision loops. There is no room for abstraction for its own sake. Everything we build ends up in the hands of real operators in the field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a Robotics Engineer with a focus on embedded perception systems, you will play a critical role in enabling real-time autonomy onboard next-generation UAV platforms. You will work directly with camera data pipelines, ROS2-based systems, and embedded compute platforms to build robust, efficient, and scalable perception functionality.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will contribute as a highly skilled individual contributor—hands-on with the system—bridging diverse codebases and enabling data flows across native ROS2 nodes, legacy frameworks, and containerized third-party modules. Your work will be essential to ensuring that our autonomous systems operate reliably in real-world, resource-constrained environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop and integrate real-time perception pipelines on embedded platforms such as the Jetson Nano NX.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Migrate legacy monolithic systems to ROS2, refactoring and modularizing components for better scalability and maintainability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enable and optimize image data access across native and containerized components (e.g., Dockerized ROS2 processes).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and implement low-level camera and sensor drivers for real-time vision acquisition.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate with AI, controls, and hardware teams to ensure tight integration between perception and other onboard subsystems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Profile and debug system performance under embedded constraints (compute, thermal, bandwidth), ensuring stability and robustness in field deployments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contribute to system-level architecture discussions with a focus on communication reliability and modularity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Engineering or a related technical field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong experience with ROS2, including real-world deployment and integration of perception modules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proficient in Python and C++ for embedded and robotics development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solid background in robotics, autonomous systems, embedded development, or aerospace applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Familiarity with embedded Linux platforms, particularly NVIDIA Jetson devices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience integrating containerized processes (e.g., Docker) into onboard robotic systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ability to navigate and coordinate between different frameworks (ROS2, legacy/custom codebases, third-party modules).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills, especially in real-time or resource-constrained environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Effective communicator and team player in multidisciplinary engineering teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Self-driven, organized, and adaptable to fast-paced development cycles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for field testing and deployment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
