Security, privacy &amp; compliance. Champion least‑privilege access, encryption, auditability and privacy‑by‑design across all datasets.
People &amp; performance. Lead managers and senior ICs; grow capability through coaching, clear career paths, hiring, and a high‑performance, inclusive culture.
Stakeholder leadership. Partner with Product, Platform, External 3rd Parties and Customer teams to convert business goals into a data roadmap, measurable outcomes and transparent delivery.

