&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Journey Activation department requires a Senior Associate, Analytics to support the Analytics Manager, the Analytics Director, and the rest of the Analytics team to define and deliver best practice Campaign Reporting, Analytics, and Optimization solutions across WPP Media client requirements. The Senior Associate, Analytics will also advise where possible on the appropriate use of technology, and contribute to the identification of new client opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Combining data and technology to inform analytics and insights for WPP Media’s clients is a crucial part of our commitment to driving better decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Analytics Manager, the Analytics Director and WPP Media clients to identify analytical requirements and solve challenges effectively and efficiently, supporting external resource to do this when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and delivery of existing and new reporting, BI &amp;amp; Analytics projects, including the response to client briefs, securing and analysing required data, preparing the story and visualisation, and presenting to internal and external stakeholders where necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become familiar with the existing Analytics toolset to utilize on client business, including data visualisation technologies (Power BI, Data Studio), reporting and analysis tools (Microsoft Excel, Google BigQuery, Google Analytics), and Data Integration pillars (SQL, Azure), and build an awareness in clients’ business, systems and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within, and help develop, an open, collaborative, progressive day to day culture within Analytics, WPP Media’s clients, and develop strong relationships across the Analytics team, across the wider Journey Activation department and the agency as a whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to support Graduates, Work Experience Students, Interns and other temporary resource in the Analytics team where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media, data and technology industry experience or awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real passion for data, analytics and technology, and for learning new skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in AI – and how it can be used to solve problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills, both within WPP Media and externally with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to distil data into insight and valuable information, and to present back findings in a clear, engaging and meaningful way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding or awareness of digital media (adserving, cookies, pixels), data visualisation and dashboarding, web analytics, data manipulation and statistical analysis software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some hands-on experience with relevant technologies (e.g., Power BI, Tableau, Data Studio, Datorama, Google Analytics, Advanced Excel, SQL, R) would be useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de Mirakl &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fondée en 2012, Mirakl est à l’avant-garde de l’innovation marketplace, permettant à toutes les entreprises de rivaliser dans l’économie de plateforme.&lt;br&gt;Son operating system combine aujourd’hui des solutions pour :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le lancement, la gestion et la croissance d’une marketplace ou d’une activité de dropship (Mirakl Platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;la vente omnicanale alimentée par l’IA (Mirakl Connect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le retail media (Mirakl Ads)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le commerce agentique (Mirakl Nexus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Avec ses sièges à Boston et Paris, Mirakl accompagne un écosystème mondial de plus de 450 clients B2C et B2B et un réseau de plus de 100 000 marques et vendeurs tiers.&lt;br&gt;Des marques comme Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos et Airbus Helicopters utilisent Mirakl pour réinventer leur approche du commerce.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d&#39;informations, rendez-vous sur www.mirakl.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl en chiffres &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Fondée en 2012 | Membre de French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 Plus de 750 employés répartis dans 9 bureaux à travers le monde : Paris, Barcelone, Bordeaux, Boston, Londres, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez Mirakl, c&#39;est accélérer votre carrière aux côtés de collègues ambitieux, passionnés et solidaires. Nous sommes fiers de la diversité des parcours, des perspectives et des expériences qui rendent nos équipes uniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos 5 valeurs guident notre façon de collaborer :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡 Travailler dur ensemble : le travail d&#39;équipe et la collaboration sont les fondements de notre succès&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 Aller au bout des choses : &amp;nbsp;nous privilégions l&#39;action et l&#39;efficacité pour obtenir des résultats percutants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Aller au-delà des attentes : &amp;nbsp;nous relevons les défis de manière proactive et visons toujours l&#39;excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Réussir grâce à l&#39;expertise : le partage de connaissances et l&#39;apprentissage continu sont au cœur de notre culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Satisfaire et responsabiliser les clients : nous nous engageons à assurer la réussite de nos clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our International Customer Success team led by Philippe, Director of Customer Success. The team consists of around ten Consultants based across Barcelona and Paris, covering a global portfolio of B2B and B2C accounts. Together, you&#39;ll be ensuring each client&#39;s marketplace reaches its full performance potential — acting as the strategic backbone behind their growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Serve as the strategic and functional point of reference for B2B and B2C clients across both project and run phases — running tailored workshops with C-level stakeholders, shaping marketplace strategy, and keeping projects firmly on track to go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build personalised post-launch action plans with each client, lead data-driven business reviews, and translate KPI analysis into concrete growth recommendations for marketplace teams and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define seller and customer strategies, benchmark against leading global marketplaces, and leverage the latest e-commerce trends and Mirakl product features to continuously drive client performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally with Mirakl&#39;s Business and IT teams to anticipate risks early, align on priorities, and ensure clients extract maximum value from the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Embed AI into your daily workflows — testing agents, providing structured feedback, and applying critical thinking to push the boundaries of how the team operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;2 to 4 years&#39; experience in at least one of the following: management consulting, a business role within an e-commerce company or online marketplace (B2B or B2C), or Customer Success in B2B Enterprise SaaS — marketplace or digital commerce experience is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proven track record of influencing and guiding senior stakeholders, including C-level, in a client-facing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Business, Management, Finance or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analytical and data-driven thinking: comfortable building business cases, interpreting KPIs and turning data into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Senior stakeholder management and influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strategic business advisory and structured problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong written, verbal and presentation communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;AI literacy with a critical mindset — you already use AI tools and are curious to go further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Languages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;English: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;French: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Spanish, Italian or Arabic &lt;em&gt;(a real asset)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-decimal pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Screening call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Interview with the Hiring Manager (business reviews and analytical skills)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Values interviews with 3 team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons des collaborateurs aux parcours et expériences très différents pour nous aider à grandir. Ceux-ci dépassent souvent les exigences professionnelles conventionnelles et nous aident à créer une culture d&#39;apprentissage continu. Si vous êtes prêt à rejoindre un leader mondial qui soutient la transformation e-commerce de plus de 450 retailers et organisations B2B parmi les plus innovants au monde. Nous pouvons utiliser des solutions d&#39;intelligence artificielle (IA) pour rationaliser notre processus de recrutement, notamment pour présélectionner les candidatures, analyser les CV et évaluer les réponses. Si l&#39;IA nous aide à travailler efficacement, toutes les décisions finales en matière de recrutement sont prises par des humains. Pour plus d&#39;information, consultez notre &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧡 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place: serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience, without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;As the buy now, pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered more than 25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;With 380+ Almakers and more than €100M in ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll join a team made up of one manager, one team lead and five Account Performance Managers: Mathieu, Guillaume, Hugo, Gonzague and Alexandre.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The team is responsible for supporting Alma&#39;s strategic merchants, helping them grow their business with Alma and ensuring that we continue to deliver value over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for our next Account Performance Manager to manage a portfolio of strategic accounts and play a key role in supporting our merchants&#39; business strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;As an Account Performance Manager, you&#39;ll manage a portfolio of approximately 200 strategic merchants, both online and offline. These merchants generate an average annual turnover of between €1M and €3M with Alma.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Most of your portfolio will be based in France, with some international accounts as Alma continues to expand across Europe.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your role will be to understand each merchant&#39;s business, identify opportunities for growth, maximize the value of the partnership and anticipate any behavior that could lead to churn.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;SMB and Mid-Market accounts represent around 40% of Alma&#39;s margin, which makes your work critical to the company&#39;s success.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your main responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Drive merchant performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build strong relationships with your portfolio through proactive outreach, including calls and emails. Use Alma&#39;s dashboards and performance data to identify opportunities and provide meaningful business insights.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Identify growth opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Analyze merchant activity and recommend initiatives such as:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Upselling Alma&#39;s solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Optimizing pricing and payment plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Expanding into new countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Activating additional networks or channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increasing Alma&#39;s share of the merchant&#39;s payment activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Improve the profitability of your portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Conduct business and financial analyses for merchants with low margins. Work with them to define and implement action plans that improve performance and help reach the expected margin target.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Prevent merchant churn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep a close eye on merchant performance, market trends and competitor activity. Identify early warning signs and demonstrate Alma&#39;s value through relevant, data-driven recommendations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Support Alma&#39;s international growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Work with French and international merchants and contribute to the development of best practices for managing strategic accounts across different markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Build smarter ways of working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contribute to improving account management processes, reporting and automation so the team can scale its impact while maintaining a high level of service.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;How success will be measured&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your main objectives will be to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increase revenue through TPV growth and take-rate optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Reduce merchant churn by proactively demonstrating Alma&#39;s value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Maintain a strategic level of margin across your portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Increase the adoption and expansion of Alma&#39;s solutions among strategic merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will use a combination of data, sales and collaboration tools, including:&amp;nbsp;Salesforce, Gong, Dust,&amp;nbsp;Performance dashboards and internal reporting tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will also work closely with teams across the organization, including Operations, Product, Sales, Risk, Finance and Marketing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧩 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;To succeed in this role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have at least three years of experience in account management, business development, sales or a similar client-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience managing strategic B2B accounts and advising clients on their business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a strong interest in fintech and a genuine curiosity about payment products, financial performance and the broader payments ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are comfortable analyzing business and financial data and turning insights into concrete recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are autonomous, organized and able to manage a portfolio while prioritizing the actions with the greatest business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are comfortable having challenging conversations with clients and turning them into constructive business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;It will be a plus if you also&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
