&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pinterest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a rare ground-floor opportunity to help build Pinterest&#39;s EMEA creative department from the start, as part of House of Creative. As an Art Director, you&#39;ll play an integral role in shaping the next iteration of the Pinterest brand — launching global, culturally relevant, award-winning campaigns with a particular emphasis on concepting and art direction. Working across both consumer and B2B marketing, you&#39;ll partner with Creative Leaders across the company to tell our story in the most impactful and inspiring way to Consumers, Creators, and Advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptualize and develop compelling campaign creative from end to end – taking embryonic ideas towards their strongest possible 360 degree creative execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create memorable films, commercials, and 360° campaigns, including brand partnership work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art direct photography and video shoots, from treatments and mood boards through to final selects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uplevel creative quality of work across the team in partnership with marketing - delivering both business results and international recognition for the Pinterest brand in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide meaningful feedback to in-house art directors and designers (across a breadth of disciplines, like graphic, motion, digital, video, editing, etc) across a variety of formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compellingly represent the thinking behind your team’s work to key stakeholders, creative directors and team members Compellingly represent the thinking behind your work to key stakeholders, creative directors and team members, including partnering with the US creative team to adapt flagship campaigns for EMEA markets when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring depth to conceptual creative direction, art direction, and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools thoughtfully to explore more ideas faster and bring concepts to life, while owning the craft and quality of the final work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8 years of experience as an art director with an emphasis on producing film, commercials, and 360 campaigns (with 3+ of those years in a creative leadership role)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Visual Communications, Design, Advertising, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A book of work with examples of outstanding creative across a variety of brands&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership, mentorship, and interpersonal skills, with a track record of inspiring creative teams to achieve their best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of art direction and design craft across a wide variety of formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to craft a story or concept that shapes culture, rather than reacting to it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills, with an ability to convey complex concepts in compellingly simple terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience art directing on set and managing production partners, from treatments and mood boards through to final selects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An accomplished creative leader who can bring out the best work in others and produce exceptionally high quality work individually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An expert collaborator: a creative with deep experience working with writing partners to develop concepts, through to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using generative AI tools in your art direction process (e.g. concepting, mood boards, pre-visualisation), with strong judgement on originality, brand consistency, rights and representation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite and Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is compelling for a strong candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A ground-floor opportunity to help build and shape Pinterest&#39;s EMEA creative department from scratch, within House of Creative — a globally recognized, award-winning in-house team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close partnership with Pinterest&#39;s US creative team, with exposure to global brand strategy and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in London, creating high-impact work for one of the world&#39;s most visually iconic platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt;PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Requirement Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration with colleagues in-office at least one day a week. We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role. This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration &lt;strong&gt;on average 1 time per week&lt;/strong&gt; and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from one of the following offices &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-AKEO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Pinterest is an equal opportunity employer and makes employment decisions on the basis of merit. We want to have the best qualified people in every job. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, status as a protected veteran, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member) or any other consideration made unlawful by applicable federal, state or local laws. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. If you require a medical or religious accommodation during the job application process, please complete&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/sS24D4WboEKUZMQK6&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt; for support.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting this application, I certify that all information submitted in my application and throughout the hiring process is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that any false statement, omission, or misrepresentation may disqualify me from employment consideration or result in termination if discovered after hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Awin&#39;s Legal team advises the group on its legal rights and obligations across a global affiliate and partnership network. As Senior Legal Counsel, you will be a trusted, hands-on partner to our commercial, product and leadership teams, leading complex negotiations, supporting M&amp;amp;A and strategic transactions, and helping the business grow across Europe, the UK, the US and beyond. You will report directly to the General Counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a pragmatic, business-enabling lawyer who enjoys solving problems, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and is excited about how AI is changing both our industry and the way legal teams work. If you enjoy working across cultures and jurisdictions, join us full-time in one of our hubs, London or Berlin, or work from another country where Awin has an office – you can choose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Tasks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the drafting, review and negotiation of complex, high-value commercial agreements with advertisers, publishers, agencies, technology partners and vendors, including MSAs, SaaS and platform terms, partnership agreements, DPAs and NDAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as the go-to legal partner for commercial teams across regions, giving consistent, risk-weighted and business-focused advice that helps close deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising on cross-jurisdictional corporate, commercial, competition, intellectual property and regulatory matters under EU, UK, US and other international legal frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting M&amp;amp;A and strategic transactions end to end, from due diligence and transaction documents to corporate approvals and post-merger integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing disputes, litigation and third-party information requests such as subpoenas, together with external counsel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Privacy team on the commercial and contractual side of data protection, including GDPR, UK GDPR, US state privacy laws and other regimes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shaping how Legal uses AI: introducing AI tools and workflows that make the team more efficient, and advising the business on the legal aspects of AI, including the EU AI Act&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving templates, playbooks and legal processes, and delivering practical training to non-lawyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified as a solicitor or barrister in England and Wales and/or admitted to practise as an attorney in a US state&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years&#39; post-qualification experience, ideally in-house in an international business or at a law firm handling comparable commercial work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record in complex commercial negotiations, ideally in affiliate or performance marketing, or in a related sector such as tech, SaaS, AdTech or e-commerce; experience with US commercial contracts, litigation, subpoenas and dispute resolution is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid M&amp;amp;A experience, including due diligence, transaction documentation and post-closing integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data protection laws such as GDPR, UK GDPR and US state privacy laws is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or native-level English, with excellent drafting and communication skills and the ability to explain complex legal, technical and business matters clearly to non-lawyers; additional languages such as Spanish, French or Portuguese are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen interest in AI and confidence using AI tools in your daily work, with an eye for how they can make legal work faster and better; knowledge of AI regulation and governance, such as the EU AI Act, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, hands-on and open-minded approach with a business-enabling, can-do mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and prioritisation skills: you manage several matters at once, work independently and keep quality high under tight deadlines and constant change; experience with contract management systems, Asana or other legal tools is welcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who builds strong relationships across functions and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid working model, designed to foster collaboration, trust, and autonomy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace at home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension&lt;/strong&gt;: We make regular contributions to support your retirement savings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive coverage for a range of health, vision and dental treatments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electric Vehicle &amp;amp; Cycle to Work Schemes&lt;/strong&gt;: Save on commuting costs through tax-efficient schemes for electric vehicle leasing and bike purchase.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Nursery Benefit&lt;/strong&gt;: Save on childcare costs through a salary sacrifice scheme with tax and National Insurance savings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
