&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and virtual presentation skills, with the ability to stitch together disparate insights to uncover common patterns and communicate complex concepts clearly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_4293685bd03f679d-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Strong strategic mindset, diplomacy, negotiation, and conflict resolution skills with comfort working in a flat organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Why job seekers choose Geotab:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Flex working arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Home office reimbursement program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Fantastic state of the art office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Electric vehicle purchase incentive program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Public transportation reimbursement Employer pension contributions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Subsidized fitness membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Co-pay tuition reimbursement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How we work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;At Geotab, we have adopted a&amp;nbsp;flexible hybrid&amp;nbsp;working model in that we have systems, functions, programs and policies in place to support both in-person and virtual work. However, you are welcomed and encouraged to come into our beautiful, safe, clean offices as often as you like. When working from home, you are required to have a reliable internet connection with at least 50mb DL/10mb UL. Virtual work is supported with cloud-based applications, collaboration tools and asynchronous working. The health and safety of employees are a top priority. We encourage work-life balance and keep the Geotab culture going strong with online social events, chat rooms and gatherings. Join us and help reshape the future of technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that ensuring diversity is fundamental to our future growth and progress and is an integral part of our business. We believe that success happens where new ideas can flourish – in an environment that is rich in diversity and a place where people from various backgrounds can work together. Geotab encourages applications from all qualified individuals. We are committed to accommodating people with disabilities during the recruitment and assessment processes and when people are hired. We will ensure the accessibility needs of employees with disabilities are taken into account as part of performance management, career development, training and redeployment processes. If you require accommodation at any stage of the application process or want more information about our diversity and inclusion as well as accommodation policies and practices, please contact us at ----- By submitting a job application to Geotab Inc. or its affiliates and subsidiaries (collectively, “Geotab”), you acknowledge Geotab’s collection, use and disclosure of your personal data in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uE3uV2SSp0YnYx4utU9QdhN8Q_RzqMphI_pVJyVWQn8/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to read our Privacy Notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team rewriting the rules in private markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you’d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moonfare, we are leading a new era of private equity investing. We are seeking an exceptional Chief of Staff to join our executive team at a pivotal moment in our growth. Reporting directly to the co-CEO, this highly strategic role sits at the intersection of strategy, business management, and leadership, driving Moonfare’s most critical initiatives, from embedding AI across the business to guiding our transformation into a premier Asset Manager. This is a hands-on role: you’ll move from advising on strategy to delivering it yourself, rolling up your sleeves to make things happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate high-priority, company-wide initiatives from conception to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and orchestrate the bi-weekly ExCo run and change meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and project manage strategic priorities including Moonfare’s evolution into an Asset Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to the co-CEOs and ExCo, applying first-principles thinking and analytical rigor to structure complex challenges and deliver actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and manage the executive operating rhythm: leadership offsites, board preparation, and critical business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support board, investor, and partner engagements, ensuring clear, compelling communication of Moonfare’s strategy and progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a connector across departments and geographies, enabling alignment and seamless execution of Moonfare’s vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3–4 years of significant experience in a top-tier management consulting firm or senior strategic leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading large-scale, cross-functional initiatives in dynamic, complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills, combining first-principles thinking with a highly analytical, data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and stakeholder management capabilities, with the gravitas to influence at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in financial services, asset management, or FinTech is advantageous but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you feel you do not meet all of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We support your development with an individual growth budget of €1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Your Future:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We support your long-term financial goals with a company pension scheme, providing a 20% employer contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relax and Recharge:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You start with 25 vacation days and you’ll receive one additional day for each year of tenure, up to a maximum of 30 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Lunch:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a free lunch every day that you are in the Berlin office, with a weekly changing menu that includes salads, curries, pastas, and a variety of vegan and vegetarian options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised Public Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We support your commute with a monthly subsidy for the Deutschland job ticket, making your travel easier and more affordable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fitness and Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stay active with a subsidised Urban Sports Club membership, giving you flexible access to a wide variety of sports and wellness activities across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of Excellence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Join a team of ambitious, smart, and committed professionals who are passionate about revolutionising private market investing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our clients come first, Moonfare comes second, and we prioritise ourselves third - Client-Centric Focus.&lt;/strong&gt; Putting clients first means creating value for them is essential. Placing Moonfare second signifies that our individual professional future at Moonfare depends on the company&#39;s commercial success. Prioritising ourselves third reflects our humility in putting clients and Moonfare before personal interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We pursue excellence and honor our promises - Commitment to Excellence.&lt;/strong&gt; We hold ourselves to the highest standards, taking responsibility for our failures, and celebrating our successes. We commit to deadlines and stick to them and we learn from our mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are here to win and to celebrate our collective achievements - Win together. &lt;/strong&gt;We are mission-focused and think and act like owners. We exemplify the attitude we expect and each of us commits to do what it takes to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We foster personal growth but each of us earns our place as a Moonfarian through merit - Growth and Merit. &lt;/strong&gt;We hire, retain, and develop exceptional people and invest in empowering them to excel. We must all earn our place at the table every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand the important role that diversity plays in our success. Different backgrounds, experiences and ideas push us further and raise the bar. We&#39;re committed to developing an inclusive and safe culture where everyone — regardless of colour, race, religion, sex, origin, sexuality, disability, marital status, citizenship or gender identity — knows that they are an integral part of the team and can bring their full potential to their work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As a Fullstack Staff Engineer on the Actions team, you&#39;ll take on one of our most important platform challenges: defining how extensibility works across Staffbase. Today, extensions power everything from HR integrations to the actions our AI assistant, Navigator, performs on a user&#39;s behalf — but there&#39;s no single, easy way to build and extend. That&#39;s what you&#39;ll design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Your north star is a framework that our engineers, our Labs team, and eventually customers themselves can use to build their own extensions, whether that&#39;s a one-off integration for a single customer or a tier-one capability used across our entire base. You&#39;ll build the core, define the standards, and make the calls on where we standardise versus where we stay flexible, all on a mature, multi-tenant platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who wants to drive, not just deliver, shaping the direction of a genuinely open-ended problem and setting the technical foundations others will build on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As part of our tech stack, we are using: React.js, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, Terraform, Docker and Playwright, to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;The Actions team sits at the heart of Staffbase&#39;s AI ambitions. We&#39;re the team that gives Navigator — our AI assistant and the main entry point into Staffbase — the ability to actually do things: submit a form, complete a task inside an integration, or take an action on a user&#39;s behalf through the agent. If Navigator is the brain, we build the hands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;That means two big things. First, we enrich what the AI can see and act on, our plugins, our widgets and the wider Staffbase platform so the assistant can do real work, not just talk about it. Second, we build the extensions that connect to the tools people already use, like Workday, Personio, ServiceNow and Microsoft.   We&#39;re not just shipping features, though. A core part of our mission is building the extensibility framework that lets others build too.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and similar-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the &quot;You build it, you run it&quot; approach and take pride in it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Define and drive Staffbase&#39;s extensibility strategy, designing the framework, SDK and standards that let our teams and customers build their own extensions and integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Build the core systems that enable our AI assistant to take action across Staffbase and connect to external providers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical strategy and architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Influence technical decisions and their documentation, driving long-term sustainable solutions to accommodate future growth and requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously improve and refine our development processes, CI/CD pipeline, and automation practices to foster a productive development experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Take ownership of major technical decisions, proactively addressing system bottlenecks and ensuring product quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to and maintain technical roadmaps with engineering leadership to align project priorities and business goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Manage and prioritize projects and initiatives across multiple teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, technical excellence and continuous improvement within the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Role modeling and developing others in the craft of Product Software Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers, providing leadership, feedback and fostering growth through code reviews and technical discussions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record as a Staff Engineer or Technical Lead with strong leadership and problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience designing and building extensibility within a B2B / enterprise platform, SDKs, plugin systems, or extension frameworks that let internal teams and external customers build on top of a core product, with the judgment to define what &quot;good&quot; extensibility looks like from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of multi-tenant architecture, with strong judgment on where to standardise versus where to stay flexible in platform design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Extensive experience with Java/Kotlin or Go on the backend and React on the frontend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of architecture and design patterns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work collaboratively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to drive technical direction, including making decisions on architectural trade-offs and evaluating the long-term impact of technical choices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing architecture projects across multiple development teams, aligned with their roadmaps and stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to various stakeholders, both technical and non-technical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Previous experience working alongside Product and Design Leaders to deliver customer value in an Agile environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for building high-quality software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for diversity and inclusion, and the ability to foster a culture where the team can move forward at speed while ensuring that everyone&#39;s voice is heard and they can contribute their best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;While we don&#39;t have an open &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; position on our Sales team right now, we&#39;re always looking to connect with exceptional talent for when an opportunity opens up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer at Staffbase, you will play a crucial role in understanding our clients&#39; needs, architecting solutions, and ensuring successful implementation of our AI-native employee communication and operations platforms. This is a unique opportunity to work with cutting-edge technology and collaborate with clients across various industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Account Executives to build and deliver engaging demos to prospective customers that spark excitement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work with prospective customers to find the best technical setup for their internal communications needs and remove technical obstacles to winning deals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Run technical evaluations of the Staffbase platform and consult on different integration methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Consult prospects regarding our APIs, our architecture recommendations and AI infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Crafting and building RFP response documents which position the Staffbase product in the best possible manner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Vibe-coding of demo mock-ups to showcase our integration and customization capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You’re interfacing between sales and product to always have cutting edge industry and product knowledge and inform the product development with learnings from our prospects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer you’re a role model and mentor to less experienced Solutions Engineers on the team, lead by example, and have an impact on how Solutions Engineers play a role in the broader sales process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;University degree in information science, Information Systems, Business Engineering, or equivalent technical work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;5-8 years of experience in a similar role (SaaS pre-sales/solutions engineering/solutions consulting)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;C2 level French and German + English (C1 level); able to conduct executive-level business conversations in all three languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of cloud technologies and corresponding infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;While you’re not required to be a full stack engineer, you should have a general understanding of web development and knowledge of common technologies. You shouldn’t be afraid to whip up an MVP that interacts with our APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Solution-focused understanding of REST APIs and how to interact with them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly understand technical concepts and effectively communicate them to technical and non-technical people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise with web development, preferably knowledge with HTML/CSS and at least one programming language like JavaScript, Java, PHP, NodeJS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise software and common concepts/integrations is a plus: Microsoft, SAP, Workday, Single Sign-on, Active Directory, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with AI technology including agent architecture (MCP and A2A)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge about security and compliance topics in a SaaS environment is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility&lt;/em&gt; - we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt; - we’re offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt; - you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;There&#39;s no application deadline and no active process right now — but if this sounds like your kind of role, submit your profile to join our talent community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Scout24?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scout24 is home of ImmoScout24, Germany’s #1 for real estate. With ImmoScout24 we have been revolutionizing the real estate market in Germany and Austria for more than 25 years. Our goal is to build a digital ecosystem that brings homeowners, seekers, and agents together. Finding the right home and property is one of the most important decisions in life. So is your career!&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;#WorkingatScout24&lt;/strong&gt; means being part of a diverse and inclusive team of around 1100 colleagues and 58 nationalities. We embrace difference and celebrate individuality. By encouraging open mindedness and authenticity we enable a true learning culture and prepare the ground for personal development. &amp;nbsp;Mistakes are a chance to grow and to innovate. Together we act proactively, strive for improvement, and take responsibility. We talk about success and challenge while treating each other with respect because we are &lt;strong&gt;#oneteam&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds interesting to you, we would love to see you joining us! &amp;nbsp;Even if you may not tick all the boxes of the job requirements, we are happy to hear about the value you can add to the team. &amp;nbsp;Grow with us!. &lt;strong&gt;Welcome home! &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your team and your mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Employee Experience Team is part of Scout24’s Tech organization. We improve the employee experience by turning operational needs into reliable, scalable digital services and automation. Working across People, Employee Technology, and other business and technical teams, we understand workflows, connect enterprise systems, improve service quality, and build reusable foundations for future use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In this role, you will take end-to-end ownership of AI-enabled employee services: from working with domain experts and shaping ambiguous problems to designing, building, evaluating, deploying, and continuously improving solutions in production. You will have the autonomy to make architectural decisions, establish reusable engineering patterns, and help shape how responsible AI automation is implemented across future use cases at Scout24.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How your role will look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner with business and technical teams to understand workflows, constraints, risks, failure modes, and desired outcomes before shaping solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Own the technical direction, implementation, reliability, maintenance, and continuous evolution of AI-enabled employee services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Design and build production-ready AI applications using suitable patterns such as retrieval, structured outputs, tool use, document processing, and multi-step workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Define appropriate human-review and escalation points for sensitive, uncertain, exceptional, or policy-dependent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Integrate AI-enabled workflows with enterprise systems, APIs, data sources, and operational processes through reliable interfaces and secure data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Establish evaluation approaches from the outset, including representative test cases, quality criteria, risk scenarios, release thresholds, and regression checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build and operate the surrounding production software, including data models, background processing, automated testing, delivery pipelines, observability, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Monitor quality, safety, latency, cost, adoption, and business outcomes, using production evidence to continuously improve the system and its underlying engineering patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Senior-level software engineering experience, with strong system-design skills and experience delivering reliable, scalable applications in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience taking at least one AI-enabled application beyond the prototype stage into production, including implementation, evaluation, deployment, and operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong backend or full-stack engineering fundamentals, including APIs, data modelling, asynchronous processing, automated testing, debugging, delivery pipelines, observability, and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Practical experience with production LLM applications, including prompt and context engineering, structured outputs, retrieval-augmented generation, and evaluation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Sound judgement in choosing when AI adds value and when deterministic software or human decision-making is more appropriate, reliable, or efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong ownership, structured problem-solving, and collaborative working skills, with the ability to turn ambiguous needs and operational constraints into pragmatic technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of privacy, security, access control, hallucination risk, latency, reliability, model selection, cost, tool-calling, and multi-step or agentic workflows; fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools to drive problem-solving and productivity, maintaining effective human oversight and judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience with multimodal AI or document-based workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with orchestration frameworks or comparable technologies for building and operating AI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience developing AI assistants, workflow agents, or document-processing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise workflows involving approvals, exceptions, auditability, and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with interoperability standards for connecting AI applications with tools, systems, and data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aside from our people and company culture we are offering awesome benefits that make Scout24 a great place to work!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; A competitive salary package and a bonus on top.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a hybrid work model with three days of on-site work per week in the office, and you can organize the remaining days as you wish. We offer you 30 days of vacation per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work from abroad: &lt;/strong&gt;We offer you the possibility to work from abroad for 10 days per year, subject to the business requirements of the company and team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation:&lt;/strong&gt; Our relocation agency supports you with your visa process and an attractive relocation package.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use our products: &lt;/strong&gt;As an employee you can take advantage of our plus membership for tenants on ImmoScout24 to find a new place to live.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Dedicated learning time per month, online courses on our ScoutAcademy, regular book challenges, structured feedback, “Lunch &amp;amp; Learn”-Events and individual career paths to push your career to the next level.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have kids?&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll support you with a professional family service, which helps you to find a childcare center or offers emergency childcare.  &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Furry feel good manager&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring your dog to work (upon approval, as we prioritise the well-being of our employees and ensure that our dog policy is considerate of allergic individuals and prevents overcrowding on each office floor).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobility:&lt;/strong&gt; We subsidize public transport or Job Bikes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Commitment to sustainability and&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI)&lt;/strong&gt;: We have clear environmental and climate protection goals and are involved in social activities and charitable organizations throughout the year. We live the diversity. Our theme weeks on diversity, mental well-being, and other social issues give us time and space to develop ourselves on DEI and sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer a company pension scheme and support your own contribution with an attractive subsidy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Most innovative office: &lt;/strong&gt;Our office is barrier-free and in the heart of Berlin right at the central station. It was awarded for the most innovative office concept. We have an own gym with regular courses, napping room, rooftop terrace, organic coffee, cafeteria, 100% green electricity and a massage therapist that comes in once a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Health: &lt;/strong&gt;Life Situation Coaching, regular health check ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are a tech company:&lt;/strong&gt; We work with the latest technical tools and hardware. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to further enhance the diversity of our company and support the professional development of people with disabilities. We have a disability representative who will assist you throughout the application process. If you require this support, please let us know in advance.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in shaping the experience that millions of customers land on every time they open DoorDash, Wolt, or Deliveroo. As part of our Core Consumer organisation, our Homepage team owns one of the single biggest levers we have on what customers find and one of the hardest surfaces in the app to get right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of ranking, personalisation, and AI/ML, you&#39;ll help decide what each customer sees and why, across three brands and dozens of markets. You&#39;ll be building on a global stack, and your roadmap will be a mix: global platform problems that apply worldwide, global capabilities we&#39;re accelerating into EMEA, and EMEA-specific problems worth solving properly rather than working around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our Homepage team. In this role, you&#39;ll shape how customers discover restaurants, grocery and retail venues, dishes and products — and help define what discovery looks like as AI-driven and agentic experiences change the way people decide what to order.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be joining a team working on one of the most-used surfaces in the app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building new end-to-end features and user experiences on Homepage that shape how customers discover restaurants, grocery and retail venues, dishes, and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on ranking, personalisation, and AI/ML problems in the Homepage domain, including how we decide what each customer sees and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploring where AI-driven and agentic experiences change the way customers discover what to order.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making discovery work across three brands and many markets, without flattening into one-size-fits-all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong product judgment and curiosity to grow into the rest:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager on consumer-facing products - discovery, homepage, feed, or ranking-driven experiences are especially relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a product manager more than a feature owner. Someone who finds the customer problems that matter most and makes the case for solving them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work backwards from the customer problem, and weigh it against what the business needs most right now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable holding several business objectives at once and making a call when they pull in different directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well with a wide range of stakeholders and build trust with people whose priorities differ from your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think strategically and can move between long-term direction and what we should ship next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and genuinely flexible (this industry is changing fast, AI most of all).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about what AI actually changes for customers, and can tell real value from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We&#39;re looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform (&quot;Codeless&quot;). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Enterprise Value Creation (EVC) practice in London is growing, and we are looking for a Senior Manager to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expectations of value have changed. The EVC team helps clients achieve sustainable P&amp;amp;L improvement,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;addressing short-term financial priorities while building long-term value for shareholders. We bring a private &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;equity mindset to enterprises, and we differentiate ourselves through the rigour of our thinking and the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;humanity of our execution: we combine deep data and analysis with market knowledge, and we work side &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;by side with clients so that value is realised and sustained.&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our AI-Enabled Operations team helps &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;organisations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; reimagine how their operations work and create &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;measurable value through AI, automation and operational improvement – from finding where AI genuinely &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;pays back to making sure the benefits land in the P&amp;amp;L. You will work with clients across our industry sectors: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Financial Services, Products &amp;amp; Services, Energy &amp;amp; Resources, Pharmaceuticals &amp;amp; Life Sciences, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Government.&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead AI-enabled operations &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; end to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;end:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; from diagnostics, baselines and business cases, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;through process and operating model redesign, to implementation, adoption and value &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;realisation&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Shape AI and operational transformation strategies and roadmaps tailored to each client’s needs, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;working closely with COOs, CFOs, technology leaders and other senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Oversee systems integrators, technology vendors and internal delivery teams, making sure solutions &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;meet business needs and are delivered to scope and quality&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead multi-disciplinary teams, bringing together expertise from across Baringa&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Make sure value is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;realised&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; and sustained, through robust benefits tracking and building client capability &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and driving user adoption&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coach and develop team members, helping them grow their skills and careers&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build long-term client relationships, shape proposals and contribute to business development&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Help build the UK EVC team and its AI-Enabled Operations offering, including proposition development, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;recruitment and capability development&lt;/span&gt;​&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBox  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced leader with typically 7+ years of relevant experience who enjoys &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBox  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot;&gt;building client relationships, developing teams and delivering measurable outcomes for clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP  BCX8 SCXP30655548&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A track record of leading AI-enabled operational transformation into production, not just proof &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;of concept, delivering measurable benefits for clients by reshaping the work and reimagining &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;the organization and applying operational excellence principles&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Significant experience in a top-tier management or technology consultancy&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience across the client lifecycle: from diagnostics, baselines and business cases, to process &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and operating model design, to implementation and benefits &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-usefontface=&quot;false&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;realisation&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/li&gt;
