&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jxn220&quot; data-start=&quot;4557&quot; data-end=&quot;4675&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4559&quot; data-end=&quot;4583&quot;&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Five weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
