&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Etudiant.e en 3&lt;sup&gt;ème&lt;/sup&gt; année ou master&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maitrise des outils de montage photo et vidéo : Canva, Photoshop. La maitrise de Première Pro/After Affect est un plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maitrise des principales plateformes sociales / analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance du secteur musical&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisé, rigoureux, curieux, analytique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Première expérience en label et/ou agence créa/digitale serait un plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En intégrant Sony Music vous pourrez profiter de plusieurs avantages&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une Carte restaurant prise en charge à 60 %&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des fruits frais sont mis à disposition trois fois par semaine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bénéficiez d’un parking pour votre vélo tout au long de l’année&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accédez au forfait mobilité durable à hauteur 500 €/année complète&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme de bien-être «&amp;nbsp;massages ou ostéo&amp;nbsp;»&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Town hall avec petits déjeuners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accès à une plateforme de santé mentale et de bien-être qui permet de parler à un psychologue expérimenté&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des chèques vacances et carte cadeau de Noël offerts par le CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rejoindre Sony Music c’est également l’opportunité de participer à des events tels que la Summer et la Christmas Party&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durée, lieu et période du stage :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée&amp;nbsp;: 6 mois (avec convention de stage obligatoire), stage à temps complet (35h/semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début : Janvier 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu&amp;nbsp;: 67/69 boulevard de Charonne 75011 PARIS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indemnités de stage&lt;/strong&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum légal (693€ bruts par mois) + Remboursement à 50% des frais de transport + Titres restaurant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous vous reconnaissez à travers ce profil et l’aventure Sony Music Entertainment France vous tente&amp;nbsp;? Nous avons déjà hâte de faire votre connaissance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music s’engage à garantir l’égalité des chances en matière d’emploi, sans tenir compte de l’origine, du sexe, des mœurs, de l’orientation sexuelle, du genre, de l’âge, de la situation de famille, de l’état de grossesse, des opinions politiques, des activités syndicales, des convictions religieuses, de l’apparence physique, du nom de famille, du lieu de résidence, de l’état de santé, ou/et du handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt(e) à nous rejoindre&amp;nbsp;et relever de nouveaux challenges&amp;nbsp;?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Airbnb Hotels team is a fun, fast-growing group leading Airbnb’s expansion into the hotel sector. Operating with an entrepreneurial spirit, this team combines the simplicity, product excellence and guest-centred ethos that define Airbnb. Our mission is to deliver the smoothest, most intuitive hotel booking experience for guests, while helping hotel partners easily drive incremental bookings so they can focus on delivering the best hospitality. The ultimate aim is to help more people discover high-quality hotels, creating value for guests and our hotel partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global team. Open doors no one at Airbnb has opened yet.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb Hotels is one of the most exciting growth stories in travel, and we’re only getting started. As Manager, Key Accounts, you will build and lead a brand new, globally distributed team of Enterprise Account Managers. Together you will win and onboard high-value, above-property hotel groups with hundreds of hotels across multiple continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for someone who brings:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven leadership of a key, strategic or enterprise accounts team&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally globally distributed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network and reputation in travel and hospitality&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally hotels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real negotiation experience &lt;/strong&gt;with high-value partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder’s mindset,&lt;/strong&gt; with a track record of creating teams, playbooks and processes where none existed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional influence&lt;/strong&gt; across a matrix organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end partner management at hotel headquarter and regional office level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mutual account plans that drive supply and strategic relationship value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The global Key Accounts strategy, in line with the Enterprise Team playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear mandate to consistently exceed quarterly business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World-class account management practices, operational excellence and partner satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The voice of Key Accounts within Hotels leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, growth-oriented team that you mentor and motivate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports to the Global Head, Hotel Enterprise and Connectivity Partnerships, and offers a unique opportunity to shape Airbnb’s growth in the hotel market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a brand new team&lt;/strong&gt; in a business that only launched this year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Key Accounts playbook&lt;/strong&gt; from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the relationships,&lt;/strong&gt; the targets and the strategy for a global segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with a leadership team that is moving fast &lt;/strong&gt;and backing this business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a distributed team of Enterprise Account Managers, supporting them on partner management and new business development for supply acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team’s quarterly revenue, supply acquisition and OKR targets, and ensure they are met and exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take partners from first conversation through negotiation, signed deal and onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the Key Accounts playbook in line with global strategy, working closely with Hotel functional teams across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow relationships with multi-national hotel groups, acting as an escalation option for your team where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the operational rhythm for the team: establish and track KPIs, analyse growth and key metrics to identify trends, surface new business opportunities, and resolve business challenges with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Hotels field team in achieving their goals through well-designed field-level action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Technical Support, Connectivity, RevOps and Hotels Cross-Functional Leadership to drive feature adoption and business performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airbnb at industry and partner events, and organise internal partner events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold regular team meetings, 1:1s, and performance and development reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise team business gatherings, quarterly kick-offs and team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must-haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of professional experience and at least 8+ years in sales or account management roles in travel, hospitality or e-commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience managing and leading high-performing teams, with a proven track record of meeting and exceeding goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a globally distributed team and driving solutions to improve supply acquisition and revenue goals, ideally across international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with, or deep knowledge of, major hotel groups across the global hospitality landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset developed from experience having launched companies, teams or significant initiatives where resources, processes and capabilities had to be created, not handed to you or followed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of preparing and executing complex negotiations with high-value partner organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated team builder with the ability to coach and mentor account managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop a strategy, communicate it clearly, and secure buy-in and support to execute against quarterly goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills to identify opportunities, operationalise execution with regional teams, and drive business results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence senior executives, both within regional Airbnb leadership and within partner leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work within a matrix, solve problems, and influence cross-functional and cross-regional teams, with strong stakeholder management across Marketing, Legal, FP&amp;amp;A, Payments, Product, regional field teams, and Enterprise and Connectivity teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel globally up to 60% of the time as needed to meet team members and engage with partners and customers at industry events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the hospitality technology space, including familiarity with OTAs and hotel distribution (strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and driving channel sales and marketing initiatives with global partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with tools such as CRM tools (Salesforce), project management tools (Asana, Airtable), and business intelligence tools (Tableau, Looker, Claude)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French or another major European language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€96.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted Go grows by signing new pick-up/drop-off locations, and a large share of that growth is delivered by external sales agencies. You will own that network: the agencies running our field sales, virtual calling and digital outreach across Europe and the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today these relationships are managed in a fragmented way. Your job is to turn them into one well-governed, high-performing extension of the acquisition team, with clear targets, a consistent operating rhythm and a single point of accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role. You will act as an agency manager, performance analyst and budget owner, and above all as the guardian of the Vinted Go sales approach in every conversation an agency has on our behalf. You will build on the structure that already exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Channel Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full relationship with every outsourced sales partner across countries: onboarding, day-to-day management, escalations and offboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the single point of accountability for agency sales results, replacing today&#39;s fragmented oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and manage contracts, SLAs and commercial terms, including pay-for-performance structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, select and onboard new sales agencies as we enter new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build one operating framework (reporting cadence, WBRs, MBRs, escalation paths) that works the same way across agencies, channels and countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track sales KPIs and SLAs per agency, channel and market: conversion, signed locations per rep, productivity, lead quality and adherence to the Vinted Go pitch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that give real-time visibility into performance across the whole network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot underperforming agencies or markets early and drive corrective action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate acquisition targets set by leadership into agency-level performance expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run calibration and quality assurance (call reviews, field ride-alongs) so every agency sells consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the outsourced sales budget across all agencies and countries: forecasting, spend tracking and variance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cost per outcome (CAC, cost per signed location, cost per hour) across agencies, channels and markets to drive efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and execute cost optimizations without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on budget and performance regularly to finance and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the processes and governance needed to run a multi-agency, multi-country, multi-language sales network sustainably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain playbooks for opening new markets and onboarding new agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the acquisition team to align on targets, budgets and reporting standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience managing external sales agencies or outsourced sales teams (field sales, telesales, digital lead generation), ideally across several countries and vendors at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in sales, acquisition or growth in a high-velocity environment, so you know what good looks like on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of agency performance management: setting KPIs and SLAs, running WBRs and MBRs, and driving accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership: forecasting, tracking and optimizing spend across multiple vendors or cost centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building structure and process from a relatively unstructured starting point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, working easily in dashboards, reporting tools and a CRM to track performance and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills: you hold agencies accountable while keeping the partnership productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across time zones and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; French and/or Spanish is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outsourced sales is one of the main ways Vinted Go signs new locations at scale, and it is growing in every market we enter. This role brings order, accountability and cost discipline to that network, and lays the foundation for further international and product growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-contribution meal vouchers for each workday through a convenient meal card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent position available with a considerable portfolio of works for the next 5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To build your career by assisting in the delivery of ‘leading edge’ engineering projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with a vibrant, agile and multi-functional team in delivering projects on time, safely, to budget and to the required quality standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To benefit from Kirby’s Career Development Programmes that will enhance your leadership capability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To work with the best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent package on offer with room for negotiations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kirby Group Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kirby Group Engineering is an international multi-disciplinary engineering services contractor and leading provider of high-value engineering services to a number of ‘blue chip’ companies. Operating across Ireland, the UK, Europe and South Africa, Kirby has become the engineering service provider of choice in growth segments such as pharmaceuticals, data centres and power transmission and distribution. Our culture is innovative, collaborative and performance focused. The successful candidate will have the opportunity to grow and develop in a company committed to developing talent and rewarding performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role of the Senior EHS Advisor is to provide Environment, Health and Safety guidance working with the project team. You will implement and maintain the Kirby management system for the project.&amp;nbsp; The role is to coordinate all EHS Matters within various Project Management Teams and to report constructively all EHS matters to Project Manager. Under the direction of the EHS Manager, the EHS Advisor will be responsible for providing support to the Project Managers, supervisors and workers. This position will provide leadership and coordination of the day-to-day EHS requirements of the assigned project(s).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Functions of the Senior EHS Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advice, guidance, support and instruction in all EHS matters to management, safety representatives and employees (including where applicable to sub-contractors, suppliers and visitors to sites).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership through good example. Be proactive in all matters concerning the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify training needs, report requirements to project team and carry out training as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit and inspect projects, agree and prepare achievable corrective and preventive action plans towards compliance to and continual improvement of the EHS on the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on business EHS risks, KPIs and trends accurately with data and recommend constructive actions towards continuous improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure incidents are reported and investigations are carried out in a thorough and professional manner in order to identify root causes and corrective and preventive action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that Site EHS Plans, RAMS and other associated site documents are updated and compliant with statutory and other requirements and that they are reviewed on a continuous basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EHS Advisor Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to EHS Manager, Site Managers/Supervisors and Project Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is conversant with the contents of the Kirby safety statement, environment manual, risk assessments, aspects &amp;amp; impacts, legislation and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides advice, guidance, instruction and training in all EHS matters to management, safety representatives and employees (including where applicable to sub-contractors, suppliers and visitors to sites).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carries out internal audits and site inspections in conjunction with Site Management, recommends corrective actions, improvements and document findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepares in conjunction with site management team a project specific EHS Plan, induction and Risk Assessment Method Statements (RAMS). These shall be compiled and agreed prior to work commencing and ongoing through lookaheads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures that the project specific EHS Plan, induction and RAMS are up to date, reviewed periodically and communicated to all relevant persons (including clients, Main Contractor, other contractors, visitors and others who may be affected by that work).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visits each new project, sets up the necessary site safety files (Series 500 &amp;amp; 600), registers, abstracts of regulations, posters, SEOR program, etc., and ensures that site establishment complies with the legislation, client regulations and company regulations as a minimum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews Contractor Appointments and ensures that correct appointment is carried out and that only competent contractors are used on projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduces and implements effective measures aimed at the prevention of incidents at work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports on incidents and/or dangerous occurrences should they occur to the EHS Manager, Project Manager and Site Managers as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports on areas of concern to the relevant party for correction. Persistent and serious areas of concern are to be reported immediately to line management as per (1) above. Retains evidence of communications with relevant parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carries out incident investigation in conjunction with site management, establishes cause of incident or dangerous occurrence and recommends method for future avoidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audits the company site safety file, (Series 500 &amp;amp; 600), makes sure that hazards/risks are regularly assessed, that control measures are implemented, that inspections are carried out and that all incidents are reported, investigated and closed out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepares Monthly KPI Report for their projects, issues monthly return of Site Visit Schedule, SEORs, KPIs, violations to the EHS Manager and the Business Unit Manager. Issues new SDS to EHS Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides training and information to the workforce using appropriate training aids and media as required. Issues records of training to HR to update the training matrix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attends the regional EHS Coordination Meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attends the EHS meeting with the Business Unit Manager, as required (1 per region).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attends internal and external site meetings as required – safety meetings, coordination meetings etc...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implements and promotes the company Incentive Scheme on all projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arranges distribution and maintenance of fully stocked first aid boxes on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitors P.P.E usage and advises site management on type of protective equipment required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issues non-conformances, commendations and disciplinary warnings both written and verbal if required or instructed to do so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Necessary requirement of the EHS Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years’ Experience in similar industry. Knowledge of Electrical, Mechanical and CSA preferably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diploma to NFQ 8 in Occupational H&amp;amp;S. Certificate to NFQ 6 Environmental Management. Safe Pass, (CSCS (UK)), Train the Trainer, First Aid, Training Instructor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal ISO14000 and ISO45000 system auditor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Construction Regulations and CDM roles, with experience working with sub-contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with EHS Management Systems, safety schemes and tendering e.g. ISOs, Achilles, SSiPs etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, through presentations, reports, written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with Kirby / client / main contractor Safety and Project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work well within strict deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be able to prepare Audits and EHS reports, to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to date with Legislation, Standards, Guidance, Advice and Compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in identifying positive and negative acts, ability to follow through with realistic corrective and preventive actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and coordinate incident investigations and utilise root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IOSH Member or Equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on this role, or other Construction / Engineering opportunities across Ireland, the UK, Europe, or South Africa please review our careers page (&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.kirbygroup.com/vacancies/&quot;&gt;Vacancies - Kirby Group Careers&lt;/a&gt;) or contact the Talent Acquisition Team at Kirby Group in confidence on +353 (0)1 454 0411.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kirby Group Engineering is an equal opportunities employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive workplace and welcome applications from all suitably qualified candidates, regardless of race, gender, disability, religion, sexual orientation, or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a backend-leaning Tech Lead to lead a team of 3-4 engineers and own the tech for a part of Superchat’s product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role: You’ll spend roughly half your time designing and building software and the other half enabling your team to perform at its best. Work directly on architecture, development and important projects while creating the clarity, feedback and environment your engineers need to deliver an excellent product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong, current backend engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bring 3+ years of experience as a Senior or Staff Engineer and remain deeply involved in software development. You are comfortable owning, designing and building crucial parts of production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced with the JVM ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have substantial experience with Java or another JVM language. Kotlin and AWS experience are a plus, since our backend runs on Kotlin/Quarkus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead people.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have at least 2 years of experience in a leadership role, whether as a Tech Lead, Engineering Manager, or through leading projects and owning architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong at delivery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know how to turn product goals into reality. You are used to work in fast-paced startups and are a driver to increase velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-minded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You care about solving the customers problem. You engage with product decisions, challenge assumptions constructivly and find pragmatic solutions to build things in a lean way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are able to explain complex technical things in details to Engineers and in an understandable way to non-technical stakeholders. You create alignment and motivate people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited about AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are already using AI in your development workflow and are eager to explore how it can improve engineering speed, quality and the way teams work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure people manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You no longer want to work directly on software. This role requires meaningful, ongoing involvement in architecture, implementation, code review, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hero engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You want to make every important technical decision yourself or become the bottleneck for the team. Your job is to raise the effectiveness of the whole team, not to be the only person who can solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure delivery manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You treat engineering as a ticketing operation focused only on timelines and task tracking instead of product quality, technical health, and team growth. We need engineering leaders, not project coordinators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-only operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You prefer fully remote work and don’t want to actively build relationships and culture in person with the team. We believe strong engineering leadership requires regular in-person collaboration and presence in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend approximately 50% of your time contributing directly to architecture, development, code reviews, and important technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 3-4 engineers and take responsibility for its effectiveness, technical quality, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Product Manager to understand customer problems, shape solutions, scope projects, and set priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear technical direction while enabling engineers to own decisions and develop their judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, give actionable feedback, and support each engineer’s development and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers, manage dependencies, and help the team identify delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering practices and explore effective uses of AI throughout the software-development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring through technical interviews, structured feedback, and candidate conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Your manager and partner on people development, calibration, processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;Engineers in your team; you own their development, performance and growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; PMs own what and why; you own how (delivery) and who (people)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CTO and CPO: &lt;/strong&gt;We are a lean organization with a flat hierarchy. You will regulary disccuss the direction of architecture with the CTO and product with the CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission that matters. &lt;/strong&gt;Real impact on small businesses, not abstract metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Funded with conviction. &lt;/strong&gt;$18M raised and profitable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack. &lt;/strong&gt;Kotlin/Quarkus, AWS, TypeScript/React/Next.js, and LangGraph for AI-powered features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squad-based organization. &lt;/strong&gt;Each squad owns its domain end-to-end with real ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Two clear career tracks&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; We support both individual contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Management Paths with explicit reversibility between both and Tech Lead being the first level of management that is still quite hands-on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-led structure. &lt;/strong&gt;PMs report directly to the CPO, keeping product strategy focused, consistent, and clearly prioritized&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid by design. &lt;/strong&gt;Our Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg is the center of gravity, with two work-from-home days as the standard setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct feedback culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Honest, direct, and kind feedback is part of how we work together - in 1:1s, retrospectives, and everyday collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club/John Reed membership or a public transport/Dance subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget of €500 for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that enables fast professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important to us to create an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together - whether that’s through HYROX training, golfing, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or whatever kind of community you’d like to help build here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with passion, grit, and integrity. You&#39;re encouraged to apply even if your experience doesn&#39;t precisely match the description. At Superchat, we welcome diverse perspectives and people who think rigorously.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocating to Berlin? We support you with practical relocation help. You&#39;ll feel home in no time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With your application you agree to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&quot;&gt;privacy policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;You will be a senior technical contributor within Combustion Devices, responsible for high-fidelity combustion CFD and the physical understanding &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt; to design, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;assess&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt; and mature liquid rocket engine combustion hardware. You will apply reactive-flow simulation, combustion &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;fundamentals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt; and test correlation to injectors, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;preburners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;, gas generators, ignition &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt; and main combustion chambers, ensuring that designs are performant, stable, thermally &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt;robust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot;&gt; and ready for manufacture and hot-fire testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW185765873 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own and execute CFD analyses of reacting flows in liquid rocket engine combustion devices, from model definition and meshing through solution, verification, validation and technical recommendation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and apply &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;premixed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, partially premixed and non-premixed combustion models for rocket-relevant propellant systems and operating conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Perform steady and transient RANS/URANS and, where justified, scale-resolving simulations such as LES to investigate mixing, ignition, flame stabilisation, combustion efficiency and unsteady heat release.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Model injector and chamber flows including atomisation, evaporation, multiphase effects, real-gas behaviour, conjugate heat transfer and wall heat flux where relevant to the design question.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Assess combustion stability and operability, including flame dynamics, pressure oscillations, injector coupling, acoustic interaction, chugging and high-frequency instability risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build robust CFD workflows in Simcenter STAR-CCM+ and Ansys Fluent, including geometry preparation, meshing strategies, solver setup, automation, post-processing and model-quality documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Correlate simulations against component, cold-flow and hot-fire test data; quantify model uncertainty and clearly define the limits of predictive confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Translate CFD results into practical design decisions for injectors, chambers, preburners, gas generators, igniters, cooling concepts and combustion-device interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work closely with design, thermal, structures, materials, test, engine systems and manufacturing teams to converge combustion-device designs and resolve multidisciplinary issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Plan analysis and validation activities, review work from colleagues and external partners, and contribute to technical reviews, development roadmaps and risk-retirement plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Advance combustion modelling methods, engineering standards and reusable best practices across the Propulsion organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;MSc or PhD in aerospace engineering, mechanical engineering, chemical engineering, computational engineering or a comparable technical discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Typically 5–10 years of professional experience in rocket propulsion, with substantial hands-on responsibility for combustion CFD and combustion-device development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of fundamental combustion physics, chemical kinetics, flame structure, turbulence–chemistry interaction, ignition and extinction phenomena.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience modelling reactive premixed and non-premixed flows under rocket-engine-relevant pressure, temperature and mixture-ratio conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Simcenter STAR-CCM+ and/or Ansys Fluent for complex reacting-flow simulations; strong capability in meshing, solver selection, convergence assessment and post-processing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of liquid rocket engine combustion devices, particularly injectors, preburners or gas generators, main combustion chambers, igniters and associated thermal environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with CFD verification and validation, mesh and time-step sensitivity, uncertainty assessment and correlation to experimental or hot-fire data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python, MATLAB or a comparable language for automation, data reduction and engineering analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong technical ownership, first-principles judgement, clear communication and professional fluency in English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
