&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ128R96&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the automotive/OEM vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within one of Germany’s largest automotive/OEM company. You will be part of an account team supporting this highly strategic client. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the automotive/OEM vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-quiet list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of your flagship account, define a clear strategy, and relentlessly drive it to exceed revenue and consumption goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will turn that strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve your targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will build boardroom‑level relationships, becoming the trusted advisor on all things data and AI for senior stakeholders up to and including C‑level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will uncover and shape new business, expanding use cases and driving deeper platform consumption across your account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will orchestrate the full Databricks ecosystem, mobilising internal teams to maximise impact and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will demonstrate compelling value in every engagement, leading confident, insight‑led negotiations that take opportunities all the way to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;What we look for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;A proven record of exceeding revenue targets in complex enterprise sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Recognised automotive domain expertise, applied to expanding strategic automotive/OEM accounts in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Proven success selling data, analytics, big data, AI, or other highly technical cloud software solutions through complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year enterprise sales cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify high-impact data and AI use cases and engage key buying centres to expand Databricks’ footprint and strategic relevance within an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based, land-and-expand models, with the ability to drive sustained growth within a single strategic account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact at LILA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a talent-dense, high-agency AI safety team at Lila that will engage all core teams within the organization (science, model training, lab integration, etc.), to identify and mitigate risks from scientific superintelligence while retaining the core scientific discovery capabilities of the stack. The initial focus of this team will be to build and implement a bespoke safety strategy for Lila, tailored to its specific goals and deployment strategies. This will involve technical safety strategy development, broader ecosystem engagement, safety-focused evaluations, safety systems to mitigate risks, and a research agenda that explores longer-term needs such as oversight of superintelligent scientific systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As scientific AI systems become more capable and autonomous, their safety assessment and safeguards must develop alongside them. At Lila Sciences, you will help build the research methods and tools that make this possible, so that more and more decision-enablers can be automated safely. This will move us closer to the vision of a safety and security apparatus that is robust to a fully autonomous scientific engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your initial focus will be misuse: developing flexible and automated red-teaming approaches that test safety-relevant scientific capabilities and the robustness of safeguards. You will also contribute to safety automation beyond red teaming, helping the team evaluate, monitor and respond to risks across increasingly autonomous scientific workflows. You will own reusable research methods and assessment tools, working with mitigation engineers who implement protective mechanisms. We welcome Research Scientists and Research Engineers; responsibilities can span or evolve between the two profiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run capability evaluations of scientific models, agents and tool-mediated workflows (including simulated lab environments), working with domain experts to make tests scientifically meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create methods or systems that explore diverse failure modes, adapt tests as evidence emerges and support systematic investigation beyond fixed benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reproducible experiments and evaluation tools that capture relevant behavior, outcomes and the evidence needed to interpret findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the quality and coverage of automated assessments, including failure cases in the evaluators themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop broader safety automation, across threat model management, evidence triage, regression testing, monitoring workflows or tools that help researchers assess and respond to risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with risk researchers and mitigation engineers to translate findings into improved assessments and safeguards, and verify whether those changes work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong empirical judgment, practical programming ability and experience working with modern AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to investigate ambiguous failures, design informative comparisons and communicate limitations clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in scientific misuse risks and the ability to collaborate productively with domain specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the Research Scientist profile:&lt;/strong&gt; evidence of selecting valuable research questions, developing or adapting methods, and designing experiments that yield defensible conclusions. You should be able to prototype and test your ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the Research Engineer profile:&lt;/strong&gt; evidence of building reliable research software, evaluation infrastructure or agent systems that enable reproducible experiments and efficient iteration. You should be able to contribute to experimental design and interpretation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated red teaming, adversarial testing or evaluation-method research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scientific AI, tool-using agents, laboratory automation or other complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with safety monitoring, model-based evaluators or scalable experimental infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive base compensation with bonus potential and generous early-stage equity. Your final offer will reflect your background, expertise, and expected impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time U.S. employees receive a comprehensive benefits program including medical, dental, and vision coverage; employer-paid life and disability insurance; flexible time off with generous company wide holidays; paid parental leave; an educational assistance program; commuter benefits, including bike share memberships for office based employees; and a company subsidized lunch program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employees outside the U.S. receive a comprehensive benefits program tailored to their region. USD salary ranges apply only to U.S.-based positions; international salaries are set to local market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Expected Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$298,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LILA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is building Scientific Superintelligence™ to solve humankind&#39;s greatest challenges. We believe science is the most inspiring frontier for AI. Rather than hard-coding expert knowledge into tools, LILA builds systems that can learn for themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LILA combines advanced AI models with proprietary AI Science Factory™ instruments into an operating system for science that executes the entire scientific method autonomously, accelerating discovery at unprecedented speed, scale, and impact across medicine, materials, and energy. Learn more at www.lila.ai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided by our core values of truth, trust, curiosity, grit, and velocity, we move with startup speed while tackling problems of historic importance. If this sounds like an environment you&#39;d love to work in, even if you don&#39;t meet every qualification listed above, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re All In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is&amp;nbsp;committed to equal employment opportunity&amp;nbsp;regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information you provide during your application process will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lila.ai/candidate-privacy-policy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note to Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lila Sciences does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than candidates. The submission of unsolicited resumes by recruitment or staffing agencies to Lila Sciences or its employees is strictly prohibited unless contacted directly by Lila Science’s internal Talent Acquisition team. Any resume submitted by an agency in the absence of a signed agreement will automatically become the property of Lila Sciences, and Lila Sciences will not owe any referral or other fees with respect thereto.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;AI Quality Assurance Program Manager I Tripadvisor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tripadvisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tripadvisor Group connects people to experiences worth sharing, and aims to be the world’s most trusted source for travel and experiences. We leverage our brands, technology, and capabilities to connect our global audience with partners through rich content, travel guidance, and two-sided marketplaces for experiences, accommodations, restaurants, and other travel categories. The subsidiaries of Tripadvisor, Inc. (Nasdaq: TRIP), include a portfolio of travel brands and businesses, including Tripadvisor, Viator, and TheFork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The AI Quality Assurance Program Manager ensures that all artificial intelligence systems across Tripadvisor’s Travel Experiences execute reliably, accurately, and aligned with business goals. Positioning yourself at the intersection of AI performance, traveler satisfaction, and product development, you will establish testing frameworks, audit AI outputs, and turn quality findings into actionable operational insights. You will drive performance tracking, unblock cross-functional teams, and regularly report AI accuracy, success metrics, and enhancement roadmaps to executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Job Location: Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is a hybrid position that requires 2/3 days per week/month in our London Office.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the AI-Era Quality Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Establish the end-to-end quality framework across human agents and AI agents, evolving QA from traditional sample-based auditing toward continuous, AI-enabled quality management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish AI Quality &amp;amp; Testing Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Design and maintain comprehensive evaluation benchmarks, testing protocols, and human-in-the-loop (HITL) workflows to verify AI agents, support bots, and recommendation engines operate as intended.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit AI Outputs &amp;amp; Traveler Interactions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Continuously evaluate AI-generated outputs (e.g., automated support chats, tour recommendation accuracy, and booking updates) for intent fulfillment, safety, tone, and hallucination prevention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Updates &amp;amp; Insights:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Deliver executive-ready reporting that translates complex QA evaluation data, model accuracy rates, and error trends into strategic recommendations for business leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cross-Functional AI Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Partner closely with Data Science, AI Engineering, Product, and CX teams to turn QA findings into prompt refinements, model fine-tuning, and updated knowledge base inputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Release Momentum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Track project timelines for new AI deployments, manage QA regression testing schedules, and hold technical teams accountable to quality standards before full traveler rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;4–6 years in technical program management, QA management, or AI/ML product operations focused on system reliability and evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Evaluation Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Strong operational knowledge of AI/LLM testing methodologies, prompt evaluation, intent recognition accuracy, and AI safety guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insight Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Proven ability to analyze AI logs, leverage analytics tools, and turn quality metrics into clear, executive-ready presentations and dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Exceptional track record of bridging technical AI engineering teams with business stakeholders and front-line traveler support operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Empathy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Deep interest in online travel, traveler behavior, and maintaining high trust across consumer-facing AI interactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with modern LLM evaluation tools, annotation platforms, or customer service AI tools (e.g., Zendesk AI, Intercom, Salesforce).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in travel tech, e-commerce marketplaces, or fast-scaling consumer platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation packages (routinely benchmarked against the latest industry data), including base salary and annual bonuses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Work your way” with flexibility to suit your lifestyle. Tripadvisor Group takes a remote-friendly approach to collaboration across a worldwide team, with the option to join on-site as often as you’d like or as required by your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedule. Work-life balance is ingrained in our culture by design. Trust and accountability make it work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Donation matching. Give back? Give more! We match qualifying charitable donations annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition assistance. Want to level up your career? We love to hear it! Receive annual support for qualified programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle benefit. An annual benefit to spend on yourself. Use it on travel, wellness, or whatever suits you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel perks. We believe that travel is employee development, so we provide discounts and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance program. We’re here for you with resources and programs to help you through life’s challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health benefits. We offer great coverage and competitive premiums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous referral scheme. Help us grow and be rewarded with generous awards for referring successful candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Cultural Pillars:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Traveler first&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to create value for our customer, the traveler. We enable our suppliers and partners to unlock this value. Their collective behaviors and insights are what drives us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution is our edge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We act fast, experiment, learn from failure, iterate, and improve the solutions of tomorrow across every aspect of our business. Our execution is agile, data-driven, prioritised, and built to scale. We assume no problem is someone else’s problem and finish what can be done today, knowing tomorrow will bring fresh challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We succeed together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best outcomes are driven by empathic, humble, and diverse subject matter experts working toward shared goals. We collaborate relentlessly, challenge assumptions, give actionable feedback, and set each other up for success through empowered teams with a clear charter. We transparently take ownership of our growth, individually and as a team. We celebrate the quality of our effort, our learnings, and our collective achievements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all candidates. If you need a reasonable accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please make sure to reach out to your individual recruiter or our team at -----
&lt;p&gt;If you have any additional questions about careers at Tripadvisor you can email us at ----- We have all the answers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-WR1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Counsel, Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regulatory Counsel, Europe will be responsible for providing legal advice and strategy for the significant regulatory matters for Payoneer in Ireland, the United Kingdom and other jurisdictions in Europe. The position is based in Dublin or London and will report to the Global Regulatory Counsel in New York City.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Be Responsible For:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing legal advice to assist Payoneer in the evaluation and management of significant and complex payments and financial services industry regulatory matters in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the Ireland and UK management, compliance, and finance teams in building and maintaining good working relationships with regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researching, analyzing and determining effects of quickly evolving regulations in multiple markets, and keeping current on issues and upcoming regulatory changes that may impact Payoneer’s strategic goals and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising and working with outside counsel in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting business, marketing and other teams with the development of new services, and fostering strong relationships across multiple functional areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to work/live in Ireland or the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified to practice law in Ireland or the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6-7 years of legal experience, including experience providing legal advice to the financial services industry. Payments industry and electronic money institution experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with regulators and regulatory authorities is an advantage but not strictly required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate fact situations, identify legal issues, analyze and understand statutes, regulations and recommend appropriate courses of action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide practical legal advice and recommendations to internal stakeholders on matters of significant importance to the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle a diverse set of issues and provide a high level of service to internal customers in a friendly and professional manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open communicator with skill in establishing and maintaining effective working relationships at all levels of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility for occasional travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build each other up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping each other grow, as professionals and people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a business, a community, and a mission you want to be part of, apply today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing a diverse and inclusive workplace. Payoneer is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment no matter your race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you require reasonable accommodation at any stage of the hiring process, please speak to the recruiter managing the role for any adjustments. Decisions about requests for reasonable accommodation are made on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Since 2004, we’ve been bringing investment ideas to life and connecting capital with the right people and opportunities. Today, we manage more than £2.5 billion for a broad range of investors across five key investment strategies: Private Credit,&amp;nbsp;Social Housing, Clean Heat, Energy and Venture. These strategies underpin the innovative range of investments we offer to both private (retail) and institutional clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There are 230+ employees at Triple Point, all committed to leaving the world demonstrably better than we found it. That’s why we’re a certified B Corp, signed up to the Principles for Responsible Investment, and were named a Sunday Times &lt;em&gt;&#39;Best Place to Work&amp;nbsp; 2025 &amp;amp; 2026&#39;&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;f this sounds like an environment where you would flourish, then read on…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Function &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Triple Point Specialty Finance provides revolving credit facility (RCF) warehouse funding to UK alternative lenders, supplying liquidity and capital to parts of the non-bank lending market that might otherwise be underserved. It&#39;s a fast-growing division within Triple Point Private Credit and is a strong opportunity for someone from a structured finance, capital markets or securitisation background, with a working knowledge of LMA documentation, to take genuine ownership of deals from origination through to Credit Committee and completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;amp; The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Origination Director, you&#39;ll own a portfolio of asset-backed facility relationships end-to-end: sourcing and structuring new transactions, leading Credit Committee presentations, and managing your book through legal completion and beyond. You&#39;ll lead new transactions, represent Triple Point at industry events, and help broaden the introducer network that feeds the wider team&#39;s pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond your own deals, you&#39;ll be a visible market voice internally, and supporting colleagues on complex or strategic opportunities across the existing portfolio. The team is currently building out new capabilities, including Forward Flow, mezzanine and incubator strategies, so there is real scope to help shape where Specialty Finance goes next rather than simply execute what&#39;s already established.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end structuring and delivery of a minimum of three new money debt transactions a year, for both new and existing Triple Point borrowers, from origination through to legal completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit Committee &amp;amp; Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Present transactions to Credit Committee and manage relationships with the management teams of new and existing borrowers throughout the deal lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Origination &amp;amp; Market Profile:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain a network of borrowers and intermediaries; represent Triple Point at a minimum of four industry or sector events a year to build the Specialty Finance profile and broaden the introducer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio &amp;amp; Risk Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyse borrower financials, loan portfolios and borrowing base information to identify, communicate and challenge early warning signs; ensure internal risk and portfolio reporting, including Aspire, is accurate and complete at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Knowledge &amp;amp; Internal Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain current knowledge of the UK Specialty Finance and asset-backed finance markets, including products, competitors, pricing and opportunity, and share this with Credit, RST and Management to increase internal awareness of the sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting the Wider Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Support on complex or strategic opportunities within the existing portfolio, and help mentor more junior colleagues (Associate Directors, Portfolio Managers) in deal skills and credit judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialty Finance Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience in lending and loan documentation across a bank or non-bank environment, including a minimum of 3 years in Specialty Finance or a related field such as structured finance, capital markets or securitisation, with a particular focus on asset-backed financing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of leading transactions end-to-end, including preparing and presenting detailed credit applications for new money transactions, ideally from a front-office debt origination or structuring role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Analysis &amp;amp; Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in Excel for analysing financial models, loan tapes and financial statements, including sensitivity analysis and portfolio wind-down scenarios; ability to read and analyse company accounts, management information and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; A confident, independent negotiator, able to identify Triple Point&#39;s non-negotiable terms while finding solutions that keep borrowers engaged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal skills, comfortable presenting to Credit Committee and managing workflows across multiple external parties, including borrowers and legal counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong relationship-builder, both internally (Credit, Risk, Portfolio, Management) and externally (borrowers, brokers, advisers, private equity firms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree level, ideally supported by a professional qualification in accountancy, banking or risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Work — Our Values in Action&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You ask questions that change how we do things and spot ideas to grow assets or fee income in new ways; you keep a genuine pulse on market conditions, competitor activity and investor appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Generous:&lt;/strong&gt; You share your network and market knowledge freely, and help more junior colleagues develop their deal and credit skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Action:&lt;/strong&gt; You balance commercial acumen with risk management, identifying issues and pain points ahead of time and simplifying complexity for others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pull Together:&lt;/strong&gt; You collaborate across Credit, RST and Management, staying aware of the team&#39;s capacity constraints and stepping in to help where useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It:&lt;/strong&gt; You take full accountability for your transactions and portfolio, acting as a steward of Triple Point&#39;s capital from origination through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll join a talented, collaborative team in a connected environment where ideas and initiative are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a growing and innovative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a competitive salary, a comprehensive benefits package, and genuine opportunities for growth and progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional development and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Triple Point, high performance means living our values every day:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Curious. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Generous. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take Thoughtful Action. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pull Together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own It.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In line with our values &lt;em&gt;Stay Curious&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Take Thoughtful Action&lt;/em&gt; every employee has access to AI tools. We see technology as a co-pilot, helping us improve efficiency and insight while keeping decisions grounded in thoughtful human judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triple Point offers a wealth of benefits including a contributory pension, hybrid/flexible working and ongoing learning and development opportunities. Check out our comprehensive list of benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.triplepoint.co.uk/careers/42/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today for further information!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
