&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ128R182&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is redefining what organisations can achieve with data and AI. As the unified platform powering the world&#39;s most ambitious data-driven enterprises, we sit at the intersection of cloud migrations, AI transformation, and real-time intelligence and our customers challenge us every day to go further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Forward Deployed Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead a high-performing team of Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs) at the forefront of this transformation. Partnering with Databricks&#39; most strategic enterprise customers, you will shape how leading organisations migrate to the lakehouse, build next-generation AI and GenAI systems, and unlock sustained business value from their data investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a people leader, you will build and scale a team that represents Databricks&#39; highest standard of technical excellence and customer impact. Your team will partner with enterprises across industries to architect and deliver mission-critical solutions, from large-scale data migrations and legacy modernisation programs to cutting-edge generative AI, MLOps, and AI agent deployments. You will set the bar for delivery quality, grow world-class talent, and drive the strategic governance framework that ensures every engagement is executed with precision and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee regional performance targets, including billable utilisation, team growth, and hiring, while championing delivery excellence and customer success across the FDE portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives, Engagement Managers, and Field Engineering leaders to position, scope, and deliver transformational Professional Services (PS) programs spanning data migrations, AI/ML platforms, and advanced analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices for project oversight, risk management, and quality standards that scale with a growing FDE practice, ensuring projects are delivered on time and to specification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesise field insights from your team’s engagements to provide direct feedback to Engineering and Product management, helping to guide the Databricks roadmap while driving the creation of reusable customer accelerators and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the critical escalation point for high-stakes customer situations, leveraging deep technical credibility and leadership judgment to protect strategic relationships and drive rapid resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor Forward Deployed Engineers through structured career pathways, technical coaching, and a culture of innovation, mastery, and continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we look for:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years leading high-performing technical delivery teams, with a proven track record building excellence-driven cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a technical solutions architect or data/AI engineer, providing coaching credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Databricks, Apache Spark™, MLflow, Delta Lake, or the modern data and AI ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting / professional services background with a hands-on technical foundation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical depth to personally build with AI, coach teams with best practices, drive organisation-wide adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading large-scale data platform migrations and AI/ML programs in enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technical project delivery, including scope, timelines, and SOW management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills navigating complex, high-stakes customer environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to customer sites approximately 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a hyperscaler (Google, AWS, Azure) or a top data/AI company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An in-house/industry stint alongside vendor-side delivery experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin helps customers grow their wealth through savings and investments without barriers. But even the best products and the smoothest experience lose their value if customers pay more tax than they need to, or have to work out, declare and settle their taxes themselves. The Customer Taxation Team makes sure they don’t.&amp;nbsp; We design how tax works in Raisin’s tax-advantaged products, a growing part of our offer. Examples include the new Raisin Cash ISA in the UK and the Raisin Kinderdepot, a children’s investment account that uses the child’s tax allowances automatically. We also calculate and withhold tax on the interest and returns customers earn, handle their tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates, and provide the annual tax documents they need for their tax return. And we send the tax reports that authorities require.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raisin is available in many European countries, each with its own tax rules and reporting duties. As new regulations come to our platform, we make sure Raisin complies. You will lead a cross-functional team and work closely with Legal, Compliance, Country Management, Product Operations, Customer Service, Data, and external tax and banking partners. Our goal is for customers to trust that their tax is right, find it easy to manage, use the tax allowances they are entitled to, and have peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own a regulated domain that customers depend on every tax year. Working with an experienced Engineering Lead, you will become the go-to expert for customer taxation at Raisin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer taxation end to end: Define the vision and roadmap together with Product and Engineering leadership. Take each topic from discovery to delivery to measured impact. Decide what we build first, and keep stakeholders aligned on priorities, risks and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tax accurate and reliable: Agree with Legal, Compliance and country managers on what correct looks like. Work with Engineering so calculation, documents and reporting stay stable and easy to extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow Raisin’s tax proposition: Shape how tax works when Raisin enters new markets, launches tax-advantaged products or brings on new partners. Find where we can take tax work off customers’ hands, so they don’t have to declare and settle it themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex rules into simple experiences: Translate the &amp;nbsp;tax rules behind each launch into clear requirements with the edge cases covered. Design the customer experience and see the work through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the deadlines that cannot move: Make sure annual tax documents and statutory reports go out correct and on time, working with Product Operations. Plan backwards from fixed dates and monitor data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catch errors before they reach customers, and escalate early when a date is at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make tax effortless for customers: Keep self-service for tax exemption orders and non-assessment certificates intuitive, so customers get them right the first time. Give Customer Service the tools to answer tax questions fast, especially around tax season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the team culture: Give and ask for feedback openly, share wins with the team, and treat mistakes as a reason to fix the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Must haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product management experience, including ownership of a technical product such as a back-end, platform or data-heavy service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a cross-functional product team and getting engineers and stakeholders behind shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or taking products into new markets, with the precision to get every edge case right, because one wrong tax rule can affect thousands of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the habit of checking and reconciling numbers yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about tax and a drive to make it feel easy for customers, even when the rules behind it are not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn fast, take feedback well and change course when new facts come in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energy, a strong work ethic and a hands-on attitude to detailed work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured written English, and the confidence to explain trade-offs to senior leaders and say no with a reason.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated field such as banking, payments, insurance or tax technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the tax regime in one or more of Raisin’s markets, for example Germany (Abgeltungsteuer, tax exemption orders), or of statutory reporting such as CRS. Tax knowledge is not required. We will teach you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built tools for operations or customer service teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important attributes for this role:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bridge product and engineering. You are comfortable discussing data models and architecture trade-offs, and you push for practical solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom eine neue Art von Medienagentur und eine der führenden Marken der WPP Media. Auf der Grundlage von Analysen und Erkenntnissen und angetrieben durch Daten und Technologie glauben wir an die Kraft von Medien und Kreativität, um den besten Marken der Welt zum Durchbruch zu verhelfen. Wir sind für die neue Kommunikationswirtschaft konzipiert - für Menschen und Algorithmen, mit unterschiedlichen Denkanstzen, um in großem Maßstab zu testen und zu lernen, und vor allem, um sich weiterzuentwickeln.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Media Consultant (Mensch)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du strategische:r Hauptansprechpartner:in und Sparringspartner:in für unsere Kundinnen und Kunden. Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für anspruchsvolle Mandate, steuerst komplexe Medienprojekte und treibst die strategische Weiterentwicklung unserer Kundenbeziehungen aktiv voran.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Kundenberatung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du berätst deine Kunden souverän auf Entscheiderebene, verstehst deren Business-Ziele tiefgreifend und etablierst langfristige, vertrauensvolle Partnerschaften.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategieentwicklung &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verantwortest die Entwicklung maßgeschneiderter, datengestützter und zukunftsfähiger Omnichannel-Mediastrategien und setzt proaktiv Impulse bei Trend- und Fokusthemen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ganzheitliches Kampagnenmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du steuerst und optimierst komplexe, medienübergreifende Werbekampagnen von der Konzeption über die Exekution bis hin zur Nachbereitung und Ableitung von Learning-Frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markt- &amp;amp; Wettbewerbsanalyse:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du analysierst Markt- und Wettbewerbsdynamiken vorausschauend, identifizierst neue Marktchancen und übersetzt Insights in konkrete Wachstumspotenziale für deine Kunden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgetverantwortung &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verantwortest und steuerst auch umfangreiche Werbebudgets zielgerichtet, um den ROI deiner Kunden kontinuierlich zu maximieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schnittstelle &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Als zentrale Schnittstelle begleitest du Kampagnen über ihren gesamten Lifecycle hinweg, bringst interne Fachbereiche zusammen und stehst Nachwuchskräften im Team als Sparringspartner:in und Mentor:in zur Seite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du bringst fundierte, mehrjährige Erfahrung (ca. 4+ Jahre) in der Mediaplanung, der Agenturwelt oder im Medienberatungsumfeld mit und verweist auf nachweisbare Erfolge in der eigenständigen Führung komplexer Etats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exzellentes Markt- &amp;amp; Trendverständnis:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du kennst die Mediendynamiken (Digital &amp;amp; Klassik) im Detail, behältst neue Technologien im Blick und verstehst es, Marktveränderungen gewinnbringend zu nutzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategische Beratungskompetenz:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du überzeugst durch ausgeprägtes Business-Verständnis, Verhandlungsgeschick und die Fähigkeit, vielschichtige Kundenbedürfnisse in erfolgreiche Media-Roadmaps zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starke Analytik &amp;amp; ROI-Fokus:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Der sichere Umgang mit komplexen Kennzahlen und Datenanalysen ist für dich selbstverständlich – du leitest daraus präzise Handlungsempfehlungen ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Überzeugende Präsentationsstärke:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du pitchst und präsentierst souverän auf C-Level, fesselst dein Publikum mit starkem Storytelling und überzeugst durch deine authentische, gewinnende Art&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;/strong&gt; #strategisch #lösungsorientiert #innovativ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM Core team improve the health of the Session History area. You will write tests to improve the coverage; you will fix tests and/or problems to improve the Gecko correctness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write Web-Platform tests to improve the coverage, and Gecko mochitests as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fix the problems and pass the tests to improve the Gecko correctness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improved Session History test coverage and code correctness in Gecko, measured by passed test cases, allowing the team’s senior engineers to focus on security, performance and strategic projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase or in automating for a browser-engine, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid Javascript and applying that language skill to write automated tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in and experience developing software in C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging skills in a mature larget codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM LWS team to implement tasks for Storage Encryption everywhere, helping to drive the in-progress project through to completion .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contributing to delivering Storage Encryption Everywhere in Gecko, which may include tasks such as migrating data between schemas, implementing data storage in PBM and integration testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write and pass Web Platform Tests, and add Gecko tests as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Surface and help resolve any specification questions the implementation raises.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Shepherd the feature through Nightly, Beta, and Release. Fix correctness, performance issues and regressions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ship Storage Encryption Everywhere to release channel. Fix triaged and prioritized issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in databases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging and optimization in a multithreaded codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the relevant standards body and specification process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help reduce Firefox’s WebCompat bug backlog by finishing or verifying the diagnosis of the long tail of site-breakage bugs, and by writing interventions or simple fixes (often with AI assistance). You turn a large queue of reported breakages into diagnosed, actionable, or fixed bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finish diagnosing, or verify the diagnosis of, long-tail WebCompat bugs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write WebCompat interventions where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write simple fixes (AI-assisted) and land them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reproduce and triage incoming site-breakage reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid web development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and comfort debugging real-world site breakage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluent with browser devtools and cross-browser diagnosis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable using AI tooling to speed up diagnosis and fixes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Gecko knowledge is a strong plus (but can be taught).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior WebCompat or web-standards experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Gecko platform is the core engine of our product experience. To maintain competitiveness and user satisfaction, we must move beyond surface-level metrics to understand the deep correlations between engine performance and real-world user behavior. We currently face challenges with data quality, such as bot contamination in nightly telemetry, which obscures our understanding of true performance trends. A dedicated analyst is required to bridge the gap between engineering telemetry and actionable product strategy, ensuring that leadership has high-fidelity data to prioritize performance guardrails and technical budgets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automated Dashboards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Create and maintain high-level overview dashboards that translate complex performance data into consumable formats for Product Managers and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Audit the Gecko codebase to identify missing collection points or &quot;probes&quot; necessary for a complete understanding of the product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Sanitization Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Develop methodologies and tools to identify and filter data inconsistencies, specifically focusing on isolating bot traffic and hardware-specific noise from telemetry streams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behavioral Inference Reports:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Deliver deep-dive analyses correlating technical performance shifts (e.g., LCP, eTLD+1) with user-facing pain points and engagement trends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope, Skills, and Effort Estimate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The analyst will focus exclusively on Gecko engine telemetry across multiple platforms (Desktop and Android), collaborating with the Performance Team, Data Team, and Product Leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Advanced SQL (BigQuery/Redash), proficiency in data visualization using AI tooling, and experience with statistical analysis (e.g., Pearson’s correlation, multivariate analysis). Knowledge of Rust/C++ is a strong plus. Strong proficiency with AI tools like Claude Code, Codex, or similar is highly desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Ability to understand browser component interactions and their impact on user experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Proven ability to work independently, translating technical requirements into business insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent problem solving:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Comfortable working in unfamiliar technical problem spaces and figuring out a path forward with minimal guidance, using documentation, experimentation, source code, data, and other available resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Tier 1 Locations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$93,450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,600 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Tier 2 Locations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$84,600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$112,800 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€62.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€82.800 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£58,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£78,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

