&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global leadership role accountable for how clients experience Kaluza day to day. Reporting to the VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations, you&#39;ll run three global functions and hold global accountability for client support and SLA performance across every client and region:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Support (incl. Incident &amp;amp; Problem Management)&lt;/strong&gt; - our client-facing service desk, owning triage and first-contact resolution, incident response and the client/product-team relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Platform Performance Assurance (KPPA)&lt;/strong&gt; - our neutral source of truth on platform performance, monitoring contractual SLAs and journey health per client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Product Specialists (KPS)&lt;/strong&gt; - Global retail-energy experts fixing broken journeys and operational gaps outside core platform coverage - driving an automation-by-default approach across all client brands&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead the practice / craft globally, set the strategy and standard for how each operates, and be the steady, credible presence clients and colleagues rely on - from a board-level service review to a live Sev1. Specifically, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Client Support, Incident &amp;amp; Problem Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own incident response end to end - severity, Major Incident command, root cause analysis, client communication and resolution within contractual SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage incoming support requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Problem Management, driving root-cause remediation and reducing the rate and duration of incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep support frictionless - shielding Product &amp;amp; Engineering from noise while closing the loop with clients, and making sure postmortems land as real systemic change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SLA &amp;amp; Performance Assurance (KPPA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global monitoring of contractual SLAs, KPIs and performance metrics as the agreed source of truth per client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the assurance loop - prevent, diagnose, treat - and coordinate performance reporting into Client Service Reviews and senior leadership, raising events when performance deviates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the line on data integrity (Datadog, Jira, Databricks) and embed Kaluza&#39;s Global Standard SLAs consistently across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial relationship, budget and roadmap with our key Operational tooling vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight and inputs on commercial conversations related to client reporting of performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Resolution &amp;amp; Product Specialists (KPS)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the processes that fix broken journeys and coverage gaps across all of our client brands, including new clients as we grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance scheduled and ad-hoc work while keeping a safe, well-governed operational estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed recurring manual interventions back to Product &amp;amp; Tech as signals for systemic fixes, and drive down manual effort through automation and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across all three, you&#39;ll be genuinely AI-native - pushing AI into support, assurance and operations so each function does more with less - and you&#39;ll operate fluently at every altitude, staying neutral, evidence-led and a steady presence under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An accomplished operations and support leader with a strong track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder, not an executor - you define what good looks like, take full accountability, and go looking for what you need rather than waiting for a brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely AI-native - AI feels like leverage, and you actively push it into support, assurance and operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steady in ambiguity - nimble, sharp and decisive in a live incident, and a steady presence clients and colleagues rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced leading client support, service operations or service management at scale, ideally across multiple regions and enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in incident and problem management (severity and Major Incident command, postmortem culture, root-cause remediation) and in managing against contractual SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to understand, or quickly master, retail-energy operations and the operational reality of running processes around a platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with the data and tooling of assurance - SLAs, KPIs, observability (Datadog), Jira Service Management, and BI/warehouse tooling (Databricks/BigQuery) - enough to challenge the numbers, not just receive them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible partner to senior leadership and C-level clients, especially in a tense service review or live incident.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong people leader and coach across multiple disciplines, able to build a self-solving, high-performing culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to radical candour and customer centricity, with experience scaling a high-growth SaaS business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Bank Holidays - Giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including up to 26 weeks full pay for primary caregivers and 4 weeks full pay for secondary caregivers when welcoming a new addition to your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life - our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion is looking for a talented and passionate Meta Designer to join our London studio, helping shape the combat experience for our first-person shooter mobile title. This role focuses on designing and managing metagame, live, and progression features to create a satisfying and sustainable mobile experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own key metagame features from conception through live, coordinating with design, art, UX, engineering, and product management throughout the whole process. As a live game you will need to design features with iteration and extensibility in mind and analyze live data to expand and improve your features over time. We are looking for someone who brings both craft knowledge, an excitement to try new things, and a genuine love of action games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role you will work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of designing, prototyping, and implementing progression, economy, and engagement features that align with the creative vision of the game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define, analyze, and take action on analytics, feature data, and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with live and product management teams to define goals and implement solutions to boost engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with art, animation, audio, design and engineering teams to build content and solve problems in a multi-disciplinary environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and balance in-game economies across many different metagame features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX and engineering to ensure features are implemented in ways that meet the engagement goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse player data, feedback, and behaviours to identify and fix metagame issues and retention barriers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work concurrently on multiple features at varying stages of development, managing priorities effectively as content pipelines run in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and communicate metagame feature concepts clearly to ensure alignment across all development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in Metagame / Progression / Engagement Design or an equivalent role in the video game industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one shipped title in a design role for a live service title&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing progression, economy, or engagement features for live gamesKnowledge and experience analyzing KPIs and player behaviour data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Unreal game engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse gameplay data and player feedback to inform and balance design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to work effectively across cross-disciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage multiple designs in a fast-paced development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about action games with a deep understanding of what makes enemy designs engaging and memorable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mobile games with an understanding of mobile player behaviour and market leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with visual scripting or rapid prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avid gamer with a genuine enthusiasm for crafting engaging progression and metagame features and motivating players over a long period of time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;#LI-NH3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Manager with strong experience in Field Service Management (FSM), Facility Management, or operational workflow-driven SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Joblogic, you will play a key role in shaping the future of our platform by deeply understanding how service contractors operate and translating complex operational workflows into intuitive product solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with engineering, UX, customer-facing teams, and customers themselves to identify real-world operational challenges and build solutions that simplify the daily work of engineers, planners, helpdesk teams, and operations managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys solving real operational problems, working closely with users, and building workflow-driven B2B SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_your_main_focus_will_be_1&quot;&gt;What your main focus will be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead discovery with customers across&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;field service and facilities management operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand and map operational workflows including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reactive maintenance jobs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planned Preventative Maintenance (PPM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduling and dispatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field engineer mobile workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quote → job → invoicing journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You will be expected to:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex operational problems into clear product requirements and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX designers to create intuitive workflows and product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prioritise roadmap initiatives aligned with product strategy and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to ensure solutions are practical, scalable, and deliver real operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate product ideas through customer interviews, field research, and prototype testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product adoption, workflow performance, and user behaviour to continuously improve features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams including Sales, Customer Success, and Support to ensure successful feature adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_you_bring_2&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Product Manager within B2B SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Field Service Management, Facilities Management, or operational workflow-based software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating real-world operational processes into clear product logic and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills and ability to conduct customer interviews and uncover real problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with UX designers and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to manage stakeholders and communicate product strategy clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinking and ability to break down complex workflows into scalable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in fast-moving product environments with multiple priorities and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;nice_to_have_points_3&quot;&gt;Nice-to-have points&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CAFM / FSM / CMMS software platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;scheduling engines or optimisation logic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;mobile-first workflows for frontline users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;API-driven platforms and system integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data-driven operational analytics and reporting systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;remuneration_package_and_benefits_4&quot;&gt;Remuneration package and benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work within a global SaaS product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career progression opportunities as Joblogic continues to scale internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, product-focused and innovative working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company events and team activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development through Joblogic Academy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to internal training and product leadership mentoring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

