&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Mac or Windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-visibility leadership role at the core of Decathlon&#39;s customer strategy, offering structured mentorship, continuous upskilling, and international mobility paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive remuneration package including employee shareholding options (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot;&gt;actionnariat salarié&lt;/em&gt;), as well as monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible selection process to all candidates. Should you require any accommodations, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests do not affect the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all. Fulfilling this mission requires design excellence at both ends of our digital experience: for the millions of sports lovers using our customer apps and websites, and for the thousands of teammates who rely on our tools in stores, warehouses, and offices to do their jobs every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital design plays a pivotal role in supporting Decathlon’s growth and human connection. How? By ensuring our digital tools are simple, reliable, and enjoyable, and by giving our design community the shared foundations, systems, and practices they need to deliver the best possible experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Design Senior Manager &lt;/strong&gt;within the Product Center of Excellence (CoE) to lead our core design capabilities, provide thought leadership on the future of our craft, and support our design community across Decathlon Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Leader, you will have a dual mission: you will directly manage the Design System team and the Design &amp;amp; Research Ops team, while functionally leading and inspiring the community of digital product designers embedded across our different business domains (eCommerce, Store apps, Supply Chain, and internal platforms) and countries. You will also steer how design evolves at Decathlon in the era of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Digital Design Leader, you will act as a strategic partner at Decathlon Digital to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and develop your direct teams &lt;/strong&gt;(Design System and Design &amp;amp; Research Ops): set their priorities, support their professional growth, and ensure their work delivers tangible value to Decathlon teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead our Design System&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure its relevance across all digital touchpoints by catering to the specific needs of B2C, E2E, and B2B products, as well as sports experiences. Measure its adoption and its contribution to team efficiency and experience quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure that tools, methods, and operational frameworks meet real team needs, are effectively adopted, and tangibly contribute to operational efficiency and the quality of product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and coach our design teammates functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; clarify career paths, structure onboarding programs, drive upskilling, and foster synergies and best-practice sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion a forward-looking vision for design and its practices&lt;/strong&gt;, especially in the era of AI, through active industry monitoring and experimentation with emerging practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the conditions for active community contribution &lt;/strong&gt;to the evolution of our tools, standards, and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships with Product and Engineering leaders&lt;/strong&gt; to advocate for design excellence, digital accessibility (RGAA / WCAG), eco-design, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Around 8-10 years of experience in digital design&lt;/strong&gt;, gained within complex, international product environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record in direct management&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally leading hybrid profiles (designers, engineers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with a demonstrated ability to influence, advise, and align senior stakeholders (Directors, business teams, tech, and product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding and strong awareness of current digital design challenges&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly regarding Artificial Intelligence (AI) and eco-design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both written and spoken French and English is required&lt;/strong&gt; to thrive in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority&lt;/strong&gt; — Build trust, inspire teams with a forward-looking vision, and rally decentralized designers, product managers, and engineering leaders around shared standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Work closely with diverse domains (Omni, Supply Chain, Sports, Core Platforms), listening to their specific operational realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Foster an open, generous craft culture where teams share work early, learn from failures, and help each other grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — Stay curious and grounded, proactively developing yourself and others while turning challenges into positive learning moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The CoE might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love enabling other designers and seeing teams succeed thanks to your support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy both direct team management and leading a wider community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about the future of design and passionate about demystifying AI into practical, human-centered practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like bringing clarity to complex environments and building simple, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in elevating design excellence across Decathlon Digital!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille or Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director or VP of Product Marketing to lead that effort globally. This is a senior, hands-on role for someone who can connect deep technical understanding with positioning, distribution and commercial results. The title will reflect the experience and scope of the person we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A good product story matters, but a story alone isn&#39;t enough. The person in this role needs to turn our infrastructure into clear customer problems we solve, compelling reasons to choose Telnyx and practical ways to try it. A great sample application, integration or reference architecture can do more than another 30-slide deck. So can a precise message that reaches a developer at the moment they are deciding how to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across Product, Engineering, Developer Relations, Sales and Marketing to bring those pieces together. You&#39;ll help shape what we launch, how we explain it, how buyers discover it and how our field teams take it to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coherent product story. Own positioning, segmentation and competitive differentiation across AI inference, Voice AI, agent and edge infrastructure, communications, networking and wireless. Make the full platform understandable without flattening the technical details that make it valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solutions people can actually use. Drive the packaging of sample apps, reference architectures, integrations, templates and working demos that prove what the infrastructure makes possible. Build repeatable plays for use cases such as contact centers, agent assist and industry-specific workflows. These should accelerate adoption and enterprise sales, not become disconnected software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribution that reaches technical buyers. Shape how we win discovery through product pages, developer content, SEO, answer engine optimization (AEO), technical communities and paid acquisition. You won&#39;t necessarily operate every campaign, but you must understand the mechanics deeply enough to direct them: search and answer-engine visibility, technical site structure, intent, targeting, conversion paths, attribution and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A field-ready commercial engine. Give enterprise sellers, FDEs and solutions teams the pitches, discovery frameworks, architecture diagrams, competitive proof, demos and ROI narratives they need to generate and advance opportunities. Translate platform capabilities into buying reasons for developers, technical executives and enterprise decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launches that translate into adoption. Work with Product and Engineering early, not after something ships. Choose the audience, packaging and launch strategy, then measure activation, qualified demand, field utilization and downstream pipeline. Build an operating cadence that keeps pace with a rapidly changing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native PMM team. Use AI research tools, coding assistants, agents and automation as part of everyday work to accelerate market research, competitive analysis, messaging tests, content production, demo development and go-to-market execution. Know when to trust those tools, how to evaluate outputs and where human technical judgment still matters. Lead the team to operate the same way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;ll measure success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ultimate measure is pipeline. Not the number of launches, assets, impressions or campaigns. We expect this leader to partner closely with Demand Generation and Sales to create measurable, qualified pipeline, improve conversion and accelerate opportunities. Product marketing should be able to show how specific product narratives, solutions, integrations and programs contribute to commercial results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Early wins will look like a dramatically clearer platform story; a small number of flagship use cases with runnable demos and integrations; sellers using consistent, technically credible plays; stronger discovery and conversion from search, AEO and paid channels; and a repeatable link from product launches to adoption and pipeline. We care about what works and scales, not activity for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led product marketing for a complex B2B technical platform, ideally in AI infrastructure, developer tools, APIs, cloud, networking or communications. You can be strategic without becoming removed from the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically fluent. You can understand architecture, work with APIs or SDKs, interrogate a latency or cost claim and talk comfortably with engineers. You don&#39;t have to be a production engineer, but you need to know when a demo is real and when it&#39;s just a pitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand modern technical acquisition. You&#39;re credible directing AEO, SEO, paid programs and developer-focused content, and can connect channel-level metrics to funnel economics and qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re already effective with AI tools and agents in your own work. You experiment, build workflows and use the technology to move faster. Familiarity with the limitations and evaluation of AI-generated outputs is as important as enthusiasm for the tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write exceptionally well, have strong instincts for enterprise sales, and know how to turn a complex product advantage into a clear reason to buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built or led strong teams, can prioritize across competing launches and products, and enjoy working directly with product leaders and technical builders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telecom experience is not required. Technical curiosity, taste, speed and a track record of generating commercial impact matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to shape the market narrative for a company that owns the underlying network, communications and compute infrastructure it sells. The platform is real, customers are deploying it in production, and the commercial opportunity is substantial. You&#39;ll have direct access to senior leadership and the ability to build a PMM function measured by its contribution to growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from different backgrounds and evaluate candidates based on the skills and experience relevant to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance. Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie. Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing. Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;www.wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs qui nous unissent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt; en favorisant un leadership collectif et une créativité transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt; en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt; en stimulant activement la croissance et la curiosité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de Conexance / Choreograph&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choreograph constitue le cœur technologique et data de l&#39;écosystème WPP, reliant la réflexion stratégique marketing à son déploiement opérationnel à grande échelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conexance&lt;/strong&gt;, entité clé de Choreograph, est le leader reconnu du Marketing Data-Driven en France. Forts de 20 ans d&#39;expertise, nous proposons des solutions data uniques basées sur la mutualisation de données transactionnelles (base de données coopérative multi-secteurs) et sur l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle au service de nos clients en &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt; et au &lt;strong&gt;Royaume-Uni (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission : permettre à nos clients (e-commerce, retail, presse, associations/caritatif, etc.) d&#39;exploiter tout le potentiel de leurs données pour optimiser leurs campagnes de prospection, de fidélisation et d&#39;activation (lookalike, scoring, segmentation, CRM, profiling).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Missions &amp;amp; Rôle&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du &lt;strong&gt;Service Études&lt;/strong&gt; de Conexance et rattaché directement au &lt;strong&gt;Senior Lead Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, vous intégrez une équipe dynamique et collaborative de 7 collaborateurs (Lead Data Analyst, Data Analysts, prestataires et alternant).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans un contexte résolument &lt;em&gt;Customer Centric&lt;/em&gt;, vous intervenez en support direct du commerce (FR et UK) afin de produire, analyser et restituer des études statistiques à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités clés :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Production d&#39;analyses statistiques &amp;amp; modélisations :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Élaborer des scores de prospection et modèles de lookalike (cas simples à complexes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des segmentations, études de profiling et analyses de répondants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectuer des comptages et sélections sur critères pour les campagnes de nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Garantie de qualité &amp;amp; respect des délais :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer des livrables rigoureux, fiables et structurés, répondant précisément aux besoins opérationnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Accompagnement commercial &amp;amp; restitution :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner ponctuellement l&#39;équipe commerciale en rendez-vous clients (France et UK) pour expliquer la démarche, valoriser les analyses et formuler des recommandations stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Amélioration continue &amp;amp; innovation :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer activement aux réflexions inter et intra-services visant à optimiser nos méthodes de production, automatiser nos flux et explorer de nouveaux outils (dont l&#39;IA générative et de nouvelles approches d&#39;analyse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trajectoire et montée en compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À court terme (1 à 3 mois) :&lt;/strong&gt; Assimiler notre environnement technique et le process de production (FR/UK), devenir autonome sur le traitement des cas courants et consolider une rigueur méthodologique sans faille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À moyen/long terme :&lt;/strong&gt; Monter en autonomie sur les problématiques statistiques les plus complexes, gérer un portefeuille de demandes de bout en bout, être force de proposition sur l&#39;innovation et animer des restitutions auprès de nos interlocuteurs internes et externes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes passionné par la statistique et la valorisation de la donnée marketing, avec un tempérament curieux, proactif et un excellent relationnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation &amp;amp; Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Titulaire d’un &lt;strong&gt;Master 2 / Bac+5&lt;/strong&gt; en Statistiques, Machine Learning, Big Data, Data Science ou Intelligence Artificielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Environ &lt;strong&gt;2 ans d&#39;expérience&lt;/strong&gt; (alternance/stages significatifs inclus) dans un rôle axé sur le &lt;strong&gt;datamining&lt;/strong&gt;, la modélisation statistique ou l&#39;analyse de données orientée marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Techniques (Hard Skills) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indispensables :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise opérationnelle de &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise de la suite &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (Excel avancé, PowerPoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des techniques de &lt;strong&gt;Data Visualisation&lt;/strong&gt; (capacité à mettre en scène la donnée pour la rendre intelligible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts supplémentaires :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance de &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt; et d&#39;outils de dataviz comme &lt;strong&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensibilité à l&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt; appliquée à la data, au &lt;strong&gt;storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; de la donnée et aux &lt;strong&gt;méthodes agiles&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Comportementales &amp;amp; Soft Skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur, esprit logique et méthode&lt;/strong&gt; dans la manipulation de volumes importants de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellente communication orale et écrite :&lt;/strong&gt; aisance relationnelle, élocution claire et capacité à vulgariser des concepts techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personnalité dynamique, souriante, à l&#39;écoute et bienveillante&lt;/strong&gt;, dotée d&#39;un fort esprit d&#39;équipe et d&#39;une bonne présentation en clientèle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité :&lt;/strong&gt; curiosité intellectuelle, autonomie progressive et orientation solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais professionnel opérationnel (niveau B2 minimum requis)&lt;/strong&gt;, indispensable pour collaborer sur les comptes et campagnes du marché UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous évoluerez dans une équipe à taille humaine (environ 35 collaborateurs dans l&#39;entreprise, 6 dans l&#39;équipe Études) où la bienveillance, la collaboration, l&#39;écoute, la qualité, la rigueur, la méthode et l&#39;innovation sont des valeurs fondamentales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un poste basé à Lille, avec une politique de travail hybride : 100% en présentiel durant la période d&#39;essai, puis possibilité de 2 jours de télétravail par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence obligatoire par mois sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; et ses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; avantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur. Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération et avantages&lt;/strong&gt; : Salaire compétitif, mutuelle (prise en charge employeur à 70%), prévoyance, titres-restaurant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés et équilibre vie pro/perso&lt;/strong&gt; : 25 jours de congés payés annuels, 12 jours de RTT (pour une année civile complète), jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilité et télétravail&lt;/strong&gt; : Durant la période d’essai, 100% en présentiel. Puis possibilité de télétravail 2 jours par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence par mois obligatoires sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilité durable&lt;/strong&gt; : Forfait Mobilité Durable (facultatif au choix du salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Échange RH : &lt;/strong&gt;Premier entretien de découverte (téléphonique ou visio) avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien physique &amp;amp; Business Case : &lt;/strong&gt;Rencontre dans nos locaux avec le Senior Lead Data Analyst incluant un cas pratique / test technique (pour vous projeter concrètement dans notre quotidien) et un échange avec la HRBP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien de finalisation (si nécessaire) &lt;/strong&gt;: Échange complémentaire avec le N+2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la protection de vos données &lt;a href=&quot;https://open-web-sk.wpp.ai/chat/7aQi197iYDxX62kecaQzY/LIEN_VERS_POLITIQUE_DE_CONFIDENTIALITE&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam, following its acquisition of&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI - the leader in AI-powered data security posture management (DSPM) - is&amp;nbsp;seeking a Senior Sales Engineer to drive technical leadership in our sales team, focusing on the&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI portfolio. You will partner with a&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;Sales Specialist and support 3–5 Account Executives and Veeam Solution Engineers as the technical subject matter expert.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide customers from needs assessment to solution design,&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;hands-on demos and proof-of-concepts to&amp;nbsp;showcase&amp;nbsp;value. Success in this role requires strong technical skills and the ability to build trust with clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical contact for&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI solutions during the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discussions and deliver customized security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address customer needs in data discovery, posture management, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present product demonstrations and proof-of-concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, and customer success teams to ensure smooth transitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience&amp;nbsp;in pre-sales or sales engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data and/or cloud security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator with both technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years technical sales experience in security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in Software/SaaS/Enterprise technical sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data privacy/security standards (e.g., GDPR, NIST 800-53, ISO 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DSPM frameworks, Linux, Kubernetes, or cloud data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications (CISSP, CISM, or cloud-specific)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam offers benefits that support your whole self:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;962d2596-0d84-4634-8122-e72620efaf3a&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days plus RTT days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ac5169f0-07e3-489b-8abe-892be770a0b0&quot;&gt;Mandatory public health insurance with broad medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6d7de02c-c10d-4630-8e3a-d6fc9459e7d9&quot;&gt;Employer-paid private medical, dental, optical, and wellness plan through Axa, with options for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;61b12e02-8f54-4d15-96d6-bbc42318ce88&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage above the Social Security ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b2ca2bc7-2cd7-4995-9fc1-a5c272ebb57b&quot;&gt;Education pension for dependent children up to age 26 if in full-time education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;857127a3-8f58-4d62-9dd4-f69b9f89cff8&quot;&gt;State and supplementary pension contributions by Veeam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;73fa609e-fa75-463b-994c-f8b6c840141c&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If an applicant is permanently located outside of France, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que leader de deuxième niveau pour l’équipe Applied AI Industries en Europe du Sud et au Moyen-Orient chez Anthropic, vous piloterez l’adoption d’une IA de frontier en partenariat avec le reste de l’organisation de mise sur le marché. Nos clients Industries en France, Ibérie et Italie incluent de nombreuses plus grandes entreprises de la région dans les services financiers, santé et sciences de la vie, fabrication, télécommunications, commerce de détail, énergie et autres secteurs. Vous mettrez à profit votre expérience de construction et de direction d’équipes de vente technique pour piloter une transformation IA positive qui répond aux besoins métier de nos clients, satisfait à leurs exigences techniques et réglementaires, et offre un haut degré de fiabilité et de sécurité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous serez responsable de la direction et de la croissance de l’équipe d’architectes de solutions qui partenaire avec les directrices et directeurs de compte pour aider les entreprises à adopter et déployer les produits d’Anthropic, notamment Claude Cowork, Claude Code et la Plateforme de Développement Claude (notre API). Cela inclura l’utilisation de vos compétences techniques et votre expérience de vente consultative pour recruter d’excellentes personnes en première ligne de management et contributeurs individuels, établir des processus pour évoluer votre équipe, et représenter Anthropic directement dans les engagements clients stratégiques. Votre équipe couvre plusieurs pays et secteurs à la fois, vous serez donc responsable de la réflexion stratégique sur les comptes d’industrie complexes et de l’identification et du déploiement de solutions qui résonnent dans chaque marché, avec sa propre langue, sa culture métier et son contexte réglementaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruter, manager et guider une équipe de managers de première ligne qui construiront à leur tour des équipes d’Applied AI Architects (H/F) de pré-vente en France, Ibérie et Italie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les objectifs de votre équipe en collaboration avec le leadership commercial et établir les attentes de performance de base sur votre équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en tant que sponsor technique et exécutif pour les clients stratégiques de haute valeur dans la région et les conseiller sur leurs stratégies globales d’adoption de l’IA ou la délimitation des cas d’usage et l’exécution de pilotes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec le leadership commercial d’Europe du Sud (couvrant également le Moyen-Orient et l’Afrique) pour construire des stratégies pour les comptes d’industrie complexes et identifier de nouvelles façons de piloter l’adoption des produits Anthropic dans des secteurs verticaux spécifiques ou des cas d’usage horizontaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider les clients à naviguer dans les exigences réglementaires locales et européennes (par exemple, la Loi sur l’IA de l’UE, le RGPD, DORA et les attentes de résidence des données) et adapter la façon dont votre équipe s’engage à la culture métier de chaque marché&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler avec des équipes interfonctionnelles comme le produit et l’ingénierie pour assurer qu’Anthropic priorise les commentaires des clients ou résout les obstacles à l’adoption dans la région&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voyager régulièrement en Europe du Sud pour les clients ou conférences pour des sessions de haut niveau, des ateliers techniques et la construction de relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir une vision commune pour créer des solutions qui permettent une IA bénéfique et sûre dans les produits technologiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la pensée stratégique par des présentations en conférences, des webinaires et la création de contenu technique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rester au courant des tendances émergentes en IA et du paysage concurrentiel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce profil est un bon ajustement si vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez 7+ ans d’expérience en gestion de pré-vente technique, incluant un leadership de deuxième niveau ou supérieur (direction de managers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez vendu des produits techniques complexes aux grandes entreprises en France, Ibérie, Italie, Moyen-Orient et Afrique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez travaillé dans plusieurs secteurs, tels que services financiers, santé et sciences de la vie, fabrication, télécommunications, commerce de détail et énergie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprenez les différences culturelles entre les marchés d’Europe du Sud et le contexte réglementaire dans lequel opèrent vos clients, et adaptez votre approche à chacun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pensez de façon hautement stratégique aux comptes d’industrie complexes et transformez cette réflexion en plans que votre équipe et vos homologues commerciaux peuvent exécuter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez une profonde maîtrise technique des cas d’usage IA en entreprise, des intégrations d’API et des déploiements LLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospérez dans la construction et l’évolution rapide d’équipes et de processus dans des environnements ambigus et mouvants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez d’excellentes compétences en communication, collaboration et coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez une présence exécutive forte et la capacité à cultiver des relations profondes avec les leaders métier et technique des plus grandes entreprises de la région&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez au moins une familiarité de haut niveau avec l’architecture et le fonctionnement des LLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez une passion pour rendre les technologies puissantes sûres et bénéfiques pour la société&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restiez à jour et informée en vous intéressant activement à la recherche émergente et aux tendances du secteur en IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les candidates et candidats solides pourraient avoir :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership de pré-vente d’entreprise à grande échelle : 5+ ans de direction d’équipes d’architectes de solutions à travers une hypercroissance (idéalement des dizaines de personnes dans plusieurs pays), avec expérience directe de direction de managers et développement de talents dans des environnements de vente de logiciels d’entreprise complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gamme multilingue et multiculturelle : En plus de l’anglais, maîtrise d’une ou plusieurs langues parmi le français, l’italien, l’espagnol ou le portugais, et expérience de direction d’équipes distribuées dans plusieurs pays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience avec les modèles commerciaux basés sur la consommation : Les candidats idéaux ont construit des cadres GTM ancrés sur la consommation, pas seulement sur les licences basées sur SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profondeur technique en IA + Engagement exécutif : Expérience pratique avec les plateformes d’IA et les modèles d’intégration d’entreprise, combinée à un historique avéré d’engagement des parties prenantes au niveau C dans des évaluations techniques de 10 M€+ et des cycles de vente d’entreprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience GTM multi-secteurs dans les secteurs réglementés : Succès démontré dans l’adaptation des approches techniques à différents secteurs verticaux, en particulier les secteurs réglementés tels que la banque, les assurances et la santé, y compris le travail avec les parties prenantes en matière de risque, de conformité et de comité d’entreprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the 2nd-line leader for the Applied AI Industries team in Southern Europe and the Middle-East at Anthropic, you will drive the adoption of frontier AI in partnership with the rest of the go to market organization. Our Industries customers in France, Iberia and Italy include many of the region&#39;s largest enterprises across financial services, healthcare and life sciences, manufacturing, telecom, retail, energy, and other sectors. You&#39;ll leverage your experience building and leading technical sales teams to drive positive AI transformation that addresses our customers&#39; business needs, meets their technical and regulatory requirements, and provides a high degree of reliability and safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for leading and growing the solutions architect team that partners with account executives to help companies adopt and deploy Anthropic&#39;s products, including Claude Cowork, Claude Code, and the Claude Development Platform (our API). This will include leveraging your technical skills and consultative sales experience to hire great 1st line managers and individual contributors, establish processes to scale your team, and represent Anthropic directly at strategic customer engagements. Your team covers several countries and industries at once, so you will be responsible for thinking strategically about complex industry accounts and for identifying and rolling out solutions that resonate in each market, with its own language, business culture, and regulatory context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hire, manage, and guide a team of 1st line managers who will in turn build teams of pre-sales Applied AI Architects across France, Iberia and Italy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set goals for your team in collaboration with sales leadership and establish baseline expectations for performance across your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a technical and executive sponsor for high-value strategic customers in the region and advise them on their overall AI adoption strategies or use case scoping and pilot execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Southern Europe sales leadership (also covering the Middle-East and Africa) to build strategies for complex industry accounts and identify new ways to drive adoption of Anthropic products within specific verticals or horizontal use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help customers navigate local and European regulatory requirements (for example the EU AI Act, GDPR, DORA, and data residency expectations) and adapt how your team engages to the business culture of each market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with cross-functional teams like product and engineering to ensure Anthropic prioritizes customer feedback or resolves blockers to adoption in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel regularly across Southern Europe to customers or conferences for executive-level sessions, technical workshops, and relationship building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a shared vision for creating solutions that enable beneficial and safe AI in technology products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to thought leadership through conference presentations, webinars, and technical content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay current with emerging AI trends and the competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of technical pre-sales management experience, including 2nd-line leadership or above (leading managers).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have sold complex technical products to large enterprises in France, Iberia, Italy, the Middle-East and Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have worked across multiple industries, such as financial services, healthcare and life sciences, manufacturing, telecom, retail, and energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand the cultural differences between Southern European markets and the regulatory context your customers operate in, and adapt your approach to each.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think highly strategically about complex industry accounts, and turn that thinking into plans your team and sales counterparts can execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have deep technical proficiency with enterprise AI use cases, API integrations, and LLM deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thrive in building and rapidly scaling teams and processes within ambiguous and fast-moving environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have excellent communication, collaboration, and coaching abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong executive presence and ability to foster deep relationships with business and technical leaders at the region&#39;s largest companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have at least a high level familiarity with the architecture and operation of LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a passion for making powerful technology safe and societally beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay up-to-date and informed by taking an active interest in emerging research and industry trends within AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise pre-sales leadership at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years leading solution architect teams through hypergrowth (ideally dozens of people across several countries), with direct experience leading managers and developing talent in complex enterprise software sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual and multicultural range:&lt;/strong&gt; In addition to English, fluency in one or more of French, Italian, Spanish or Portuguese, and experience leading teams distributed across several countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with consumption business models:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideal candidates have built GTM frameworks anchored on consumption, not just SaaS-based licenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Technical Depth + Executive Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with AI platforms and enterprise integration patterns, combined with proven track record engaging C-level stakeholders in €10M+ technical evaluations and enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-industry GTM experience in regulated sectors:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success adapting technical approaches to different verticals, in particular regulated ones such as banking, insurance, and healthcare, including working with risk, compliance, and works council stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€265.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€310.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;En bref&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic grandit vite, et notre centre de préparation de commandes de Moissy-Cramayel a besoin de pilotes pour porter cette ambition. En tant que Captain, tu n&#39;es pas juste un(e) chef(fe) d&#39;équipe : tu es le moteur de l&#39;entrepôt. Ton défi ? Manager environ 20 Shoppers (préparateur(rice)s de commandes) en direct, garantir une sécurité totale et transformer chaque shift en succès collectif avec +100 Shoppers sur le terrain. Si tu aimes l&#39;action et que tu sais fédérer une équipe dans la bonne humeur, ce rôle est pour toi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager et coacher ton équipe&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu supervises une vingtaine de Shoppers au quotidien, en veillant à leur motivation, leur sécurité et au respect des bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter la performance&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu garantis que chaque commande est prête, complète et à l&#39;heure, en suivant de près nos indicateurs de qualité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordonner les flux du FC&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu travailles main dans la main avec les autres Captains pour fluidifier les opérations et ajuster les ressources en temps réel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assurer la polyvalence opérationnelle&lt;/strong&gt; : Réception, gestion des stocks (sec, frais, surgelé) ou départ des camions... tu navigues entre les zones selon les besoins du planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gérer l&#39;humain et le terrain&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu es le point de contact privilégié pour ton équipe, capable de recadrer avec pédagogie comme de féliciter les réussites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as entre 1 et 5 ans d&#39;expérience dans un environnement dynamique (logistique, retail, restauration ou ligne de production) avec une première gestion d&#39;équipe réussie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es disponible à temps plein sur des shifts tournants (matin dès 3h50 ou après-midi jusqu&#39;à 23h30) et tu es prêt(e) à travailler les samedis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le français (l&#39;anglais est un plus) et tu es parfaitement à l&#39;aise avec les outils digitaux de pilotage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es véhiculé(e) pour rejoindre facilement l&#39;entrepôt de Moissy-Cramayel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu n&#39;as pas peur de mettre la main à la pâte. Tu aimes l&#39;action et tu sais prendre des décisions rapides pour débloquer des situations opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 &lt;strong&gt;Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ton FC, tu disposeras d’une variété de déjeuners, de dîners, de snacks et de boissons sains, préparés fraîchement sur place par notre chef !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫 Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achats, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu seras aussi convié(e) à nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👨‍⚕️ Santé et repos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, tu disposeras de 25 jours de congés payés par an.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à des formations dédiées au leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/FSwRUFqnISA&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will build and improve the WebCompat team’s internal tooling, the dashboards and the broken-site-report screenshot pipeline the team relies on to triage and prioritize site breakage. This is a focused tooling role that makes the WebCompat program faster and more data-driven.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build and improve WebCompat dashboards (triage, reporting, and metrics).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improve the broken-site-report screenshot capture and pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with the WebCompat team (including QA) to turn reporting and triage needs into reliable tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid web development (JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Python &amp;amp; Django) and experience building dashboards / data views.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort with tooling, automation, and web services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Self-directed, with good written communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with WebCompat workflows and Bugzilla.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with screenshot / automation pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with Machine Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;an-overview-of-this-role&quot; data-lfile-container=&quot;21ea07e5-ded4-47e8-ad92-4ca7b7d6be35&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Corporate Development Director, you&#39;ll help influence how GitLab invests to win: what we build, what we buy, where we partner, and what we should not pursue. This role sits within the Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships team, reporting to the VP, Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role straddles strategy and M&amp;amp;A engagements. You&#39;ll lead research that frames GitLab&#39;s options: mapping the markets in and around our AI-powered DevSecOps platform, testing where we have a right to win, and turning that into clear recommendations for the executive team. When the answer is to acquire, you&#39;ll drive the deal process end to end, from outreach through close and integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success here is not measured by deal count. It looks like sharper strategic choices: a well-reasoned point of view on our priority markets, investment theses that product and executive leaders rely on, acquisitions that speed up the roadmap when buying is the right answer, and an educated no when it isn&#39;t. You&#39;ll own the wider market perspective rather than individual product categories, and work with the team&#39;s Analyst on the research behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;strategy-and-research&quot;&gt;Strategy and research&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the wider market view.&lt;/strong&gt; Research the broader market GitLab competes in, beyond specific product categories: competitive dynamics, AI-native entrants, technology shifts and where value is moving. Collaborate with the team&#39;s Analyst on the research and turn the findings into a clear point of view on where GitLab should play.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an investment thesis for each focus area.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product and Engineering leaders to define the problems worth solving, the capabilities GitLab needs, and what it would cost in time and money to get there on our own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the competitive and landscape view.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain market maps and a current read on GitLab&#39;s competitors: their strategy, product direction, positioning, pricing, and M&amp;amp;A and funding activity. Produce competitor analyses that show where we lead, where we&#39;re exposed and how rivals are likely to move. Flag shifts by competitors, hyperscalers and AI labs that change our options, and bring the implications to Product and the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define where GitLab should not play.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify adjacencies that dilute focus and markets where the economics or competition work against us. Make the case for a no with the same rigor as a yes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;build-buy-or-partner&quot;&gt;Build, buy or partner&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the build, buy, partner analysis.&lt;/strong&gt; For each strategic gap, compare the options side by side on speed, cost, risk, control and strategic fit, and bring a clear recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver strategic clarity to&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;executives and the Board.&lt;/strong&gt; Produce short strategy memos/decks and business cases that set out the decision, the trade-offs and what we give up with each path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feed company strategy and planning.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring an outside-in view of the market and the inorganic options available into annual and long-range planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work hand in hand with Strategic Partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; When partnering is the right answer, frame the opportunity and hand it to the partnership owner with a clear thesis. When it isn&#39;t, explain why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;deal-execution-and-integration&quot;&gt;Deal execution and integration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own end-to-end deal process management.&lt;/strong&gt; Validate target fit against GitLab&#39;s our target profile, product roadmap and other criteria, and build the acquisition rationale and business case. Drive our M&amp;amp;A process from intro call through the various steps through to closing and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluate the deal.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop valuation, commercial integrity assessment, impact on GitLab&#39;s business and provide negotiations assistance to the VP and the executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional diligence.&lt;/strong&gt; Run pre-LOI validation and diligence across Product, Engineering, Security, Finance, Legal and People, and communicate findings clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive deal documents with Legal.&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare NDAs, LOIs and purchase agreements with GitLab Legal and outside counsel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own integration outcomes.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead post-acquisition integration as the DRI, measured against the roadmap and business goals in the business case. Bring lessons learned back into the strategy work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the external network.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain relationships with founders, executives, investors, bankers and advisors that bring us early insight and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-bring&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and deal experience.&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years across corporate development, corporate strategy, strategy consulting or technology investing, including 5+ years leading acquisitions end to end in enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured strategic thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You form a point of view from incomplete information, test it against data, and change your mind when the evidence says so. You&#39;re as comfortable recommending that we stay out of a market as that we enter it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market research depth.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in market sizing, competitive analysis and landscape mapping, and in turning research into a recommendation, not a report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal craft.&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in valuation, financial modeling, deal structuring, negotiation and integration planning, with experience across varied consideration structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; A working understanding of software development, DevSecOps and the AI landscape, enough to hold substantive conversations with product and engineering leaders about roadmaps and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear executive communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You write short, decision-ready updates and present trade-offs plainly to executives and the Board, in an async-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority.&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust across Product, Engineering, Finance and Legal and move decisions forward across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership with collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the strategic view and the recommendation, and partner closely with the team&#39;s Analyst on research and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; familiarity with the DevSecOps, security, AI and open source ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You value the &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/all-remote/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;all remote&lt;/a&gt; lifestyle and share our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/values/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about-the-team&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Corporate Development &amp;amp; Strategic Partnerships team helps GitLab decide how to grow beyond what we build on our own. We own inorganic strategy: acquisitions, strategic partnerships with hyperscalers and AI labs, and the research that tells us which to pursue and which to pass on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across Product, Engineering, Finance, Legal and the executive group. We set direction and do the detailed work ourselves, with a high degree of ownership and transparency in a fully remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers. The kind of people who not only created composable commerce but also shaped the culture of experimentation that idea unlocked. Together they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce, but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Named Account Executive (NAE), you will manage a defined portfolio of&amp;nbsp;high-value, strategic enterprise accounts with a mandate to drive multi-year&amp;nbsp;transformation, significant revenue expansion, and deep executive engagement. This&amp;nbsp;role focuses on long-term-growth and operating as a trusted advisor to key&amp;nbsp;stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is remote - the team meets up in Amsterdam once a month.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Account Ownership: Own and execute account plans for assigned named accounts, with a focus on long-term growth and multi-solution adoption. Develop land-and-expand motions that convert initial wins into enterprise-wide standardization across business units and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome-Based Executive Engagement: Engage C-Level stakeholders to align our solutions to strategic business priorities. Lead Executive Business Reviews (EBRs) showcasing realized value, adoption metrics, and growth opportunities. Drive commercial expansion through strategic value engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Political Mapping &amp;amp; Deal Orchestration: Create and maintain detailed political account maps (e.g., power &amp;amp; influence maps) to track power centers, influencers, and potential blockers. Lead and orchestrate cross-functional pursuit teams (Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, Legal) to deliver compelling, customized solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Advocacy &amp;amp; Renewal Leadership: Ensure high customer satisfaction and retention by driving adoption and connecting measurable outcomes to business strategy. Identify risk to renewal or expansion and proactively intervene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Execution: Maintain an accurate pipeline through disciplined CRM management and forecast new business revenue with precision. Partner with cloud hyperscalers (AWS, Google Cloud, Azure) and global SI partners to influence large-scale digital modernization deals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets You Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, with a focus on selling complex, platform-level software to large, multi-brand organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific experience managing and growing a list of Named Enterprise Accounts (Fortune 1000).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to close multi-six-figure and seven-figure ACV deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep commercial knowledge of the e-commerce landscape, including competitors and complementary technologies (e.g., CMS, PIM, ERP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to conduct consultative, business-value-focused sales conversations with C-level business and IT leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in territory/account planning, opportunity qualification, and rigorous forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in a recognized sales methodology (MEDDPICC is strongly preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Dutch and English and experience using both languages in a professional capacity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Aptitude&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine curiosity for using AI tools to work smarter and more effectively, paired with a drive to learn and put them into practice in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging practices, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/dei-esg&quot;&gt;visit this page&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Markets &amp;amp; Transactions team is looking for a Senior Consultant / Manager to join the team in Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;Baringa’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;leading Power &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;Market &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;dvisory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; practice works with clients across the energy value chain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;utilities, independent power producers, developers, network companies, commodity traders, industrials, investors, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;policymakers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; and regulators. We combine deep market, technical, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;commercial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; and regulatory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; to help clients develop projects, deploy capital, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;optimize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; value across the energy transition, including renewables, storage, clean &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt;molecules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW92380952 BCX8&quot;&gt; and low carbon infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; strategy support:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead market assessments across the Netherlands and wider Europe, focused on wholesale power, renewables, storage, or emerging technologies (e.g. PtX/clean molecules) and related business models. Shape strategic recommendations for corporate and investment clients, ensuring analytical robustness and commercial relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction support&lt;/strong&gt;: Support or manage buy‑ and sell‑side commercial due diligence processes for renewables, storage, and early‑stage low‑carbon assets. Drive the identification of value drivers, risks, commercial structures and route‑to‑market considerations, while steering stakeholder alignment and delivering clear investment‑grade insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantitative analysis &amp;amp; modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the development and enhancement of complex datasets, models, and analytical frameworks to evaluate market fundamentals, asset revenues and commercial performance for renewables and flexible resources (e.g., batteries, pumped storage, demand response). Provide quality assurance and guide junior team members in best‑practice modelling approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio &amp;amp; asset insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer analytical work on asset dispatch, hedging concepts, and portfolio optimisation strategies, partnering directly with developers, IPPs and investors. Translate market and asset insights into actionable portfolio and trading strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client delivery&lt;/strong&gt;: develop compelling client deliverables, including executive‑level presentations, memos and dashboards. Translate complex analysis into clear, strategic recommendations. Lead or manage project workstreams and maintain strong client relationships throughout delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We primarily look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep understanding of the Dutch and wider European power market including market fundamentals, market design, policy and regulation, and commercial structures. Willingness to work occasionally in different market contexts and themes, or support model development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;4-8 years of experience in power markets with a research or advisory focus, e.g. in specialist consulting, management consulting or an industry role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ways of working: &lt;/strong&gt;You&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;take ownership of workstreams, communicate effectively with team members across Europe, and deliver and present results in client-facing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced (C2) Dutch and English required;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you also bring one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Analytical skills applied to energy market fundamentals, e.g. quantitative energy market and asset modelling, or programming experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercialisation experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in commercial structures, assessing routes to market for power generation assets and designing business models in energy markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to manage projects day-to-day and oversee inputs/outputs from the modelling team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial acumen: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience supporting business development activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation and Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;lead the development of innovative IP and modeling capabilities, ensuring we remain at the forefront of market-leading investment and strategic advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Corporate Responsibility Days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Wellbeing Fund:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Profit Share Scheme:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Role-Summary&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad213d8fe4e2&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4daa64b4c380&quot;&gt;Nebius Token Factory is building production-grade inference for open-source, customer, and internally optimized models. This role owns the path from model artifact to fast, reliable, cost-efficient endpoint. The work sits at the intersection of model internals, inference engines, serving architecture, benchmarking, and production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-You-Will-Do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebbff5d80805&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5115fb223c0&quot;&gt;Own a platform-level optimization pillar such as quantization, speculative decoding, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, engine selection, or long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ffc3414d75f&quot;&gt;Create reusable evaluation, benchmarking, and rollout frameworks across multiple model families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1093d4c9089&quot;&gt;Provide technical direction to MLEs, Applied Scientists, GPU kernel engineers, and infrastructure engineers on shared performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba8442a0b3db&quot;&gt;Optimize LLM and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; endpoints for latency, throughput, memory efficiency, GPU utilization, quality, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3046&quot; data-local-id=&quot;295f060f2f89&quot;&gt;Deploy, configure, benchmark, and extend inference engines such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, or similar systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a92060bc9227&quot;&gt;Build and productionize model-compression workflows, including quantization, quantization-aware training, distillation, low-bit serving, and accuracy recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3367&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc94ad87ea7d&quot;&gt;Implement or integrate speculative decoding, draft-model approaches, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, prefix caching, chunked prefill, continuous batching, and disaggregated prefill/decode serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;767163fd69ef&quot;&gt;Build reproducible benchmark harnesses for &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TTFT&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPOT&lt;/span&gt;, tokens per second per GPU, p95/p99 latency, GPU memory, reliability, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3705&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08931f048a7e&quot;&gt;Partner with GPU kernel engineers and platform engineers to diagnose bottlenecks across model code, kernels, runtime, scheduler, gateway, and cluster layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40fc2b50527b&quot;&gt;Write clear design docs, performance reports, rollout plans, and customer-facing technical explanations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Required-Qualifications&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d808b8c02bc9&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3974&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;000c2bf27478&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4001&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8bcf8dd9c7f9&quot;&gt;Strong Python and PyTorch engineering skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4050&quot; data-local-id=&quot;781d2e3f4c3f&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience deploying or optimizing LLM, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;, or high-throughput transformer inference systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;604abc69fbd4&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of at least one modern inference stack such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, Ray Serve, KServe, or equivalent internal systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4346&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3815fcf1bdd9&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of transformer inference bottlenecks, including &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt; cache, attention, memory bandwidth, batching, parallelism, and long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4506&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7ade27b40b8&quot;&gt;Ability to reason quantitatively about latency, throughput, quality, utilization, and cost tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4611&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba5ac6530c91&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with research, kernel, infrastructure, product, and customer teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
