&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Senior) People Development Partner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;People Development&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;📍Berlin - on-site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp University is how we build a culture of continuous learning across the business, running leadership programmes, workshops, and development initiatives for SumUppers in every market except Brazil. As part of a small, Berlin based team, you&#39;ll take ownership of flagship learning programmes and step in as a trusted facilitator, helping leaders and teams build the skills they need to do their best work. With demand for learning and development growing fast across SumUp, you&#39;ll have real scope to shape how programmes are delivered, grow your own facilitation craft, and work directly with teams in Berlin and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and deliver SumUp University programmes end to end, covering scheduling, logistics, and communication with participants and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate training sessions independently, including leadership modules, and take ownership of core programme content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver tailored workshops for teams at onsites and offsites, based on each team&#39;s specific needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and refresh training materials, adapting content for different audiences and office locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support related learning initiatives such as hackathons, internships, and coaching programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with leaders and teams across SumUp to understand learning needs and improve existing content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and facilitating training sessions or workshops for diverse audiences, ideally including leadership development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programme and project management skills, with the ability to manage timelines, logistics, and stakeholders across several initiatives at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt content and facilitation style for different teams, formats, and in person settings, including onsites and offsites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working independently while building trusted relationships with leaders, teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in people development, with the confidence to take ownership of sessions and drive them forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎁 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
