&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the role and team:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreateFuture is looking for a collaborative, technically grounded Senior Business Analyst to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Senior Business Analysts drive high-impact change across a broad spectrum of client engagements. While we deliver end-to-end digital products, this role is tailored for a BA who is as comfortable driving complex back-end environments (such as API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture, and system integration logic) as they are crafting front-end user experiences and feature specifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll leverage your proficiency in business analysis, system architecture, and product strategy to guide project development, acting as the crucial bridge between technical and non-technical stakeholders. Your responsibilities span meticulous requirements analysis, data flow mapping, estimation, and championing delivery best practices within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your exceptional communication skills are pivotal for translating complex client objectives into clear, developer-ready specifications and data flows, ensuring what we build is both valuable for users and technically robust under the hood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have a passion for the craft of Business Analysis, a natural curiosity for how complex backend systems work, and an interest in how modern tools are changing how we work? If so, we’d love to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate current and emerging business procedures, collaborating with clients and internal teams to propose impactful system solutions and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively bring cross-functional teams together to shape user stories, acceptance criteria, process flows, and technical specifications (including API contracts, payload logic, and data mappings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate data analysis, query system data to uncover edge cases, and map complex integration dependencies across backend architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project backlogs during discovery, build, and run phases, balancing business priorities against technical constraints, non-functional requirements (NFRs), and engineering effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead client discovery conversations, driving estimation efforts, facilitating workshops, and championing best practices across your project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk to you if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering both product-led user initiatives and complex technical projects (e.g., API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a Consultancy or Client facing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience as a Technical Business Analyst working closely with engineering, architecture and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;data, including data mapping, data models, databases and ideally SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of working alongside engineering teams to analyse data flows, system logic, and technical dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A user-centric mindset that ensures backend architectural choices directly support a seamless end-user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to bridge the gap between technical and non-technical stakeholders, gaining a deep understanding of business context and translating complex goals into clear. specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring meticulous requirements analysis, lead estimation efforts, and champion best practices across your project team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimented with AI tools to accelerate research, draft baseline specifications, map data fields, or red-team edge cases in system flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to or curiosity about how modern AI capabilities, LLMs, or agentic workflows integrate into backend system architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to exploring new tools and techniques that improve the speed and quality of business analysis, with a desire to share those learnings with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice in your BA work, that shouldn’t stop you from applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment, and a commitment to high-quality analysis. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner &lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-uZ_KOuW1SI-xoZ0Sd0WJCisULzkYox4/view?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;CreateFuture is a&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot;&gt; Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&lt;/a&gt; and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the role and team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing role. You own a strategy or transformation workstream end to end, usually within a larger engagement led by a Lead or Principal. You shape the research, frame the problem, facilitate the sessions and build the recommendations, then help the client act on them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work with CreateFuture&#39;s complementary disciplines (Strategy, Design, Product, AI Engineering and Data) alongside the client&#39;s own teams, often embedded with them. You are accountable for the quality and commercial relevance of what your workstream delivers, not the volume of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Diagnose and design&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the research brief and methodology with minimal support, choosing the right tools and research partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead qualitative research end to end, design and analyse quantitative research, and mine client and market data for insight - often working with specialist research partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame ambiguous problems cleanly and guide others through structured analysis to evidence-backed answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Question whether the stated problem is the right one, and reframe it when it is not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evidence-backed propositions and strategic directions, drawing on cultural and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Deliver Transformation that lands&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose how the organisation needs to change across People, Process, Platforms and Products within your workstream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design initiatives that are practical, scoped, sequenced and executable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame each challenge in commercial terms: the cost of standing still, the value at stake and the measurable outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the case for a value slice the client can see within 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage timelines, budget and stakeholder expectations for your workstream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Advise and facilitate&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run small to medium workshops, choosing the frameworks that move the group forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex ideas to senior client stakeholders, keep them engaged and handle difficult questions well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape a compelling narrative for your workstream and hold every deliverable to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Apply AI deliberately&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools (LLMs, synthesis agents, automated research) to compress discovery and free time for deeper thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead pilots that apply AI to strategy and transformation work, and share what holds up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients decide where to automate, augment, orchestrate or stay human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and coach the responsible, secure use of AI, especially client data privacy and bias in LLM output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Grow the practise around you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate project teams, give constructive feedback and support the development of junior colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update shared frameworks and document case studies and outcomes so the practice gets sharper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot emerging client needs and bring them to your Lead, helping position the team for what comes next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to proposals where your delivery experience strengthens them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to speak to you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a strategy consultancy, digital agency, transformation practice or in-house strategy function, owning workstreams from brief to recommendation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on qualitative and quantitative research and synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to new propositions, services or business models, or to organisational and digital change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical use of AI tools to speed up research, analysis and hypothesis testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident workshop facilitation and presentation to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, diagnostic thinker who is comfortable in ambiguity and helps others find their footing in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible with senior client stakeholders and able to build trust across a mixed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially aware, framing your work in terms of value the client can measure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-literate and deliberate about where AI helps and where it does not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to grow across both strategy and transformation craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are not&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deck producer who stops at the recommendation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An order-taker who responds only to defined requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who applies a method regardless of whether it fits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
