&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is a Version 1 company and &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://2429507.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2429507/CreateFuture%20Benefits%20(2026)%20(1).pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CreateFuture are looking for a collaborative and pragmatic Lead Product Manager to join our growing team and help us define and develop an exciting array of products over a variety of industries, technologies and domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Product Managers are responsible for working with senior leadership, our internal design and engineering teams and our clients to help define and implement product strategies that are consistent with our clients’ vision. This can be from early stage research and market analysis through to development, delivery and iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As we rapidly scale, we’ve identified an exciting opportunity for a Lead Product Manager to help support our growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This person will be responsible for shaping and leading client engagements. We have a variety of clients across many industries all of whom look to us to provide leadership and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will rapidly gain their trust and guide them toward a valuable customer focused outcome. To do this you’ll use your deep understanding of product management methodologies and a consistent application of good practice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will also be responsible for the wellbeing of a team of product managers. You will help embed good practice and coach your team in client management techniques and the application of product management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have experience in developing Product Managers and a passion for the craft of Product Management? Do you have an empathetic leadership style with a focus on coaching each person to help grow their career and skills? If so, we’ve got a great role for you to stretch your wings and see what you’re really capable of.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reporting into the Head of Product Operations and be able to represent the team as we grow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leading a team of Product Managers and support recruitment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Helping embed and support career progression pathways using our development framework for personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Providing support to the team through mentorship and coaching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Acting as an escalation point for the team, helping to remove internal and external blockers as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Supporting resourcing of Product Managers on projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identifying training and development needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead clients through their digital transformation journey, ensuring long term lasting relationships are made with key decision-makers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Working with the team to improve, shape and structure the Product Management ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passionate about Product Management as a discipline and keen to keep up to date on emerging trends, as well as experimenting with new tools and techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recent relevant experience of leading product focused engagements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and experience of Product Management frameworks and approaches for continuous discovery and delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of product research and collecting evidence to support value propositions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a digital transformation and AI consultancy, delivering technology solutions to enterprise clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience applying AI to products, services or delivery, with a good understanding of how AI can create value for clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring, coaching and developing Product Managers and supporting the growth of product capability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Have experience of using data to help drive decisions and steer the direction of the product towards the client’s north star&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of web and mobile technologies and practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience leading or supporting&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;client discovery, workshops and product strategy, translating business needs into digital solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be comfortable with ambiguity and help provide clarity in all situations&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;C09EB214JQN-1787053784.111639-thread-list-Thread_1787056669.790799&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re particularly interested in people who are curious about how AI is changing the craft of Product Management and are actively exploring what that means in practice.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonus points if you:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience shaping or delivering AI-enabled products, services or propositions, from early discovery through to live products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the opportunities and limitations of LLMs, generative AI and agentic systems, and can translate these into meaningful customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI-native product development, using AI to accelerate research, discovery, prototyping, analysis, documentation or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can identify where AI agents or automation could change a customer journey, business process or product experience, rather than simply adding AI features to an existing product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand some of the new product considerations AI introduces — including evaluation, trust, human oversight, data, governance and responsible AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are proactive about new AI capabilities, tools and ways of working, and enjoy helping others build their confidence and capability too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice, that shouldn’t stop you applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment and excitement about how AI is changing products and the craft of Product Management. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lorsque l&#39;on vous dit Deliveroo, vous imaginez sans doute d&#39;abord les bons petits plats livrés chez vous en moins d&#39;une demi-heure. Plutôt sympa non ? Mais c&#39;est en coulisses que l&#39;histoire est la plus intéressante. Elle est synonyme de forte croissance et d&#39;immenses opportunités dans les années à venir. Nous opérons désormais dans 10 marchés à travers le monde et travaillons avec plus de 176 000 restaurants partenaires et commerces en tous genres en France. Nous collaborons avec des milliers de livreurs et de livreuses partenaires pour le plus grand bonheur de nos millions de personnes clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous gérons l&#39;une des marketplaces tripartites les plus complexes du monde et nous le faisons en temps réel. Des millions de personnes clientes et des milliers de restaurants, de commerces en tous genres, de livreurs et de livreuses comptent sur nous pour être mis en relation en quelques secondes. Nos algorithmes sur lesquels repose cette marketplace sont l&#39;ingrédient secret qui nous permettent de livrer nos commandes en un temps record.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description de poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;stagiaire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, vous serez partie prenante du succès de nos partenaires supermarchés et commerces de bouche, en veillant à offrir une expérience unique et magique à nos utilisateurs; tout en construisant une base solide et durable pour notre application. Vous serez ainsi en support des missions suivantes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;stagiaire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; vous aiderez les Account Managers auxquels vous serez rattaché à développer leur portefeuille d’enseignes. Vos principales missions consisteront à :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le suivi opérationnel et commercial des magasins de votre portefeuille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer le portefeuille de magasins partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser quotidiennement les performances opérationnelles des magasins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appeler quotidiennement les partenaires sous performants pour les accompagner dans leur excellence opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la bonne adoption des produits Deliveroo (application de réception des commandes, outils marketing, portail partenaire, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paramétrer et mettre en place les campagnes marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit commercial -&lt;/strong&gt; vous savez anticiper des discussions commerciales, et influencer des décisions prises par l’Account Manager avec le siège social. Idéalement, vous bénéficiez d’une première expérience commerciale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactif(-ive) - &lt;/strong&gt;dans vos relations avec les interlocuteurs. Vous adorez être sur le terrain et vous êtes impliqué(e) dans tous les aspects opérationnels de votre rôle et dans votre périmètre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client centric&lt;/strong&gt; - être obsédé par nos clients. Vous utilisez des données quantitatives et qualitatives pour construire un service opérationnel excellent pour nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptabilité - &lt;/strong&gt;vous êtes enthousiaste, flexible et adaptable, capable de surmonter les obstacles grâce à la facilitation, la créativité et l&#39;ingéniosité. Vous savez quand il est temps de passer un appel et appliquer quotidiennement la règle des 80 / 20.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe -&lt;/strong&gt; vous savez collaborer et tirer le meilleur parti des personnes qui vous entourent. Vous êtes capable de travailler efficacement à tous les niveaux de Deliveroo et de réussir avec et par les autres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimiste et dynamique&lt;/strong&gt; - vous apportez de la fraîcheur, de l&#39;énergie et de la passion dans l&#39;équipe. Vous contribuez à créer un environnement de travail unique, propice aux nouvelles idées et agréable pour les autres personnes impliquées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues - &lt;/strong&gt;français courant et anglais professionnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Date de début: Janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons un environnement de travail dynamique et stimulant, où vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de développer vos compétences et de contribuer activement à notre mission de devenir la référence en matière de bien manger. Rejoignez notre équipe exceptionnelle dès maintenant et faites partie de cette aventure passionnante !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous transformons la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses en rendant leur accès plus pratique et agréable. Nous connectons les consommateurs, les restaurants, les magasins et les cyclistes. Nous donnons à chaque personne la possibilité d&#39;acheter ce qu&#39;elles veulent, comme elles le veulent, quand elles le veulent et où elles le veulent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une entreprise axée sur la technologie, à l&#39;avant-garde d’un secteur qui connaît une des expansions les plus rapides au monde. Nous avançons rapidement, valorisons l&#39;autonomie, et sommes toujours en recherche de nouvelles idées et de personnes talentueuses pour nous rejoindre!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le rôle est basé à Lille (France).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes principales missions :&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer un &lt;strong&gt;portefeuille de restaurants clés&lt;/strong&gt; sur des zones matures, où l’expertise et l’attention au détail font toute la différence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des &lt;strong&gt;partenariats privilégiés et durables&lt;/strong&gt; en devenant le point de contact expert de votre zone et en mettant à profit vos connaissances Food Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimiser la performance&lt;/strong&gt; de vos comptes grâce à un accompagnement personnalisé, construit sur le long terme et nourri par la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les résultats de vos restaurants, identifier les leviers d’amélioration et &lt;strong&gt;recommander des actions concrètes&lt;/strong&gt; à votre manager tout en restant agile et ouvert à la nouveauté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proposer et mettre en place des &lt;strong&gt;campagnes marketing et promotionnelles&lt;/strong&gt; ciblées pour booster l’attractivité de vos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre de près le déroulé des opérations afin de garantir la meilleure &lt;strong&gt;expérience restaurant&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;client&lt;/strong&gt; possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton expérience et tes qualités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà &lt;strong&gt;2 à 3 ans d’expérience&lt;/strong&gt; sur un rôle similaire où la gestion d’un portefeuille de partenaires était centrale à ta mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;négocier&lt;/strong&gt; et anticiper les discussions commerciales tout en gardant à l’esprit les valeurs de Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais garder le &lt;strong&gt;contrôle de ton portefeuille&lt;/strong&gt;, identifier les nouvelles tendances du marché et partager du feedback utile à tes partenaires ainsi qu’à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;terrain&lt;/strong&gt; est un lieu où tu te sens à ta place : tu sais construire des relations de confiance avec tes partenaires tout en gardant un œil attentif sur la concurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais te montrer &lt;strong&gt;proactif&lt;/strong&gt;, analyser les résultats de tes actions et proposer des recommandations concrètes à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu travailles de manière &lt;strong&gt;autonome&lt;/strong&gt; tout en gardant le cap fixé, sais t’approprier des objectifs précis et mets tout en œuvre pour les atteindre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais concevoir des &lt;strong&gt;actions spécifiques&lt;/strong&gt;, adaptées à la fois aux besoins de tes partenaires et à la stratégie définie par ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais identifier, comprendre et analyser les &lt;strong&gt;données de performance&lt;/strong&gt; (commerciales et opérationnelles) pour garantir un niveau de service irréprochable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;t’exprimer en anglais&lt;/strong&gt; (à l’oral comme à l’écrit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu arrives à convaincre tout en construisant des relations commerciales solides, durables, où Deliveroo devient le partenaire de choix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Et si tu cherches un poste où tu travailles en &lt;strong&gt;full remote depuis Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, tout en gardant un lien fort avec le terrain et les équipes, alors c’est peut‑être le rôle qu’il te faut !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages et diversité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo France valorise la diversité sans discrimination de genre, race, sexualité, religion ou préférences personnelles. Avec un score de 99/100 à l&#39;Indice de l&#39;Égalité Hommes-Femmes 2023, nous sommes engagés envers l&#39;égalité des chances. Rejoignez-nous avec votre passion pour la nourriture dans une entreprise en pleine croissance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s Engineering team builds the core infrastructure and product features that power real-time search and discovery for thousands of customers around the world. This includes backend services, frontend components, site reliability, and ML-powered capabilities. The team is distributed, collaborative, and committed to technical excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead multiple teams or a critical product area, working closely with Engineering Managers, Product, and Design to deliver scalable, reliable, and high-impact solutions. You will play a key role in translating company strategy into execution, while building strong, autonomous teams and fostering engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role Will Consist Of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a &lt;strong&gt;group of engineering teams (via Engineering Managers and Senior ICs)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with product and company priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong AI leadership within the engineering organization by fostering a culture of &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; and proactively evaluating and applying emerging AI technologies to enhance productivity, efficiency, and organizational performance across the broader technology function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning &lt;strong&gt;delivery, execution, and operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt; for a defined product or platform area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with &lt;strong&gt;Product, Design, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to shape roadmaps and ensure successful delivery of customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices&lt;/strong&gt; across system design, scalability, reliability, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a member of Algolia’s senior technology leadership team, with significant contributions to &lt;strong&gt;engineering excellence&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;high performance&lt;/strong&gt; of the global technology organization, extending beyond the immediate area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and coaching &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Managers&lt;/strong&gt;, helping them grow as leaders and build high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to &lt;strong&gt;organizational planning&lt;/strong&gt;, including headcount, team structure, and quarterly/annual planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring a strong culture of &lt;strong&gt;ownership, accountability, and continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; within your organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a &lt;strong&gt;bridge between strategy and execution&lt;/strong&gt;, translating high-level goals into clear team-level priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as a trusted advisor to the CTO and SVP Engineering, providing &lt;strong&gt;strategic guidance&lt;/strong&gt; on engineering leadership, organizational effectiveness, and cross-functional management initiatives across the technology organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Might Be a Fit If You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–12+ years of engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;3–5+ years managing multiple teams or managing through managers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering &lt;strong&gt;complex, cross-functional projects&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background with experience in &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems, APIs, and scalable infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;lead through others&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering managers and senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to &lt;strong&gt;align diverse stakeholders and drive clarity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in &lt;strong&gt;distributed or global engineering environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;developer tools, infrastructure, or data platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;product-led growth (PLG)&lt;/strong&gt; environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML-powered products or platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€150.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re currently in networking mode! While we don&#39;t have an immediate vacancy, we want to connect with top-tier Account Management talent for future roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for the best in the business - those who can provide strategic guidance to enterprise brands across France. If you have a track record of delivering end-to-end support for major agencies and direct advertisers, we want to see your profile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us get to know you now so we’re ready to move when you (and we) are!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love you to join our Talent Bank if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years’ experience in a results-driven customer-facing role in digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French with the ability to work professionally in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in dealing with and managing premium media agency clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have knowledge of KPI based campaign/client management and optimization of campaigns towards hitting ROI and CPA targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the Ad Tech industry and the Media Agencies landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with managing a portfolio of clients, including prioritization and growing accounts according to potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are eager to understand and present the opportunities involved for clients looking for infinite scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong analytical skills, monitoring and identification of trends in data and generation of actionable insight and reports for the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have outstanding relationship management and customer-facing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent technological skills and the ability to quickly learn what is needed to support successful campaign implementation and optimization from a technical point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to travel for business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent spoken and written English communication skills, as all internal communications with our global staff and specialized teams are conducted in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A future role on Team Taboola could include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a strategic book of business and portfolio by prioritizing clients based on potential, spotting opportunities to scale, and identifying new business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving growth through upselling, cross-selling, and proactive outreach to expand international accounts and launch new product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying new business opportunities and managing a client portfolio to grow accounts according to their maximum potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing strategic account insights by analyzing data and creating custom reports to support arguments for growth and platform optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating across the team with common objectives to achieve client goals, strengthen relationships, and grow partnerships from a revenue perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a proactive consultant to ensure clients follow best practices and maximize every opportunity to achieve success on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with clients to help them understand and optimize their campaigns, hit specific goals, and scale their accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing end-to-end campaign management, from handling initial technical implementations and tracking codes to coordinating with ad ops for successful launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading face-to-face quarterly business reviews and meetings with stakeholders ranging from day-to-day contacts to c-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizing lunch and learn sessions that educate clients, elevate expertise, and accelerate growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Taboola?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you ask Taboolars what they love about working here, they’ll tell you that they’ve been empowered to realize their full potential while growing and learning from and with smart and talented people. They’ll also share more about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Adam Singolda, Taboola Founder and CEO says; “You can copy anything from another business but you can’t copy a company’s culture. And benefits like mobility allowance, mobile phone, Healthcare allowance, disability insurance, pension, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a hybrid work schedule with 3 days in-office with an option to come in more often if desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with some of the biggest names: &lt;/strong&gt;We work with some of the biggest names in the business. Our publisher partners include Apple, Samsung, Yahoo, Microsoft, Fox Sports, Hearts, ESPN and CBS. A selection of our advertisers includes leading brands such as KLM, KIA, Hyundai, Mercedes, Klarna, Saxo Bank, and many others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Realize your potential?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is an equal opportunity employer and we value diversity in all forms. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and believe such an environment is critical for success. Employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learn more about #TaboolaLife on LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, X, YouTube, &amp;amp; the Taboola Life Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Taboola:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola empowers businesses to grow through performance advertising technology that goes beyond search and social and delivers measurable outcomes at scale.&lt;br&gt;Taboola works with thousands of businesses who advertise directly on Realize, Taboola’s powerful ad platform, reaching approximately 600M daily active users across some of the best publishers in the world. Publishers like NBC News, Yahoo, and OEMs such as Samsung, Xiaomi and others use Taboola’s technology to grow audience and revenue, enabling Realize to offer unique data, specialized algorithms, and unmatched scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DS1&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Partner Solutions Engineer is a highly experienced technical lead responsible for driving the growth and technical enablement of our key partners (Telcos, Global Systems Integrators, Resellers and BPOs) across the Netherlands, Belgium and Luxembourg and Germany.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This senior individual contributor role reports directly to the Vice President, Partner Solution Engineering. You will act as the primary technical point of contact, supporting partners in establishing and scaling their Contact Center as a Service (CCaaS) and Customer Experience Automation (CXA) practices built around the Talkdesk platform. This role involves deep technical engagement, partner enablement, co-selling support, and providing technical thought leadership to ensure mutual partner and customer success across the assigned territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Enablement &amp;amp; Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute comprehensive enablement plans to educate partner Solutions Architects and Sales Engineers on the Talkdesk value proposition, product architecture, competitive differentiators, and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Center of Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of Partner Competency Centers by coaching on effective technical discovery, platform demonstrations, and proof-of-concept (POC) execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain deep domain expertise in the regional Partner landscape, understanding their current go-to-market (GTM) strategy, areas of focus, and identifying new opportunities for expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Selling Support &amp;amp; Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical expertise on &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt; solutions within the contact center, including prompt engineering, RAG implementations, tools integration, and guardrail best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical oversight, guidance, and direct assistance to Partner sales teams in understanding complex customer business and technical requirements, use cases, and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Demonstration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead advanced technical discussions, conduct compelling demonstrations of the Talkdesk platform, and articulate the ease of integration within an enterprise ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a deep understanding of the enterprise ecosystem, including integration requirements with &lt;strong&gt;CRM&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics), &lt;strong&gt;WFM, Knowledge Management, and UCaaS &lt;/strong&gt;vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Contribution &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Voice of the Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the critical communication channel to Talkdesk Product Management and Engineering teams, relaying Partner and customer needs, market trends, and product enhancement requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Representation:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Talkdesk as a technical expert at regional Partner summits, technical events, webinars, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Travel approximately 70% of the time across the Netherlands, Belgium and Luxembourg, working primarily from partner offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;10+ years of experience as a &lt;strong&gt;Partner Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; or Pre-Sales Engineer in the &lt;strong&gt;CCaaS/CXA&lt;/strong&gt; sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Business-level fluency in Dutch and professional fluency in English are required. German or French as a further language is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and whiteboard session skills&lt;/strong&gt; with an ability to lead advanced technical discussions and deliver compelling platform demonstrations for enterprise customers &amp;amp; Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid experience working with &lt;strong&gt;Service Providers, Regional Systems Integrators, National Partners, and VARs&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven understanding of a partner-centric GTM approach within the Benelux market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to lead and drive complex technical engagements and serve as a subject matter expert without direct people management responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telephony &amp;amp; Protocol Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with at least one &lt;strong&gt;Unified Communication protocol&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., SIP, WebRTC, RTP) and familiarity with Call/Message processing Proxies and Session Border Controllers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or strong familiarity with modern &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt; technologies, including the practical application of LLMs for Contact Center and Customer Experience Automation use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, MIS, or an equivalent combination of education and years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method of Application&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Apply online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window&lt;/strong&gt;: The application window is expected to close at least 5 days from the posting date. The application was posted on 10/18/2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits and perks listed above may vary based on the nature of your employment with Talkdesk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All questions or concerns about this posting should be directed to the Talent team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk is pioneering a new era of Customer Experience Automation (CXA), redefining how the world’s most admired brands interact with their customers through AI. Our global team of courageous innovators is customer-obsessed, building AI-first solutions that put empathy, trust, and transparency at the center of every interaction. We foster an inclusive culture where diverse perspectives drive our success and every voice belongs. Combining the stability of a global leader with the agility of a disruptor, Talkdeskers are empowered with the autonomy to drive meaningful impact, while giving back to the communities and environment around us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk has been recognized as a Leader in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Contact Center as a Service (CCaaS) and in the G2 Overall Grid® Reports for AI Agents and Contact Center. With seven consecutive years on the Forbes Cloud 100 and multiple AI Breakthrough awards, there has never been a more exciting time to join us as we shape the future of customer experience automation!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment and Physical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Primarily office-environment work, extended periods of sitting or standing, computer-based work. Limited lifting, and equipment usage limited to computer-related equipment (keyboards, mouse, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Talkdesk story hinges on empathy and acceptance. It is the shared goal among all Talkdeskers to empower a new kind of customer hero through our innovative software solution, and we firmly believe that the best path to success for our mission is inclusivity, diversity, and genuine acceptance. To that end, we will hire, promote, work along, cheer for, bond with, and warmly welcome into the Talkdesk family all persons without regard to ethnic and racial identity, indigenous heritage, national origin, religion, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, marital status, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f161c5e0e159&quot;&gt;As an &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer, you’ll work side-by-side with teammates to build real-world applications that power a global trading firm. You’ll create solutions with nanosecond response times, highly parallelized algorithms, and customized low-level networking that solve business challenges effectively and efficiently. Collaborating closely with our business, you’ll have in-depth insight into a problem before developing the solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;431&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adba195f4739&quot;&gt;Optiver is building with cutting edge AI technology in the most competitive, data rich landscapes in the world: financial markets. Our &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; engineers use AI to speed up verification, debugging, and technical research, while retaining full ownership of the designs and decisions it supports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;723&quot; data-local-id=&quot;17a0fe36f211&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;739&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73bf921aff41&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;faf72777d0b4&quot;&gt;You will participate in Optiver’s comprehensive &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/working-at-optiver/career-hub/kickstart-your-tech-career-with-the-global-optiver-academy-technology/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Global Academy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and be equipped with the knowledge needed to make an impact the moment you join your team. The comprehensive training covers trading theory and Optiver’s tech stack to hone your skills for your role. In addition, you will be paired with a dedicated mentor who will empower you to take ownership of your work and make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1151&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca6e2c0c77c8&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0e361e4-6196-4356-8541-d8f002e435bf&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1176&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eac520c2171&quot;&gt;Accelerate network infrastructure and trading system components with high-speed hardware designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a022afb9a9ab&quot;&gt;Research new low-latency techniques and platforms and identify opportunities for integration with our trading system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fadf5bffabfd&quot;&gt;Collaborate in a multidisciplinary team of traders, software developers, and infrastructure engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5addbd5461f6&quot;&gt;Leverage the best hardware available or build in-house versions to ensure our FPGAs can interface with cutting-edge server hardware.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;146a73037404&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eacf938451f&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2011&quot; data-local-id=&quot;503188307740&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;99ca3959-15c0-45f1-a447-767e53fdf49b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2043&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f9c9f8fb4a2&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3fe9d7a371b&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2250&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f436e67758ba&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;30a31e86a468&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2445&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb0b9c1fb6fb&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, sport and leisure activities, bi-weekly massages and Friday afternoon drinks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2616&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa46477f06b3&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;044e9d2ff377&quot;&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c7c84d9e057&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2814&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ffe813798de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8295f26d0d39&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2829&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9cb4fbc9c504&quot;&gt;University degree in Electrical/Electronic Engineering, Computer Engineering or similar, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2960&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29bca845925&quot;&gt;Graduating between August 2024 and August 2027, with a maximum of 3 years of work experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3056&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88b9545187e7&quot;&gt;Academic design experience with FPGAs or ASICs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3106&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0a544f723de&quot;&gt;Academic experience in &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VHDL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Verilog, or SystemVerilog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d77564dce5cd&quot;&gt;An open, collaborative, self-critical attitude and willingness to learn from your mistakes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3258&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6bc214fc201c&quot;&gt;A desire to understand how the systems you build fit into our trading activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1b4604aa2b53&quot;&gt;Able to work closely with other engineers, traders, and business operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3421&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3128ca8fb8fd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3423&quot; data-local-id=&quot;823584a77e0c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How to Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer. Please provide us with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;br&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;br&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via the &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4075&quot; data-local-id=&quot;139f367f88ca&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5abdd7d99e5d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6aff0008585e&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4149&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b474595d9b&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;via the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d289fcd7c1a&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ddd7edd2cd3e&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;895e3754d5bc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Ready to shape the future of talent acquisition in a global trading firm? As a Senior Campus Recruiter, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind spotting and bringing the top 1% of talent from Europe&#39;s premier universities on board. Your journey involves navigating the full campus recruitment lifecycle, from identification to selection, and making your mark at European recruitment events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join our Campus Recruitment team in Europe, based in Amsterdam, part of a wider recruitment organisation of experienced tech, trading and business support recruiters. Collaboration comes first here: we share knowledge, step in for each other in peak season, and succeed as one team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end recruitment process: screening, interviewing, assessment review, offer conversations and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with business leaders and interviewers, and make sure we&#39;re aligned on hiring needs and on what great looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a data-driven way, using insights to make our process sharper, fairer and more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic projects such as market analyses, process and assessment reviews, and improvements to how we select&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IMC at recruitment events across Europe, with frequent travel (more than four times a year)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of industry experience, ideally within a global finance, trading, tech or consultancy organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial markets and the trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical eye: you question how things are done, spot trends early and turn them into practical improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to think strategically and act tactically, moving easily between the bigger picture and getting things done today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented mindset: when something isn&#39;t working, you look for a better way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy operational recruitment. Running a tight process and giving candidates a great experience energises you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build relationships with the business with ease and earn trust as a partner, not just a service provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a dynamic environment where no two days are the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well in a larger team and put collaboration first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with industry trends and best practices in campus recruitment and bring them into your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A unique work culture that values collaboration, initiative, and ownership. Our professional and friendly environment provides the perfect backdrop for your growth and responsibilities. We operate with transparency in a flat structure, allowing you direct engagement with stakeholders and professionals. Your input matters here, contributing to our collective success. At IMC, continuous learning is a priority. Various training and on-the-job growth opportunities allow you to shape your path within the organisation. This isn&#39;t just a job; it&#39;s a journey of ongoing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We appreciate your efforts. Our highly competitive salary comes with great perks. If you&#39;re looking for a friendly yet professional space to contribute and grow, IMC is the place. If you&#39;re ready for a role beyond routine recruitment, where your experience can contribute to the future of our team and company, apply now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Are you comfortable navigating complex software systems, working with coding agents, and defining what makes developer tools actually useful? Do you want to shape how developers and AI work together inside IDEs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agentic development is changing how software gets built. Developers no longer just chat with AI – they delegate tasks, run parallel agent sessions, and steer autonomous changes. As agents take on more work, reviewing and owning the output is becoming the hardest part of the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetBrains Air is our open system for agentic development. It brings tools like Codex, GitHub Copilot, Claude Agent, Gemini, and Junie directly into JetBrains IDEs, providing an agentic-first user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead key areas of Air. You’ll take ownership of high-impact workflows, work closely with cross-functional teams (including software engineers, designers, ML researchers, analysts, DevRel, and product marketing), and turn technical complexity into clear product direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of key parts of Air in JetBrains IDEs, driving work from problem framing and discovery to delivery, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and refine core agentic workflows, including task delegation, session monitoring, steering, and code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model complex user flows, system states, permissions, and integration schemes to guide engineering and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a transparent roadmap that balances quick improvements with long-term strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define telemetry, design experiments, analyze product data, and make evidence-based roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study how developers interact with leading AI agents and tools to inform product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the Agent Client Protocol (ACP) ecosystem and collaborate with partners building on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enterprise sales and support teams to address governance, privacy, and control requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-thinking mindset that easily breaks down complex architectures, workflows, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to product decisions, including hands-on experience querying and analyzing telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active personal experience using coding agents and clear perspectives on where current AI tools succeed and fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product intuition for complex technical user experiences and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise, and collaborative communication skills with the ability to explain complex technical concepts simply and build alignment across diverse groups of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating fast-changing technical landscapes with high ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience shipping end-user products as a product manager or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in software development workflows, including IDEs, git, code review, CI/CD, and package management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on technical background sufficient to collaborate closely with software and ML engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of core AI and agent concepts, including tool use, protocols (MCP/ACP), context retrieval, evaluations, and latency/cost trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write SQL or Python to analyze product metrics and experiment results independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 6 to 12 months, success in this role means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving measurable growth in active Air users and improving weekly/monthly retention (D7/D30).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing agent session completion rates and the proportion of agent-generated changes accepted by developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing clear, telemetry-backed decisions across your product roadmap areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering validated product hypotheses consistently each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing directly to JetBrains AI revenue growth and overall IDE value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary – We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule – Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off – More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities – Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free meals and snacks – Lunch and refreshments provided to keep you fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness – On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events – Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, send us your resume and a short note on why you&#39;re interested in Air.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KL1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;(FEQ128R42)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the technical leader and lead architect for one of Databricks&#39; most strategic global customers: a health technology company whose diagnostic, therapy, connected-care and consumer health products reach hundreds of millions of people every year. You will own the technical relationship and the Data + AI vision for a single complex enterprise that spans multiple business units, regions and regulatory regimes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The account is a large, Azure-first Data Intelligence Platform customer. It runs a portfolio of well over a hundred use cases across business units and global functions, delivered as a multi-year program in quarterly releases. You will set the technical direction for that program and turn it into an executable roadmap. You will work as one team with the Account Executive and a dedicated pod of Solutions Architects, specialists, Professional Services and partners. We are looking for a visionary who can see where Data + AI will take health technology, explain that clearly to executives and engineers alike, and bring a large, distributed group of people with them!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and drive the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the customer&#39;s enterprise Data + AI vision with CxO and VP stakeholders, tied directly to business priorities. Be the executive suite&#39;s trusted advisor on platform strategy, build-vs-buy, responsible AI and regulated-industry governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show, don&#39;t tell: inspire CTOs, chief architects and engineering leaders with working examples, and build prototypes yourself when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the account pod technically: set direction for Solutions Architects, Specialist and Delivery SAs, Professional Services and partners, and coach them to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Account Executive on account strategy and consumption planning, owning technical strategy and path to value for every major initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align pre-sales, delivery and partners so the customer sees one Databricks team, one plan and one escalation path, local to global. Lead discovery and solution design for strategic, high-risk deployments, driving each to production and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lasting C-level, VP and Director relationships across IT, data &amp;amp; AI, R&amp;amp;D, Quality &amp;amp; Regulatory, Service, Operations and the business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the customer&#39;s voice internally, shaping Databricks product and go-to-market strategy with field insight while leading the account&#39;s largest modernisation programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale GenAI and agentic AI from pilot to production across business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build partner ecosystem relationships (GSIs, ISVs, hyperscalers) to scale delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable IP (reference designs, accelerators, talks, blogs) for the wider Databricks health and life sciences community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Note: it is not expected that you “tick every box” below and encourage you to apply if you are meeting several of the key criteria and can demonstrate a strong ability to transfer skills and develop quickly in the role!) &amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record as lead technical figure on a large global enterprise account, or as enterprise/chief architect at a similar organisation, owning the vision over multiple years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading virtual teams without direct authority: setting direction, coaching senior architects and aligning specialists, delivery and partners on one plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives with high autonomy in ambiguous, high-stakes, multi-region, multi-business-unit environments. Excellent communicator, from boardroom to engineering floor, with clear written thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in data engineering, analytics, ML or AI architecture, with significant customer-facing technical leadership (pre-sales, consulting or enterprise architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise in modern data and AI platforms; Apache Spark, Delta Lake and Databricks experience is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large-scale data platforms and migrations from legacy warehouses, Hadoop or other clouds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise governance and security models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production ML, MLOps, GenAI and agent systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to win platform decisions against hyperscaler-native and competing platforms on architecture, cost and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python and SQL; able to prototype quickly, including with AI-assisted development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in health technology, medical devices, life sciences or another regulated industry, and a passion for improving patient outcomes with Data + AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MedTech and medical AI regulation:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU MDR/IVDR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FDA SaMD and Predetermined Change Control Plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 13485, IEC 62304 and ISO 14971&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU AI Act requirements for high-risk medical AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of privacy and data-sharing regimes (GDPR, HIPAA, European Health Data Space). Familiarity with healthcare data standards (DICOM, HL7, FHIR, OMOP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or at a global MedTech, health technology or diagnostics company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing validated, audit-ready (GxP / 21 CFR Part 11) data and AI environments. Enterprise-scale SAP data integration (BW, S/4HANA) and semantic harmonisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public thought leadership: conference talks, publications or open source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch is a plus; professional English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R122&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the Data and AI space. Our customers rely on us to drive the accelerated innovation needed to stay ahead in today’s highly competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Named Enterprise Hunter Account Executive to join the team to maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks across Benelux. Reporting to the Director of Enterprise Sales, you will be responsible for driving strategic growth and expanding our footprint across the region’s most critical enterprise accounts. This role is hybrid, based in Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess your list of assigned accounts and develop a strategy to execute against it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a customer base, identifying and closing new logo opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead your customers and partners to identify impactful big data and AI use cases whilst proving out their value on the Databricks Lakehouse platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify land opportunities and develop the expand / consumption use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate and utilise internal teams to maximise the impact on your ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build exceptional value with all engagements to guide successful negotiations to close point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4+ years of experience selling SaaS solutions to Enterprise Customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience and strong performance in new logo hunting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Big Data, Cloud, or SaaS industries with some technical sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful experience selling complex software deals and quota over-achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of consumption based land and expand sales models is advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the Data &amp;amp; AI space with some technology sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of creating demand that delivered substantial business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of following robust sales methodologies and process, e.g. account planning, MEDDPICC, Value Selling and accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building effective champions, collaborative teams and partnerships to support execution of your territory plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to identify all key uses cases and buying centres in an opportunity to increase the impact of Databricks in an organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the Benelux territory and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in business English and Dutch&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Anduril&#39;s global communications team is responsible for shaping how the world understands modern defense technology—and why it matters. We&#39;re seeking a Director of Communications, Europe, to build and lead Anduril&#39;s external communications presence across the continent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role based in Amsterdam, reporting to the VP of Global Communications, with a dotted line to Anduril&#39;s European General Manager. You will be Anduril&#39;s first dedicated communications hire in Europe, responsible for standing up a regional program from scratch, building relationships with media and institutions, and developing the narratives that will define Anduril&#39;s reputation across the world&#39;s most consequential defense markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a builder role. You&#39;ll set strategy and execute it yourself, establish agency and contractor networks as the business grows, and work shoulder-to-shoulder with business development, policy, and senior leadership to earn Anduril a place in Europe&#39;s defense conversation. The ideal candidate has deep roots across multiple European markets, understands how defense, technology, and industrial policy intersect at the national level, and knows how to build presence and credibility in environments where trust is earned slowly and reputation matters enormously.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Anduril&#39;s European communications program from the ground up, developing strategy, establishing infrastructure, and executing across markets with varying levels of maturity and priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive media relations across defense, technology, business, and policy outlets in priority European markets, building the relationships and pipelines that will sustain long-term coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute market-specific narrative strategies that connect Anduril&#39;s mission and capabilities to each country&#39;s defense priorities, industrial ambitions, and security context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Anduril&#39;s European General Manager and business development teams to support market entry, customer engagement, partnerships, and key events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a network of regional agencies and contractors as European operations expand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global communications, policy, and marketing teams to adapt core messaging for European audiences without losing coherence or accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage think tanks, research institutions, and policy communities to build credibility and shape the broader discourse around defense innovation and allied cooperation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own metrics and reporting frameworks to track progress and demonstrate impact across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in communications, public affairs, or media relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in the European defense and political landscape across multiple countries, how decisions get made, who shapes opinion, and where the conversation is heading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building communications programs in new markets, not just inheriting them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, contractors, and regional communications networks across borders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and strategic thinking, with the ability to develop narratives that land across cultures and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working autonomously in an early-stage market environment, with the judgment to make calls without a lot of process around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll excel in this role if you:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built something before, a market presence, a regional program, a communications function, and know what that actually requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can hold complexity: different countries, different threat perceptions, different industrial interests, all requiring distinct approaches under a coherent strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know Europe&#39;s defense ecosystem personally, the journalists, the institutions, the officials who shape how these conversations evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are energized by the moment Europe is in, and want to help shape how one of the most important defense technology companies in the world shows up in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;(Berlin,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW158157431 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ab November, befristet, 20h pro Woche)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW158157431 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Du möchtest mitgestalten, wie Lernen und Entwicklung bei Sony Music aussehen, und gleichzeitig hinter die Kulissen der Musikbranche blicken? Dann werde Teil unseres People Experience Teams und unterstütze uns dabei, Lernangebote zu entwickeln, zu organisieren und für unsere Mitarbeitenden erlebbar zu machen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du machst&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt bei der Weiterentwicklung, Organisation und Umsetzung unserer Learning-&amp;amp;-Development-Angebote, von Trainings und Workshops bis hin zu digitalen Lernformaten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du übernimmst eigenverantwortlich die Koordination und Umsetzung unserer L&amp;amp;D-Maßnahmen im Early Careers-Bereich, darunter Onboarding Events, 30-Tage-Talks &amp;amp; Midterm Feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt bei der Kommunikation unserer Learning-Angebote und hilfst dabei, Entwicklungsangebote für unsere Mitarbeitenden sichtbar und zugänglich zu machen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du koordinierst Trainings und Schulungen, stimmst Termine mit Trainer:innen und Teilnehmenden ab und sorgst dafür, dass organisatorisch alles rundläuft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt bei der Auswertung von Feedback und Umfragen, recherchierst aktuelle L&amp;amp;D-Trends und bringst eigene Ideen für die Weiterentwicklung unserer Angebote ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt projektbezogen Initiativen und Projekte im Bereich Culture &amp;amp; Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wer du bist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist immatrikulierte:r Student:in im Bereich Wirtschaftswissenschaften, Personalmanagement, Psychologie, Pädagogik, Kommunikation oder einem vergleichbaren Studiengang.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du begeisterst dich für Lernen, persönliche und berufliche Entwicklung und hast Freude daran, moderne Learning-Angebote aktiv mitzugestalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Erfahrungen im Bereich Learning &amp;amp; Development sind ein Plus, ebenso wie Berührungspunkte mit HowNow oder anderen E-Learning-Plattformen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest eigenständig und strukturiert, packst gerne mit an und behältst auch dann den Überblick, wenn mehrere Themen gleichzeitig laufen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast Freude an Organisation und Kommunikation, bist aber genauso neugierig darauf, konzeptionell zu arbeiten und eigene Ideen einzubringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über Deutschkenntnisse auf C2-Niveau und gute Englischkenntnisse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wir bieten dir&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkte Einblicke in Learning &amp;amp; Development sowie People &amp;amp; Culture Themen, Verantwortung von Anfang an und die Möglichkeit, unsere Lernkultur aktiv mitzugestalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein monatlicher Musikstreaming-Zuschuss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events und Konzerte in unserem Headquarter mitten in Berlin Schöneberg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie du dich bewirbst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ohne Anschreiben. Ohne Foto und Alter. Auch Familienstand, deine Herkunft, Zeugnisse, die Jobs deiner Eltern und ähnliche Merkmale benötigen wir nicht.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeige uns in einem CV oder in einer anderen kreativen Form was dich ausmacht, was du kannst und warum Sony Music mit dir besser klingt!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Wir freuen uns auf dich. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Sony Music sounds better with you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
