&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be the strategic engine room of Raisin’s People &amp;amp; Culture team—building the secure, data-driven, and innovative infrastructure that empowers our people and scales the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We bridge the gap between people strategy and the technology that powers it. We ensure Raisin is future-ready, fair, and fully compliant by focusing on four core pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; We manage and evolve our HRIS landscape so P&amp;amp;C can focus on people, not manual processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; We leverage people analytics and AI automation to guide smarter business decisions, driving equity through modern Total Rewards frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; We act as P&amp;amp;C’s compliance anchor—taking ownership of audit requests, people policy and process transformation, and risk management (TPRM) to keep our infrastructure secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a People Analytics Manager to own the data, reporting, and insights of Raisin’s People function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will ensure smooth operations of our HR reporting systems and be the main point of contact for data-driven insights and analytics requests within our People tooling stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will build and maintain Raisin’s People dashboards and reports to meet the business needs based on the requirements of the People business functions and in close alignment with the People Solutions leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will look after the data modeling, trend analysis, and predictive analytics related to our workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support seamless integrations of People data pipelines in close alignment with People and Culture leadership and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own the documentation of HR metrics, data definitions, and reporting structures across Raisin’s People applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a university degree in Data Science, Statistics, Economics, or a related field, or bring equivalent experience with a strong analytical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of hands-on experience in People Analytics, Business Intelligence, or data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to translate complex data sets into clear narratives and actionable insights for business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong People domain knowledge incl. People processes across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly responsible, trustworthy, and adept at handling sensitive and confidential data with the utmost discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong communication skills and you feel comfortable collaborating with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with our tooling stack (especially with data visualization tools like Looker Studio and HRIS like Personio) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Enablement builds Raisin&#39;s internal AI platform. We make it easy and safe for every team, from engineering and product to business operations, to use AI in their daily work and in the products they build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide the shared foundation for that: governed access to AI models and tools, the controls that keep data secure and usage auditable, and the visibility teams need to run AI reliably and cost-effectively. We also shape how Raisin builds software with AI, from AI-assisted coding to agentic workflows that support teams across the development lifecycle. Because Raisin operates in regulated financial services, security and compliance are core to how we design the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is growing, and you will shape both what it builds and how it works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Lead, you lead the engineers who build Raisin&#39;s internal AI platform and drive the company&#39;s AI-assisted engineering practices. You are accountable for the team&#39;s delivery, growth, and maintaining the AI platform users&#39; trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You stay close to the technology, because in a field that changes this quickly, good leadership decisions depend on understanding the technical details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, and develop engineers, and build a team that works autonomously across platform engineering, infrastructure, and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold regular 1:1s, set clear expectations, and agree individual development plans with each engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give timely feedback, recognise strong performance, and address low performance early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment of trust, open communication, and continuous learning, so the team keeps up with a fast-moving field without burning out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery and operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery, from planning and estimation through implementation and release, balancing new capabilities with reliability and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the platform runs well in production: on-call, incident handling, and service levels for the systems other teams rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot risks and blockers early and resolve them, or escalate in time with a clear proposal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn the AI strategy into quarterly goals and a roadmap the team commits to, together with your manager and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the platform as a product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering, product, and business stakeholders to understand their needs and decide what the platform should offer next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure adoption, reliability, cost, and impact, and use that data in planning and when reporting to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the cost of AI usage and tooling, including budgets, licences, vendor relationships, and build-versus-buy decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the technical direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the team&#39;s tech leads on architecture and key technical decisions, and stay hands-on in design discussions, reviews, and selected implementation work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with security, legal, and compliance colleagues to keep the platform and the company&#39;s use of AI secure and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help engineering teams across Raisin adopt AI in their work through documentation, workshops, and direct support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading engineers as an Engineering Manager, Engineering Lead, or Team Lead, including hiring and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in software engineering overall, with a background in backend, platform, infrastructure, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team that builds for internal customers, such as a platform, developer tooling, or shared services used by other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering production systems that other teams depend on, including ownership of their reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of modern AI integration, such as LLM APIs, AI coding assistants, and agentic workflows, deep enough to evaluate technical decisions and challenge the team. You use AI tools in your own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication with engineers, product, and business stakeholders, and fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI platform topics such as model access, governance, observability, rate limiting, or cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have driven adoption of new tools or practices across an engineering organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed or hybrid teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated industry such as banking or fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box. If you have led a platform or developer-tooling team and you are excited about what AI changes for engineering, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure Germany is seeking a driven, results-oriented Commercial Account Executive to expand and grow our German commercial business. This high-impact sales role suits a self-directed operator who can create pipeline, open new accounts, expand existing relationships, and consistently move opportunities from discovery through to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll combine the speed and stamina of a strong hunter with the relationship-building and business sense of a trusted advisor. You’ll work closely with Sales Engineering, Channel, Partner Sales, Field Marketing, Customer Success, and other teams to deliver measurable value for customers and hit revenue targets across the German commercial market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Commercial Account Executive, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote Innovative Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Advocate for our complete portfolio – storage, Kubernetes data services, and subscription offerings – as a strategic data platform for German commercial accounts.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong connections with customers and keep satisfaction high. Develop and execute a territory plan across whitespace and installed-base accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Strategise:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct pursuit teams and build account plans to win new customers. Find and create new business opportunities while expanding adoption within existing commercial accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage the Sales Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive activities to meet and exceed quota. Build and maintain a healthy, qualified pipeline through structured prospecting, partner engagement, customer meetings, marketing-led events, and targeted account activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Partners:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Channel, GSI, and Ecosystem Partners in Germany to position Everpure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Account Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and carry out strategies to close deals consistently. Understand customer priorities, business drivers, and financial considerations, and connect them to relevant Everpure outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Results:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceed quota, maintain a strong pipeline, and drive referenceable business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate Effectively:&lt;/strong&gt; Present proposals that highlight Everpure’s benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To excel in this role, you should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong drive for sales and relationship building. Sound financial acumen and the ability to discuss business impact, investment priorities, and deal structures that benefit both sides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in direct and indirect sales to commercial accounts in Germany, with the ability to manage a mix of new-logo and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with Channel, GSI, and Ecosystem Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prospecting Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced skills in engaging new customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ambition and Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A goal-oriented attitude and a desire to drive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Success:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of exceeding quota and maintaining a robust pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of cloud computing, data management, and data centre architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent time management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of field sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or bilingual German and professional English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position and we&#39;re considering candidates in Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Product Management&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Grafana Labs, you&#39;ll develop a vision and strategy for your product domain. You will own the experience for your product as well as its roadmap and competitive positioning, and you will collaborate with company leadership on setting your product&#39;s goals. You will be the primary advocate and expert in your area, with a strong ability to communicate needs, functionality, and details effectively both to external customers and internal stakeholders. The teams and people you will be interacting with will be 100% remote and globally distributed, so strong and proactive communication is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers are the bridge that connects R&amp;amp;D to GTM. You are a facilitator who ensures the free flow of information across these teams and are expected to be technically proficient when representing our products to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager for Enterprise Deployment Solutions, you&#39;ll own the Grafana Labs offerings that run outside our standard multi-tenant SaaS. That includes &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Federal Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;, for organizations that need FedRAMP-authorized observability: US federal agencies; state, local, and education (SLED) customers; and commercial companies that sell FedRAMP offerings of their own. It also includes &lt;strong&gt;Grafana Cloud Bring Your Own Cloud (BYOC)&lt;/strong&gt;, which delivers the full Grafana Cloud experience while the customer pays the infrastructure bill directly to their cloud provider, saving them significantly at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make Grafana Labs the obvious choice for organizations that can&#39;t use standard SaaS because of compliance, data, or cost-at-scale constraints. Deployment choices change the product: features that are simple in standard SaaS can be hard, expensive, or impossible in a regulated or customer-owned environment. You’ll be responsible for adapting existing Grafana Cloud capabilities to these environments, deciding which features come in, which wait, and which stay out, and occasionally building something specific to BYOC or Federal Cloud. You&#39;ll also help shape which deployment models we offer next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along the way, you’ll use AI tools daily to speed up research, analyze product signals, and develop positioning, applying strong judgment to the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager for Enterprise Deployment Solutions, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the vision, strategy, and roadmap for the Grafana Bring Your Own Cloud and Grafana Federal Cloud products, using product data and market research to balance customer value against engineering cost and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own positioning, messaging, and differentiation for these products, including how they compare to regular Grafana Cloud, and partner with Product Marketing on launches, competitive analysis, enablement, and demand programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Technical Program Management on buildouts for these environments, balancing customer timelines with engineering capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers, prospects, and the field on strategic deals and brief partners, resellers, and analysts on our deployment options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Compliance, and Legal to work through product changes affecting our authorization or existing customer commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re excited about you because you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience on a technical B2B product, &lt;em&gt;or&lt;/em&gt; a technical background (software engineering, solutions architecture, SRE, or technical program management) plus a demonstrated move into product ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a non-standard SaaS deployment model, such as self-managed, air-gapped, sovereign, BYOC, single-tenant, or FedRAMP/government cloud, and a firsthand understanding of how it changes the product, its operations, and its economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, platform software, or developer tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear product and go-to-market judgment: you&#39;ve shaped what a product should be and how it&#39;s positioned and sold, not only when it ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working with US public sector customers and learning their needs and buying cycles. Deep compliance expertise isn&#39;t required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading across multiple teams without direct authority, with excellent written and verbal communication in a remote, globally distributed organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to or building for US federal, state, or local government customers, or other highly regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with government or sovereign cloud frameworks, such as FedRAMP, StateRAMP/GovRAMP, BSI C5, or SecNumCloud, or with offerings such as AWS GovCloud, Azure Government, AWS European Sovereign Cloud, or GCP Sovereign Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with pricing and packaging across deployment models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability, monitoring, or other data-intensive infrastructure products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers, systems integrators, or cloud marketplace partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with open source software or commercial open source companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In Germany, the base compensation range for this role is EUR 124,571 &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- EUR 149,485&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
