&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture&#39;s CRM &amp;amp; Retention team as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior CRM Consultant, covering maternity &lt;/strong&gt;leave for one of our most senior consultants on our &lt;strong&gt;flagship HBO Max account&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll lead high-impact CRM and lifecycle marketing programs for one of our largest and most technically demanding clients, working across EMEA (and APAC). This is a hands-on role combining deep technical Braze expertise with senior-level client relationship ownership — you&#39;ll be the primary point of contact for key stakeholders, responsible for maintaining the trust and quality bar this account has built over several years, including award-winning campaign work (Braze Torchie Awards, People&#39;s Choice Award for CRM Campaign of the Year).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fixed-term engagement (approx. 5 to 12 months) starting mid-November to early December, allowing sufficient time to onboard and shadow before full handover.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Day-to-Day Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the senior point of contact for our client stakeholders, maintaining the level of trust, responsiveness, and strategic input the account is known for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead CRM Technical Architecture &amp;amp; Audits&lt;/strong&gt;: Conduct advanced audits of CRM setups, including taxonomy, event structure, API integrations, custom attributes, and webhook flows, ensuring accurate data flows and scalable architecture within Braze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maximize Braze Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: Deeply leverage Braze&#39;s advanced personalization and automation capabilities such as custom events, real-time triggers, Liquid logic, and dynamic content to maintain and evolve our clients’ lifecycle programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Lifecycle Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Own planning and execution of end-to-end lifecycle marketing strategies across channels (email, push, in-app, SMS), aligned to HBO Max&#39;s user journeys and business goals, including large-scale, high-profile campaigns (e.g. major content launches, live events).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate closely with Creative, Retention, Martech, and CRM Ops counterparts (both Phiture-side and client-side) to keep campaigns aligned and delivered on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; Technical Troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with client dev/data teams to validate event instrumentation, user segmentation logic, and troubleshoot CRM workflows, APIs, and marketing data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and implement A/B and multivariate tests across channels to optimize lifecycle touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze &amp;amp; Report on Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate retention/engagement KPIs and cohort behavior (via Amplitude, Mixpanel, or Looker) into clear, actionable insights and recommendations for both internal team and client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach where needed&lt;/strong&gt;: Support and mentor any freelance or junior support resources allocated to the account during the engagement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in CRM&lt;/strong&gt;, lifecycle marketing, or marketing automation, ideally for large-scale mobile/streaming or subscription products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with Braze specifically&lt;/strong&gt; - API usage, Liquid logic, webhook setups, custom events/attributes, and advanced campaign architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable performing technical audits&lt;/strong&gt; and working directly with client product/data teams on taxonomy, tracking plans, and event schemas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data literacy&lt;/strong&gt;: able to query and interpret data, build dashboards, and translate findings into recommendations, using tools like Amplitude, Mixpanel, Looker, or Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience owning senior-level client relationships independently&lt;/strong&gt; - this role requires stepping into an established, high-trust relationship with minimal ramp-up support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of retention/engagement mechanics&lt;/strong&gt; for large consumer/subscription products, including behavioral triggers, cohort segmentation, and monetization models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficient with HTML&lt;/strong&gt; for messaging templates and troubleshooting cross-device layout issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and confidence leading client workshops, meetings, and audits independently, including with senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt; (verbal and written).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available to start mid-November to early December&lt;/strong&gt;, for a fixed-term engagement of approximately&lt;strong&gt; 5-6 months&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with entertainment/streaming or subscription-based media clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with multi-market/multi-region CRM programs (EMEA + APAC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation design and testing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile squads or cross-functional pods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ASO and performance marketing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations &lt;/strong&gt;— Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Chief Business Officer organization drives company-wide growth and global expansion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the role that turns Airbnb&#39;s ambition for the UKI &amp;amp; Nordics into a plan and holds the organisation to delivering it: shaping strategy, aligning cross-functional teams, and driving sustainable commercial growth across one of our most important regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes recruiting and supporting high-quality Stays, Experiences, and Services, alongside executing Airbnb’s global market strategy. Shaping business approaches, quality supply sourcing, and international growth efforts are integral to the team’s success in connecting millions more hosts and guests to Airbnb&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the UKI, Nordics, Middle East and Africa team, covering one of Airbnb’s largest and most mature markets alongside five of Europe’s most digitally advanced, high-trust travel markets. The UK offers scale, brand strength, and a sophisticated regulatory environment; the Nordics offer strong domestic travel behaviour and significant headroom for growth. Together they make this one of the most commercially interesting regions in EMEA to build in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the business operations agenda for the UKI and Nordics. Airbnb’s most established European market alongside five high-potential Nordic markets (Sweden, Denmark, Norway, Finland). Partnering closely with the Country Manager, you will set the regional growth strategy, translate it into a plan cross-functional teams can execute against, and run the operating rhythm that keeps it on track. This is a high-visibility role: your influence will come from the quality of your thinking and your ability to mobilise teams to grow further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional growth strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the UKI &amp;amp; Nordics growth strategy end to end: define where the region should compete, what it should stop doing, and the handful of bets that will move guest nights, supply growth, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the annual and quarterly plan with the Country Manager, sizing opportunities and making explicit recommendations on where to deploy marketing spend, supply investment, and partnership effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and pressure-test the region’s targets, translating global goals into market-level commitments that supply, marketing, partnerships, policy, and product teams can own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run deep-dive analyses on demand and supply dynamics, competitive movements, pricing, and seasonality, turning each into a clear recommendation, not just a read-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and stand up new growth initiatives, using the UK as a test market for offerings that can then scale across EMEA, and the Nordics as a proving ground for high-penetration, low-friction market plays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the case for investment in the region: sizing, business case, and the socialisation needed to win resource in global planning cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating rhythm and execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the region’s operating cadence: weekly, monthly, and quarterly business reviews, so leadership has a single, trusted view of performance and the story behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert strategy into sequenced execution plans with named owners, milestones, and success measures across supply, marketing, partnerships, policy, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track delivery against the plan, surfacing risks and bottlenecks early and driving them to resolution rather than escalating them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and continuously improve the operating processes the region runs on, raising the bar on efficiency, transparency, and decision speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the region’s input into global planning and resource allocation cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the connective tissue between the UKI &amp;amp; Nordics team and global functions such as Product, Marketing, Communications, Policy, Finance, Data Science, Legal, and Community Support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the go-to decision partner alongside the Country Manager: the person other teams come to for the region’s position, context, and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment on high-priority projects, market launches, and product tests, brokering trade-offs between global consistency and local market reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent UKI &amp;amp; Nordics in NEMEA and global business operations forums, and bring the best of what other markets are doing back into the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Public Policy on the regulatory landscape, including short-term let rules in the UKI and Nordic city regulation so commercial plans account for policy risk and opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights and storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex data into clear narratives that help leadership decide with a recommendation attached.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting layer the region relies on: dashboards, performance packs, and executive materials, working with a dedicated analyst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the metrics that matter for the region and hold the team to a shared definition of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data-driven decision-making, and use AI tooling to compress the time from question to insight. Automating recurring analysis and reporting so the team spends its time on judgement, not assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To deliver in this role, Airbnb is seeking candidates with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in business operations, strategy, consulting, or commercial leadership, with a track record of owning outcomes in a market or business unit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to set strategy and drive it through to execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience influencing without authority across a global matrixed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical toolkit; comfortable working with finance and data science partners and interrogating the numbers yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication, with executive presence in front of senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, and a strong bias toward action and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical fluency with AI tools and a view on where they change how a team operates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the UKI and/or Nordic markets, or comparable mature-market experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a two-sided marketplace, travel/hospitality, or consumer tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching or scaling new products or lines of business in-market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role will require to be in the London office 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range shown below is annualized, is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom Annual Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£126,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£158,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll develop and deliver a scale customer onboarding experience for a high volume of customers in our commercial segments. You&#39;ll work closely with leadership to help design what scale onboarding can look like at Figma and expand our programs to support international sales teams. You will collaborate with other members of the Customer Onboarding team to inform and evolve the processes and materials for this program. Also, you will use metrics, customer feedback and direct experience to help identify new initiatives and materials needed to better engage and support our customers. You are an excellent communicator and project manager with a passion for customers and we can&#39;t wait to meet you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a full time role based in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own and manage scale customer onboarding programs supporting a high volume of commercial customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with sales, marketing and enablement teams to develop and evangelize the program within the Figma organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Guide customer goals and successfully drive a high volume of customers towards onboarding closeout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with Marketing, Operations and Sales to build and optimize scalable customer programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Report on metrics and customer feedback to assess the impact of successful onboarding and to help identify new customer initiatives and product opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop content and enablement resources for customers to use for training/education and to help accelerate product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Consult on product and industry best practices to act as a trusted advisor across a high-volume book of customers, inspiring new use cases for the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;4+ years of relevant work experience, ideally in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience managing customers through onboarding or implementation of technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with many customers at one time and demonstrated ability to drive towards successful customer outcomes through many programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven time management and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated comfort speaking to customers representing different personas across both function and seniority, as well as building and leading wide scale customer webinars, in collaboration with marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience using or working with Figma, or other UX/UI experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You embody our values and can thrive in a constantly evolving and growing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of adapting to new technologies and learning quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
